<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Ermiyaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ermiyaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ermi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ermiyaasa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ermiyaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermiyaasi, K.Y.S. 600 laytha heeran de7ida nabe. Ermiyaasa maxaafan qoncidi odetiday: Yerusalaame dhayo, xoossa keetha dhayonne aysiya daro asay di7etidi Babiloone baanaysa (shem 39, 52). Babiloone kawoy Yerusalaame katamanne xoossa keetha wursethi dhaysanape sinthe, Ermiyaasi Yerusalaamen de7is.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermiyaasi, daro wode eeqa goyinnonne enta nagara gaason Xoossa asaa bolla dhayoy yaanaysa odees. I odida tinbitetape baggati poletin, Ermiyaasi ba ayfen be7is. Leemisos, Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori Yerusalaame oykidi, katamanne xoossa keetha laallees; Yihuda kawoy daro asaara di7etidi Babiloone bidaysa be7is. Gujidika, asay di7ope simmanaysanne Isra7eele kawotethay simmidi eqanaysa Ermiyaasi sinthatidi odis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermiyaasi di7etidi Babiloone bibeenna (shem 40), shin Godoliya hayqidaape guye (shem 40—41), issi issi Yihuda asay iya wolqan Gibxe efin (shem 42—43), yan guutha wode de7is.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermiyaasika Hizqeelada Xoossafe ekida ba kiita mallaninne leemison odees. Danco shamo, he dancuwa moogo, qassi bookidi keso (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 13:1-11">13:1-11</ref></char>); macho ekona mela digetethi, asaara yeeho yeekona mela digetethi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 16:1-9">16:1-9</ref></char>), xugga shamonne Isra7eele cimata sinthan mentho (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 19:1-13">19:1-13</ref></char>); qambara gannan aathidi tooho (shem 27—28); ola wode gade shamo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 32:6-15">32:6-15</ref></char>); Rakaaba yarati woyne ushshu uyona ago (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 35:1-19">35:1-19</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermiyaasa maxaafa oyddu kifilen shaakidi be7anaw danda7etees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Iyosyaasa, Iyo7aaqeme, Yo7akinanne Sedeqiyaasa kawotethaa laythan Yihuda asaasinne enta kaalethiya asaas Xoossafe imetida qaala (shem 2—25).</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Dumma dumma tinbite qaalata, Ermiyaasa de7uwan poletida gita gita qofata, Ermiyaasa xaafey Baaroki xaafidi oykida guutha xuufeta (shem 26—45).</para>
  <para style="ipi">3. Dumma dumma allaga biitta asaas Xoossafe kiitetida tinbiteta (shem 46—51).</para>
  <para style="ipi">4. Yerusalaame oyketethanne asay di7etidi Babiloone baanaysa odiya taariketa (shem 52).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermiyaasi asaa bollanne biitta bolla dhayoy yaanaysa odida wode kawoynne kahineti iya boridosonanne wogi bayna goodidosona (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 11:18-23">11:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:18">18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:1-3">20:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:1-19">26:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:13-38:6">37:13—38:6</ref></char>). Ermiyaasi, asay Xoossara gelida caaquwa minthidi naagana mela odees (shem 30-33). Hizqeela mela Ermiyaasika kahinenne nabe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ermiyaasi ba asaa daro dosiyanne enta bolla iita pirdi yaana mela koyonna asi. Xoossay, I nabe gididi haggaazana mela xeegida wode I un7etidaysa bessiya xuufeti maxaafa giddon daro bessan qoncis. Xoossaa qaalay iya wozana giddon tamada eexiya gisho, I kammidi ashshanaw danda7ibeenna.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafan xaafetida gita gita tinbitetape issoti issoti metoy kumida Ermiyaasa wodiyape aadhidi, Xoossay immiya ooratha caaqoy poletiya wodiya sinthe xeelloosona. He wode ooratha caaqoy asaa wozanan xaafetiya gisho, akeekisiyanne naagisiya astamaare koshshenna. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">31:31-34</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Ermiyaasa xeegetethinne dooretethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 1:1-19">1:1-19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudanne Isra7eele bolla odetida pirda <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 2:1-25:38">2:1—25:38</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wordo nabetanne Ermiyaasa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 26:1-29:32">26:1—29:32</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ooratha caaquwan asay banta biitta simmana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 30:1-33:26">30:1—33:26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ermiyaasa dumma dumma haggaazota <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 34:1-38:28">34:1—38:28</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaamenne haariya Godoliya kundethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 39:1-42:22">39:1—42:22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ermiyaasi Gibxe biittan <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 43:1-44:30">43:1—44:30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ermiyaasi Baarokas ufaysa qaala immis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 45:1-5">45:1-5</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihuda yuushon de7iya kawotethata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 46:1-51:64">46:1—51:64</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaame kundethaba odetida hara kiita <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JER 52:1-34">52:1-34</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />Biniyaame biittan, Anatoota kataman de7iya kahinetape issuwa gidida Kalqe na7aa Ermiyaasa qaalay haysa. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" />Amoone na7ay, Yihuda kawoy Iyosyaasi kawotida tammanne heedzantho laythan Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako yis. <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" />Iyosyaasa na7ay, Yihuda kawoy Iyo7aqeemi kawotida laythatan Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako yis. Qassi Iyosyaasa na7ay, Sedeqiyaasi kawotin, tammanne issi laythi gakanawunne, ichashantho ageenan Yerusalaame asay di7etidi bida wodiya gakanaw Godaa qaalay iyako yis.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasa Xeegetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />Godaa qaalay taako haysada yaagishe yis: <verse eid="JER 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“Neeni ne aaye ulon medhetanaape sinthe ta nena erayis. Ne yeletanaape sinthe ta nena dummayada wothas; kawotethatas nena nabe oothada shuumas” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />Taani, “Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, taani na7a gidiya gisho waatada odetaneko erike” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Shin Goday, “ ‘Taani na7a goopa’; taani nena kiittiya bessaa bada ta kiita ubbaa asaas oda. <verse eid="JER 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Taani nena ashshanaw neera de7iya gisho entaw yayyofa. Haysa odey Godaa” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Goday ba kushiya yeddidi, ta doona bochidi, “Heko; taani ta qaala ne doonan wothas. <verse eid="JER 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Shoddanawunne laallanaw, dhaysanawunne shira yegganaw, keexanawunne tokanaw, asaa bollanne kawotethata bolla ta nena hachi shuumas” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Godaa qaalay taako, “Ermiyaasa, neeni ay be7ay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:11">Taani zaarada, “Lawuze mitha xam7a be7ayis” yaagas. <verse eid="JER 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />Goday, “Neeni like be7adasa. Taka ta qaala polanaw haysada be7ayis” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Zaaridi Goday, “Haraa ay be7ay” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Taani zaarada, “Issi pentiya xaaroy pudeha baggafe issi bagga gedi gidi uttidaysa be7ayis” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />Goday, “Pudeha baggafe dhayoy podhidi, biittan de7iya asa ubbaa bolla gukana. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Taani pudeha bagga kawotethatan de7iya asa ubbaa xeegana hanayis. Enta kawoti yidi, Yerusalaame geliya pengetan, dirsa yuushuwaninne Yihuda katamata ubban banta araata wothana. <verse eid="JER 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Yihuda asay tana aggidi, iita oothida gisho, hara xoossatas ixaane cuyisida gishonne banta kushen oothida xoossata goyinnida gisho ta pirdaa enta bolla ehas.<verse eid="JER 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />“Shin neeni giigeta! Dendada taani nena kiittiyaba ubbaa entaw oda. Entaw yayyofa; ne entaw yayyiko, ta nena enta sinthan gujada yashisana. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Hachi ta nena ha biitta bolla, Yihuda kawota bolla, halaqata bolla, kahineta bollanne ha asaa bolla gimbetida katamada, birata tuussadanne naase biratan dirida dirsada oothada minthas. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Enti neera oletana; shin ta ashshanaw neera de7iya gisho nena xoonokona. Haysa odey Godaa” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeley Xoossa Aggis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />Godaa qaalay taako haysada yaagishe yis: <verse eid="JER 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" />“Bada Yerusalaame asa haythan haysada yaagada awaaja. Ne na7atethan taw ay mela ammanetidako, ne buroo meddan de7iya wode tana ay mela siiqidaako, ta akeekayis. Neeni mela biittan zerethi zereti eronna biittan tana kaalladasa. <verse eid="JER 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />He wode Isra7eeley Godaas geeshshi; iyaw bayra katha mela. Iyape mida ubbay bala gidoosona; enta bolla dhayoy yis. Hessa odey Godaa” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Hinteno, Yayqooba nayto, Isra7eele zare, ubbay Godaa qaala si7ite! <verse eid="JER 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />Goday yaagees; kase hinte aawati taape ay bala demmidi taape haakidi bidonaa? Enti pathonna eeqata goyinnidi pathonnaba gididosona. <verse eid="JER 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />Enti, “Nuna Gibxefe kessida, mela biittan kaalethida, aaforanne mela biittara aathida, koshinne sakana dhumi de7iya biittara pinthida, oonika aadhonanne de7onna bessara kaalethida Goday awun de7ii?” yaagidi oychibookona. <verse eid="JER 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Hinte he biitta ayfiyape lo77uwa maana mela ta hintena aradda biitta ehas. Shin hinte yidi, ta biitta tunisideta; ta laata iisideta. <verse eid="JER 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />Kahineti, “Goday awunee?” yaagidi oychibookona. Ta higgey enta kushen de7iya asati tana eribookona. Deriya ayseysati ta bolla makallidosona. Nabeti Ba7aale eeqa sunthan tinbite odidi pathonna eeqata goyinnidosona.<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />“Hessa gisho, ta hintera buroo mootetana; hinte nayta naytara mootetana. <verse eid="JER 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Ane wuloha bagga bidi, yuushoy abban teqetida biitta Qophiroosa xeellite; doloha bagga bidi Qedaare biitta ase kiittidi xomoosite. Haysa melabay haysafe kase hanidaako be7ite. <verse eid="JER 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Enti tuma xoossata gidonna ixikoka ba xoossata laammida derey oonee? Shin ta asay entaw boncho gidida tana pathonna eeqatara laammis.”<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />“Saloto, haysan malaaletite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">dagammidi kokorite” yaagees Goday<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />Ta asay nam7u nagara oothidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">hessika, de7o pulto gidida tana aggis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Haathe oykanaw danda7onna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">xoo7e ollata bantaw bookidosona.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />“Isra7eeley shametida aylleyee? woyko son yeletida aylleyee? Yaatin, morketi ayis do7oda shankatoona? <verse eid="JER 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Iya morketi gaammoda iya bolla gudoosona. Enti banta qaala dhoqu oothidi daarosona. Enti iya biitta kaysi kessidosona; iya katamati laaletidi asi bayna soo gididosona. <verse eid="JER 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Hesaa bollaka Mempisanne Xafinaasa asati iya huuphiya meedidosona. <verse eid="JER 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Neno Isra7eele, oge ubban nena kaalethiya, Godaa ne Xoossaa aggada haysa ne bolla ehiday nena gidikii? <verse eid="JER 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />Nayle shaafape haathe uyanaw Gibxe buussi nena ay maaddanee? Efraxiisa shaafape haathe uyanaw Asoore buussi nena ay maaddanee? <verse eid="JER 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Hiza ne iitatethay nena seerana; ne tana kaddidaysi ne bolla pirdana. Ne tana Godaa ne Xoossaa aggidaysi ay mela iitanne camo gidiyako akeeka be7a. Ne taw yayiya yashshay baawa” yaagees Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />“Ta ne qambara daro wodepe kase menthas; ne qashuwa duuthas. Neeni, ‘Ta nena goyinnike’ yaagadasa. Dere bollanne daashsha mitha garsan laymatanaw zin7adasa. <verse eid="JER 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />Ta nena dooretida zerethafe ekada, lo77o woyne gaden tokas. Yaatin, waanada, guye simmada, woran dolida, iita woyne gidadii?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />“Ne sangeenora meecetiyakoka, saamunan gorpetiyakoka ne qitay ta sinthana. <verse eid="JER 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />Neeni waanada, ‘Ta tunabike; Ba7aale eeqa goyinnabike’ gay? Neeni zangaaran hanidaba xeella; ne oothidaba akeeka. Neeni yaanne haanne woxiya ziita keyida gimale mela. <verse eid="JER 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />Neeni bazzo meezetida, ziita wode carko singethiya hare mela. I amoy dendin, ooni iyo teqanaw danda7ii? Iya baw koyada gakiya gisho ay adde hareyka iyo demmanaw daaburenna. <verse eid="JER 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />Neno, Isra7eele, ne caammay wurana gakanaw ne kottonoy melana gakanaw hara xoossata geedo woxofa. Shin neeni, ‘Atto, hessi tana maaddenna. Taani imatha xoossata dosas; taani enta goyinnana’ yaagadasa.<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />“Kaysoy oyketida wode yeellateysada Isra7eele asay yeellatidosona; enti, enta kawoti, enta halaqati, enta kahinetine enta nabeti ubbay yeellatana. <verse eid="JER 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />Enti mithaako, ‘Ne ta aawa’ yaagosona; shuchaa, ‘Tana ne yeladasa yaagosona. Enti banta som7uwa aggidi, banta zokuwa zaaridosona. Shin enti meto wode nuna ashsha!’ yaagosona. <verse eid="JER 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />Shin hinte, hintew medhida xoossati awun de7oona? Hinte meton geliya wode hintena ashshanaw danda7iko dendidi hintena asho. Hinteno, Yihuda asaw, hinte xoossati hinte katamata mela daro” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />“Hinte taara ayis mootetetii? Hinte ubbay taw makallideta. <verse eid="JER 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />Ta hintena coo seeras; hinte hinte oosuwape simmiyaba gideketa. Koshatida gaammoda hinte mashshay hinte nabeta mis” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />Hinteno, ha wodiya yeletaw, Godaa qaala si7ite. Ta Isra7eeletas bazzo woyko sakana dhuman de7iya biitta gidadinaayee? Yaatin, ayis ta asay, “Nuuni nu sheneda baana; neeko simmoko” yaagidona? <verse eid="JER 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Geela7iya ba alleequwa, mushuriya ba ma7uwa dogay? Shin ta asay tana tayboy bayna gallas dogidosona. <verse eid="JER 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Neeni ne laggethota geedo wothaa waanada meezetadii? Daro iita maccasati ne ogiya tamaarosona. <verse eid="JER 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />Menthidi gelishin oykida asaa suuthan gidonashin xillo manqota suuthan ne ma7oy iitis. Neeni hessa ubbaa oothadaka, <verse eid="JER 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />Neeni, “ ‘Taani xillo; tuma Goday ta bolla hanqetenna; taani nagara oothabike’ giya gisho ta ne bolla pirdana. <verse eid="JER 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />Neeni ne ogiya laammashe ayis woxay? Nena Asoorey yeellaydaysada Gibxey yeellayana. <verse eid="JER 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Goday ne ammaneteyisata kawushida gishonne ne entafe maade demmonna gisho ne huuphiya oykada yaape keyana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />“Issi asi ba machiw yeddin, iya bada hara azina geliko, he addey iyo zaarii? Zaariko he biittay tuna gidennee? Shin ne laymatanaw koyada daro laggethotara de7adasa; ha77i neeni taako simmanee? yaagees Goday <verse eid="JER 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />Dhoqu gada aykoy bayna dereta xeella. Laymatanaw ne zin7aboona bessi de7ii? Arabe asi mela biittan utteysada, neeni laggethota naagada oge doonan uttadasa. Ne laymatethaninne ne iitatethan biitta tunisadasa. <verse eid="JER 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Hessa gisho, torche iray teqetis; sila irayka bukonna ixis. Hessi haninka, new laymatetha medhoy de7ees; ne yeellatonna ixadasa. <verse eid="JER 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />Ha77i neeni, ‘Ta aawaw, ta na7atetha laggiyaw ne tana siiqasa. <verse eid="JER 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />Ne ubba wode yilotay? Ne hanqoy merinaw aggennee?’ yaagasa. Shin ne oothanaw danda7iya iita ubbaa oothaasa” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanetona Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />Kawa Iyosyaasa wode Goday taako haysada yaagis: “Ammanoy bayna Isra7eeley oothidaba ne be7adii? Iya dere bollanne daashsha mitha ubbaa garsi bada yan laymatasu. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />Iya haysa ubbaa oothinka taako simmande gada qopas, shin simmabuuku. I michiya, ammanetona Yihudika hessa be7asu. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Ammanoy bayna Isra7eele daro wode laymatida gisho pirima immada iyo yeddas. Hessi haninka Isra7eele michiya, ammanetona Yihudi, yayyonnaysa ta be7as; iyaka keyada laymatasu. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />Laymatethay iw laafaba gidiya gisho, mitharanne shuchara laymatada biitta tunisasu. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />He ubban I michiya, ammanetona Yihudi simmidaba daanawusupe attishin, kumetha wozanape taako simmabuuku” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />“Ammanetona Yihudape ammanoy bayna Isra7eeley xillo. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />Bada pudeha baggan de7iya asaas haysada yaagada awaaja: ‘Ammanoy bayna Isra7eele, simma! Taani maaroti kumida Godaa gidiya gisho nena iita ayfen xeellike. Merinaw hanqetike’. <verse eid="JER 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Gidoshin, ‘Taani Godaa, ta Xoossaa bolla makallas. Allaga xoossatara daashsha mitha garsan laymatas. Ne qaala kiitetabike’ gada ne qohuwa ammana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />“Hinteno, ammanetona asaw, ta hintew azina gidiya gisho simmite. Taani issi katamape issinno, issi yarape nam7a doora ekada Xiyoone ehana. <verse eid="JER 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />Ta wozanaada hintena heemmiya henthanchota hintew immana. Enti hintena eratethaninne akeekan heemmana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />“He gallasatan hinte he biittan dariya wode asay, ‘Godaa caaqo Taabotiya’ gidi odetokona. I entaw qofetenna; hassayetenna; baynaysi entaw eretenna; harika oosetenna. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />He wode enti Yerusalaame, ‘Godaa Araata’ gidi xeegana. Kawotetha ubbaafe asay Godaa sunthaa bonchanaw Yerusalaame shiiqana. Hessafe guye, enti banta wozanaa iitatethaa kaallokona. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />He wode Yihuda asaynne Isra7eele asay gahetidi pudeha bagga biittafe ta hinte aawata laatisida biitta issife yaana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />“Ta hintena na7atho ekada, biitta ubbaafe lo77iyanne aradda biitta hintew immanaw koyas. ‘Ta aawaw’ gidi xeegananne tana kaallana gada qopas. <verse eid="JER 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Shin Isra7eele asaw, hinte ba azinaas ammanetona machida taw ammanetibeketa” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Enti banta ogiya geellayida gishonne banta Xoossaa aggida gisho manqo zumatape Isra7eele asaa waasoynne yeehoy si7etees. <verse eid="JER 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />“Hinteno, ammanoy bayna asaw, taako simmite. Hinte ammanetana mela ta hintena pathana” yaagees Goday.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 3:22">Hinte, “Neeni, nu Godaa Xoossaa gidiya gisho neeko simmana. <verse eid="JER 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Dereta bollanne zumata bolla eeqa goyinnoy tuma cimo. Tuma Isra7eele atotethay Godaa, nu Xoossaa. <verse eid="JER 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Nu na7atethafe doomin, nu aawati daaburidi demmida, enta dorsaanne mehiya, enta maccanne adde nayta yeellayiya eeqati midi dhaysidosona. <verse eid="JER 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Na7atethafe hachi gakanaw, nunne nu aawati Godaa nu Xoossaa bolla nagara oothida. Godaa nu Xoossaa qaala kiitetibooko. Hessa gisho, nuuni yeellan gufannanaw qassi kawushatethi afilada nuna kammo” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />Goday yaagees, “Isra7eele asaw, simmiko, taako simmite. Hinte tana shaatiya hinte eeqata ta sinthafe diggiko, ta ogiyape kare keyonna ixiko, <verse eid="JER 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />tuman, suuretethaninne xillotethan, ‘De7o Xoossay eriya mela’ gidi caaqiko, he wode kawotethati iyan anjetananne iyan ceeqana.”<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />Goday Yihudanne Yerusalaame asaako haysada yaagees: “Hinte othe biitta goyite; aguntha bolla zeropite. <verse eid="JER 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />Hinteno, Yihudanne Yerusalaame asaw, hinte Xoossaas qaxaretite; hinte wozanaa shoohuwa diggite. Hessi hanonna ixiko hinte iitatethaa gisho, ta hanqoy tamada eexana; iya oonika toysanaw danda7enna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pudeha Baggafe Dhayo Yaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />Yihudan awaajite; Yerusalaamen moyze punnite! Hinte qaala dhoqu oothidi haysada gidi waassite! Issife shiiqidi gimbetida katamatako yedhite. <verse eid="JER 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Asay Xiyoone baana mela mallite! Hinte shempuwa ashshanaw gam7onna baqatite! Gam7ofite! Ta pudeha baggafe gadonne dhayo biitta bolla ehana hanayis. <verse eid="JER 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Gaammoy worape keyeysada kawotethata dhayseysi ba bessaafe dendidi hinte biitta dhaysanaw yis. Hinte katamati laaletidi baysa gidana. <verse eid="JER 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Hessa gisho, kayo ma7o ma7idi, “Woo! Woo!” gidi zeleelitenne yeekite. Godaa suulliya hanqoy nu bollafe kichibeenna.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />“He wode kawanne halaqata wozanay til7ana; kahineti dagammana; nabeti hirgana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Taani, “Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, mashshi enta qoodhen wodhiya wode ‘Hintew sa7i saro gidana’ yaagada ha asaanne Yerusalaame ayis cimmay” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />He wode ha asaasinne Yerusalaames haysada yaagidi odetana: “Mela biittan de7iya aykoy bayna dhoqa deretape michiya carkoy ta asaa bolla carkana; hessi kathi geeshshanaasa gidenna. <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />Ta kiitan wolqaama carkoy carkana; ta enta pirdana” gees.<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Heko, morkey shaarada keyees. Iya para gaareti gote mela; iya parati arganthafe aadhidi eesotoosona. Nuna ayye! Nu dhayida!<verse eid="JER 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />“Neno Yerusalaame, attana mela ne wozanaa meeccada iitatethaafe geeya. Iita qofay ne wozanan awude gakanaw gam7anee? <verse eid="JER 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Daane katamaapenne Efreema zumaape yidaysati iitabaa awaajosona. <verse eid="JER 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />Yihuda katamata bolla ola awaajiya olanchoti haaho biittafe yuussaa bolla de7oosona gidi kawotethatas odite; Yerusalaameska awaajite. <verse eid="JER 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />I ta bolla makallida gisho, gaden de7iya kathaa naageysada olanchoti Yihuda yuushuwa teqana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />Yihuda asaw, hinte hanoynne hinte oosoy haysa ubbaa hinte bolla ehis. Haysi hintew seera. I ay mela cammi! Hinte wozanaa ay mela caddi!<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />Tana ayye! Ta haysa waata danda7ane! Ayye ta wozanaa! Ta wozanay kokorees; ta si77i gaanaw danda7ike. Taani moyze punonne ola girsi si7ida gisho si77i gaanaw danda7ike. <verse eid="JER 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Dhayoy dhayo bolla yees; biittay kumethi dhayis. Ta dunkaaney kundis; ta shaqarayka laaletis. <verse eid="JER 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Taani awude gakanaw ola malla be7anee? Awude gakanaw moyze puno si7anee?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />“Ta asay eeya; enti tana erokona. Enti qofi bayna nayta mela; entaw akeeki baawa. Enti iitabaa oothanaw cinca; shin lo77oba oothidi erokona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />“Taani sa7aa be7iya wode, sa7i aykoyka bayna baysa gididaysa be7as. Qassi salota xeelliya wode, poo7oy baynaysa xeellas. <verse eid="JER 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Ta dereta xeelliya wode enti qaaxoosona; taani zumata be7iya wode yaa haa woxoosona. <verse eid="JER 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />Ta xeelliya wode asi baawa; salo kafoti ubbay paallidi baqatidosona. <verse eid="JER 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />Ta xeelliya wode aradda biittay qaa7e gididaysa be7as. Godaa sinthaninne iya suulliya hanquwa sinthan he biitta katamati laaletidosona.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />“Biittay dhayana; shin ta iya kumethi dhaysike. <verse eid="JER 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Sa7ay yeekana; saloy dhumana. Taani odas; marsike. Taani qofa qachas; aggike” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Para asatanne donge asata waasuwan, asay katama ubbaafe baqatana. Baggati woxidi wora gelana, baggati zaalla bolla keyana. Katama ubbay baysi gidin de7iya asi dhayana.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />Neno, dhayos attidaare ne waanay? Ne zo7o ma7uwa ayis ma7adii? Worqa alleeqo ayis wothadii? Ne ayfiya siphintha ayis tiyay? Neeni coo nena loythaasa; ne laggethoti nena kadhidosona; enti nena wodhanaw koyoosona. <verse eid="JER 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Taani iqethi oykida maccasi waassiya waasuwa mela si7as. I waasoy koyro na7a yeliya maccasa waaso mela. He waasoy, Yerusalaamey shempo dhayada, ba kushiya miccada, “Tana ayye! Ta dhayas! Tana wodhanaw hanoosona!” yaagada waassiya waasuwa.<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s1">Suure Asi Baawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />“Ane Yerusalaame ogiya bolla keyite; pudenne duge hemetite; iya yuushuwa xeellitenne akeekite; iya gutaranka koyite. Xillo pirdiyanne tuma koya issi asi hinte demmiko, ta Yerusalaame maarana. <verse eid="JER 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />Enti, ‘De7o Goday eriya mela’ gidi caaqikoka, wordo caaqoosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />Abeeti Godaw, ne ayfeti tumaa xeellokonaayee? Ne enta shocadasa shin enta sakibeenna. Ne enta mentherethadasa shin enti simmonna ixidosona. Enti banta som7uwa zaallafe aathidi minthidi banta nagaraape simmonna ixidosona.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Hessafe guye, taani, “Haysati Godaa ogiyanne banta Xoossaa higgiya eronna gisho, manqonne eeya” yaagada qopas. <verse eid="JER 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Hiza, ta gita asatako bada entaw odana. Godaa ogiyanne banta Xoossaa higgiya eroosona. Shin enti ubbay iya qambara menthidosona; iya qashuwaka duuthidosona. <verse eid="JER 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Enta makallaynne enta kundethay daro gidiya gisho, gaammoy worape keyidi, enta wodhana. Suudhumey bazzofe keyidi, enta maana. Maahey enta katamata hokidi naagana. He katamatape keyiya ubbay puuzetana.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />“Taani hinte nagaraa ayis atto go? Hinte nayti tana aggidi, wordo xoossatan caaqidosona. Taani enta muzada kalsas, shin enti laymatidosona; enta keethan aqidosona. <verse eid="JER 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Enti dhiiketida korma parada, hara asa macho laggethanaw singethoosona. <verse eid="JER 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Tuma ta ha oosota gisho, enta seeranaw bessikina? Haysa mela kawotethaa bolla ta haluwa keyikina?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />“I woyne gadiya giddo gelidi iissite, shin kumethi dhaysofite. Enti Godaaba gidonna gisho I tasheta karidi yeggite. <verse eid="JER 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Isra7eele asaynne Yihuda asay kumethi kaddidosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />Enti haysada gidi Godaa bolla wordo odetidosona: “I aykoka oothenna; qohiyabay aybika nu bolla yeenna. Morke mashshay woyko koshi nuna polo demmenna. <verse eid="JER 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Nabeti carko mela; entan Xoossaa qaalay baawa. Hessa gisho, enti giyaba ubbay enta gako” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Hessa gisho, Isra7eele asaako, “Enti ha qaala odida gisho taani ta qaala ne doonan tama oothana; ha asay mithi gidana; tamayka enta maana” yaagees Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />Goday Isra7eele asaako, “Hinteno, Isra7eele asaw, ta hinte bolla haaho biittafe issi kawotethi ehana. Enta qaala hinte eronna, enta oday hintew gelonna wolqaamanne beni kawotethi. <verse eid="JER 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Enta donge pal7e shoohoy dooya duufo mela; enta olanchoti wolqaama. <verse eid="JER 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Enti hinte kathaanne hinte goshsha ayfiya maana; hinte adde naytanne macca nayta wodhana; hinte dorsaanne mehiya bonqana; hinte woyniyanne balase mithaa dhaysana. Hinte ammanetiya, gimbetida katamata banta mashshan olidi dhaysana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />“Gidoshin, he gallasatan gidikoka, taani ta asaa kumethi dhaysike” yaagees Goday <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Asay nena, “ ‘Goday nu Xoossay nu bolla haysa ubbaa ayis oothidee?’ gidi oychiko, ne entako, ‘Hinte tana aggidi, hinte biittan imatha xoossata goyinnidaysada, hinteka asa biittan haratas haggaazana’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />“Haysa Yayqooba asaas oda; Yihuda biittan awaaja. <verse eid="JER 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />Hinteno, ayfey de7ishin be7onaysato, haythi de7ishin si7onnaysato, eeyanne akeekona asaw haysa si7ite! <verse eid="JER 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />Hinte taw yayyanaw bessennee? Hinte ta sinthan kokoranaw koshshennee? yaagees Goday. Abbay aadhidi boonna mela shafe iyaw zawa oothiday tana? Zuley sugikoka iyape aadhanaw danda7enna; hobbey dendikoka kanthidi aadhenna. <verse eid="JER 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Shin ha asaas muumenne makalla wozani de7ees. Enti hara soo simmidi wora bidosona. <verse eid="JER 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Enti banta wozanan, ‘Nuus sila iranne torche ira woden woden immiya, kathaa shiishiya wode nuus immiya Godaa ane yayyoos’ yaagibookona. <verse eid="JER 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Hinte balay hessa teqis; hinte nagaray hintena lo77obaape ashshis” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />“Ta asaa giddon iita asati de7oosona. Kafo oykanaw naagiya asada hokidi naagoosona. Enti gite yeggidi asaa oykoosona. <verse eid="JER 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Kafo keethan kafoy kumidaada, enta keethay cimon kumis; enti wolqaamanne dure. <verse eid="JER 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />Enti ordenne modho gididosona; enta iita oosuwas zawi baawa. Enti yi7o nayta gisho mootetokona; manqotas suure pirdibookona. <verse eid="JER 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Yaatin, taani hessa gisho enta seeranaw bessennee? Haysa mela kawotetha bolla ta haluwa keyanaw bessennee?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />“Daro iitabaynne daganthiyabay biitta bolla hanis. <verse eid="JER 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />Nabeti wordo odoosona; kahineti enta zoriyan aysoosona. Ta asayka hessa melaba dosees. Shin wursethan hinte waananee?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaamey Morken Teqetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />Hinteno, Biniyaame asaw, hinte shempuwa ashshanaw baqatite! Yerusalaamepe keyite! Taquhe kataman moyze punnite! Beet-Hakareeman malla bessite! Pudeha baggafe iitabaynne gita dhayoy yaana hanees. <verse eid="JER 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Taani lo77iyanne ufaysiya Xiyoone katamata dhaysana. <verse eid="JER 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Henthanchoti banta wudiya ekidi yaa yaana. Iya yuushuwan banta dunkaaniya tokana; issoy issoy ba wudiya heemmana. <verse eid="JER 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />“Yerusalaame olanaw giigetite! Dendite! Iya seeta gallas oloos. Shin ayye! Sa7i qammees; omarsa kuyay aduqi aduqi bees. <verse eid="JER 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Hessa gisho, dendite! qamma olidi iya miixaa laalloos” yaagidi maqetoosona.<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “Mithata qanxite. Yerusalaame gimbiya miyen biitta doorite. He kataman naaqoy kumida gisho I seeretanaw bessees. <verse eid="JER 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Haatha olli haathe pulteysada ika ba iitatetha pultees. Makallinne dhayoy iya giddon si7etees; iya hargeynne madunthay ta sinthana. <verse eid="JER 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Neno Yerusalaame, ta seera eka. Akay, giiko, ta neepe shaaketananne ne biitta asi bayna baysa kessana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />“Woyne poshiliyada, Isra7eele asaa giddofe attidaysata loythidi poshilite. Woyne qoriya asada, hinte kushiya daashshata giddo zaaridi yeddite” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />“Ta ooddes odo? Oona seero? Ooni si7anee? Enti si7onna mela enta haythay tullis. Godaa qaalay entaw miichas attis; enti iyan ufaytokona. <verse eid="JER 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Godaa hanqoy tanan kumis. Ta ha sheniya teqanaw danda7ike. Oge bolla de7iya yooga nayta bollanne shiiqida na7atethata bolla ta hanquwa tiga. Machiya, azinaynne cimida asa ubbay attokona. <verse eid="JER 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />Taani he biittan de7eyisata bolla ta kushiya yeddiya wode enta keethay, enta goshshaynne enta macheti ubbay haratas imetana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />“Guuthafe gita gakanaw ubbay bana go77iyabaa koyees. Nabetinne kahineti ubbay cimmoosona. <verse eid="JER 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />Ta asaa maduntha pathonnaba oothidi guutha dhale wothoosona. Saroy baynashin, ‘Saro; saro!’ yaagosona. <verse eid="JER 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Enti ha shaatiya oosuwa oothidi yeellatidona? Akay, enti kumethi yeellatibookona; enti yeelli aybeko erokona. Hessa gisho, entika kundidaysata giddon kundana. Taani enta seeriya wode enta kawushana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />Goday haysada yaagees: “Ogiyan eqidi xeellite; beni ogey de7iya bessaa oychite. Lo77o ogey awun de7iyako oychidi iyan hemetite; hinte shempo demmana. Shin hinte, nuuni he ogiyan hemetoko!” yaagideta. <verse eid="JER 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Taani naageysata hinte bolla shuumada, “Moyze girsaa si7ite” yaagas. Shin hinte, “Nu si7oko” yaagideta.<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />“Hessa gisho, kawotethato, si7ite! Taani ta asaa bolla oothanaba akeekite. <verse eid="JER 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Sa7an de7iya asaw, haysa si7ite! Enti ta qaala si7onna ixida gishonne ta higgiya kadhida gisho ta enta bolla dhayo ehana. <verse eid="JER 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />Saaba biittafe ixaani woyko haaho biittafe yida sawoynne qimamey taw aysee? Hinte xuussa yarshoyka eketenna. Hinte yarshoy tana ufaysenna” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Hessa gisho, Goday, “Taani ha asaa sinthan dhube wothana; aawatinne nayti entan dhubetana; shoorotinne laggeti dhayana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />Goday, “Pudeha bagga biittafe olanchoti yoosona; issi gita kawotethay sa7aa gaxape dendis. <verse eid="JER 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Enti dongenne toora dancidosona; enti qadhey bayna wozana minotanne maarotethi eronnayisata. Enti paran gaallabiya wode abbada guummoosona. Hinteno, Xiyoone katama asaw, enti hintena olanaw salpidosona” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />Nuuni he odaa si7in, nu kushey argaacis; maccasi iqethi oykeysada nuna metoynne un7i oykis. <verse eid="JER 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />Morkey mashsha oykida gishonne yan han dagami de7iya gisho soope keyopite; oge bollaka bentofite. <verse eid="JER 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />Dhayseysi qoponna nu bolla yaana gisho, kayo ma7o ma7idi, bido bolla gondoretidi, asi ba issi na7as yeekiya mela ta asaas yeekite.<verse eid="JER 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />Goday Ermiyaasako, “Neeni enta ogiya xomoosana melanne paacana mela birata paaciya asada ta nena oothas. <verse eid="JER 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Enti ubbay zigiranaw yuuyosona; odin si7onna makallanchota. Enti naase biratadanne biratada mino; enti ubbay nagara oothosona. <verse eid="JER 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />Birata bolla de7iya shi7a xuuggidi geeshshanaw gilpey punnees. Shin geeshshanaw waayida waayey coo gidis; ta asaa giddon de7iya iitati kichibookona. <verse eid="JER 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Goday enta yeggidi aggida gisho, enti yegetida bira geetetana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s1">Biittan De7iya Iitatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Godaape Ermiyaasako yida qaalay haysa: <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />“Xoossa keetha pengiyan eqada, haysada yaagada awaaja. Hinteno, Godaa goyinnanaw ha pengetara geliya Yihuda asaw, ubbay Godaa qaala si7ite! <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: hinte ogiyanne hinte oosuwa laammite; ta hintena ha bessan wothana. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />‘Haysi Xoossa keethi! Haysi Xoossa keethi! Haysi Xoossa keethi’ yaagidi cimo qaalan ammanetofite. <verse eid="JER 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />Hinte, hinte ogiyanne oosuwa tuma laammiko, issoy issuwas xillo pirdiko, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />bete asaa, yi7o naytanne am7eta naaqonna aggiko, ha bessan xillo asa suuthu gussonna aggikonne, hinte qohetonaada hara xoossata goyinnona aggiko, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />ta hinte mayzatas merinaw immida biittan hintena wothana. <verse eid="JER 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />Shin hinte maaddonna cimo qaalan ammaneteta” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />“Hinte kaysoteeta, wodheeta, laymateta, wordo caaqidi markateeta, Ba7aale eeqas yarsho yarsheeta, haysafe kase hinte eronna hara xoossata goyinneta. <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />Yaatidi, ta sunthan xeegetida Xoossa keethaa yidi, ta sinthan eqidi, ‘Nuuni saro’ yaageeta. Shin ha shaatiya oosuwa ubbaa ootheeta. <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" />Ta sunthan xeegetida ha Xoossa keethay hintew pangati qosetiya gongolo gidetiyee? Hinte oothiyaba ubbaa taani ta ayfen be7as” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" />“Taani ta sunthay de7iya bessi oothada koyro doorida, Seelo biite. Ta asaa Isra7eele iitatethaa gisho, taani he bessaa waatidaako be7ite. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />Hinte ha ubbaa oothiya wode ta hintew zaara zaara odas; shin si7onna ixideta. Ta hintena xeegas; shin taw koybeketa. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Hessa gisho, ta Seelo bolla oothidaysada haysan hinte ammanetiya, ta sunthan xeegetida ha Xoossa keethaa bolla, hintewunne hinte mayzatas immida ha bessaa bolla hessada oothana. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Hinte dabbota, Efreema kochaa ta diggidaysada ta sinthafe hintenaka diggana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />“Ermiyaasa, ta si7onna gisho, ha asaas woossofa; enta gisho tana oychofa woyko waassofa; entaw gaannatopa. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Enti Yihuda katamataninne Yerusalaame ogetan oothiyabay aybeko be7ikiyee? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" />Nayti mithi mixoosona; aawati tama eethoosona; maccasati, ‘Salo Kawiw’ geetetiya eeqees uythi uukanaw dhiille munuqoosona. Enti tana yiloyanaw ushsha yarsho hara xoossatas gussoosona. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Enti haysa oothey tuma tana qohanaaseyee? Haysan qohetidi yeellatanay enta gidokonaayee?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />Hessa gisho, Ubbaa Haariya Goday haysada yaagees: “Ta hanqoy ha bessaa bolla, asaa bollanne mehiya bolla, gaden de7iya mithaa bollanne biittan de7iya kathaa bolla gukana; I eexana, to7anaw danda7enna.”<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: “Hinte xuussa yarshuwa hara yarshota bolla gujidi, ashuwa hintew miite. <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Ta hinte mayzata Gibxe biittafe kessiya wode, xuussa yarshobanne hara yarshotaba odabike woyko kiittabike. <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />Shin ta entako, taw kiitetite; ta hinte Xoossaa gidana; hinteka ta ase gidana. Hintew injetana mela ta hintena kiittiya oge ubban hemetite. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Shin enti tana si7onna woyko taw besse immonna ixidosona. Enti banta iita wozanaa qofaa kaallidi bidosona; sinthe baanaysa aggidi guye bidosona. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Hinte mayzati Gibxefe keyida wodepe doomidi hachi gakanaw ta aylleta, nabeta wonta wonta hintew kiittas. <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />Shin hinte tana si7onna woyko taw besse immonna ixideta. Hinte morgiya minthideta; hinte aawatape aadhidi iitabaa oothideta.<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />“Ha ubbaa ne entaw oda; shin enti ne giyaba si7okona. Ne enta xeegana; shin enti koyokona. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Hessa gisho, Ermiyaasa, ne entako haysada yaaga: ha kawotethay ba Godaa Xoossaa kiitetonna woyko iya zoriya si7onna kawotethi. Tumi dhayis; tumi enta inxarsan deenna. <verse eid="JER 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />Hinte huuphiya meedidi wora holite. Goday bana yiloyida yeleta ixida gishonne yeggidi aggida gisho aybika bayna dhoqa zumaa bolla keyidi zeleelite” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />“Yihuda asay ta sinthan iitabaa oothidosona. Enti ta sunthan xeegetida Xoossa keethaa tunisanaw taani ixiya eeqata ehidi iya giddon wothidosona. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" />Enti banta adde naytanne macca nayta taman xuuggidi yarshanaw, Hinooma Zangaaran Toofeta geetetiya yarsho bessa gimbidosona. Shin hessi ta enta kiittaboonabanne ta qofan baynaba. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" />Hessa gisho, he bessay Hinooma Zangaara woyko Toofeta geetetidi xeegeteysi attidi, Shuka Zangaara yaagetidi xeegetana wodey yaana. Moogiya bessi bayna gisho, Toofeti enti banta aha moogiya bessi gidana. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />He wode he asaa ahay salo kafotasinne sa7a do7atas kathi gidana; enta gooddana asika baawa. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" />Taani yethi, ufaysinne yaagano girsi Yihuda katamataninne Yerusalaame ogetan si7etonnaada oothana; biittay baysa gidana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />“He wode Yihuda kawota meqethay, halaqata meqethay, kahineta meqethay, nabeta meqethaynne Yerusalaamen de7iya asaa meqetha ubbay duufope maxetidi keyana. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Enti siiqida, kiitetida, kaallida, zore oychidanne goyinnida awa, ageenanne salo xoolintota ubbaa sinthan micetana. Enta meqethay shiiqenna woyko moogetenna; shin biitta bolla pito mela yegetana. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Ta laallida bessatan de7iya, ha iita kawotethaafe attida asa ubbay de7ope hayqo amotana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nagaranne Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />Goday haysada yaagees gada oda: “Issi asi kundiko, simmidi dendeneyee? Woyko issi asi oge baletiko guye simmenneyee? <verse eid="JER 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />Yaatin, ha asay ayis guye simmidee? Yerusalaamey ayis ubba wode oge baleetii? Enti cimo baqidi oykidosona; simmonna ixidosona. <verse eid="JER 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Ta minthada hayzas; shin enti tuma haasayokona. ‘Ta ay oothadina?’ gidi ba iita nagaraa paaxey issoyka baawa. Ubbay olas gaallabiya parada baw baw woxees. <verse eid="JER 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Hari attoshin, haatha kafoti banta wodiya eroosona; holleti, kaarotinne masqala kafoti banta simmiya wodiya naagoosona; shin ta asay Godaa woga erokona.<verse eid="JER 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />“Yaatin waanidi, ‘Godaa higgey nuura de7iya gisho nu cinca’ gaanaw danda7eetii? Wordancho xaafeti ta higgiya wordo kessidaysa be7eketii? <verse eid="JER 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Cincati yeellatana; enti kawuyananne oyketana. Enti Godaa qaala ixin, entaw ay cincatethi de7ii? <verse eid="JER 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />Hessa gisho, ta enta macheta haratas, enta goshsha allaga asas immana. Guuthafe gita gakanaw bessonna go77as yiiqetoosona. Nabetinne kahineti ubbay asaa cimmoosona. <verse eid="JER 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Enti ta asaa madunthaa laafa gidi, guutha dhale wothoosona. Saroy baynashin ‘Saro, saro!’ yaagosona. <verse eid="JER 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Ha shaatiya oosuwa oothishe, enti yeellatidona? Akay, enti aykoka yeellatibookona. Enti yeelli aybeko erokona. Hessa gisho, enti kundidaysata giddon kundana; enti seeretiya wode kawuyana. <verse eid="JER 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />Enta goshsha ayfiya ta entafe ekana. Enta woyne ayfey dhayana; balase mithaa ayfey bentenna. Iya boncoy shullana; ta entaw immidaba entafe ekana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />Asay zaaridi haysada yaagosona: “Nu si77i gidi ayis uttanee? Ane shiiqite; gimbetida katamata gelidi yan hayqana. Goday nu Xoossay nuna hayqos aathidi immis. Nu iya bolla nagara oothida gisho, nu wodhiya haathi uyana mela oothis. <verse eid="JER 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Sarotethi ufaysan naagida; shin lo77obay yibeena. Nu paxo amotida; shin dagama gidis. <verse eid="JER 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />Morke para garmamoy Daane kataman si7etees; enta korma parata caagethan biitti qaaxees. Enti biittanne biittan de7iyaba ubbaa, katamaanne kataman de7iya ase ubbaa midi dhaysanaw yidosona. <verse eid="JER 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />Taani shooshata hinte giddo yeddana. Biti teqanaw danda7onna haso shooshata hinte giddo yeddana; enti hintena dukana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />Ta azzanuwas minthethoy baawa; ta wozanay til7is. <verse eid="JER 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Ta asay haaho biittan waassiya waasuwa si7ite. Enti, “Goday Xiyoonen baawee? Ha Xiyoone Kawoy zaaridi yan deennee?” yaagidi waassoosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 8:19">Goday enta Kawoy, “Enti banta medhida misiletan, banta pathonna allaga eeqatan tana ayis yiloyidona?” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />Asay zaaridi, “Heko caka wodey aadhis; boney wuris; nuuni attibooko” yaagidi waassoosona.<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />Ta asay madunxida gisho, ta wozanayka madunxis. Ta kayotas; yashshi tana oykis. <verse eid="JER 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Galadan tiyetiya dhaley baawee? Yan aakimey deennee? Yaatin, ta asaa meqoy ayis paxennee?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />Hayqida ta asaas qammanne gallas yeekana mela ta huuphey haatha olla, ta ayfey pulto haathi gideerenne. <verse eid="JER 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />Enti ubbay makallanne laymatiya asi gidiya gisho, taani ta asaape shaaketada baana mela, oge asi aqiya bessi, taw mela biittan de7ereneshin.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />“Enti banta inxarsan wordo odetanaw ubba wode giigidi de7oosona. Enta biittan tuma gidonashin wordoy kawotis. Enti issi nagarape hara nagaran pinnidosona; tana erokona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />“Ishi cimmeysa, shooroy zigireysa gidiya gisho shooruwape naageto; ishay ishaa ammanetofo. <verse eid="JER 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Shooroy shooruwa cimmees; tuma odetey deenna. Wordo odetana mela banta inxarsaa tamaarsidosona; nagara oosona bantana daabursidosona. <verse eid="JER 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Ne cimo giddon de7aasa; enti banta cimuwan tana eronna ixidosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />“Hessa gisho, ta enta biratada seerisana; enta paacana. Ta asaa gisho, ta haraba ay oothanaw danda7iyana? <verse eid="JER 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Enta inxarsay wodhiya donge toora mela; enti cimon haasayoosona. Banta doonan issoy issuwara saro qaala haasayoosona; shin banta wozanan xihe wothoosona. <verse eid="JER 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Yaatin, ta ha hanotaas enta seeranaw bessennee? Taani haysa mela kawotethaa bolla halo keyanaw bessennee?” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />Taani dhoqa deretas yeekana; enta gisho waassana; bazzon de7iya hentha gadetas zeleelana. Enti dhayidosona; yaara issi asika aadhenna. Mehe waasoy si7etenna; salo kafotinne do7ati baqatidosona.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />“Yerusalaame katamaa laaletida keelanne workanati gupiya bessi oothana. Yihuda katamata oonika doonna baysa kessana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Haysa akeekanaw danda7iya cinca asi oonee? Hara asas odana mela Goday ooddes qoncisidee? Issi asika iya giddora aadhona mela biittay iitidi bazzoda oniday aybisee?<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />“Haysi haniday, entaw ta immida higgiya enti aggida gishosa. Enti taw kiitetonanne ha higgiya kaallonna ixida gishosa. <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />Hessa aggidi, enti banta wozanaa muumetetha kaallidosona; enta aawati tamaarsida Ba7aale geetetiya eeqa goyinnidosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Hessa gisho, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: “Taani ha asaa cammiya kathi muzana; wodhiya haathi ushshana. <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Enti woyko enta aawati eronna kawotethata giddon ta enta laallana. Enta dhaysana gakanaw mashshan yedethana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “Ane qopite. Yeeho yeekiya maccasata xeegite; zelelsi eriya asata ehite. <verse eid="JER 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Enti ellesidi yidi, nu ayfey afuthu holthu oothana gakanawunne nu ayfiya ciroy haathe pultana gakanaw zelelsi kesso. <verse eid="JER 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />Xiyoonen zelelsa girsi si7etees; ‘Nu dhayida! Nu kawuyida! Nu keethay laaletida gisho, nu biitta aggidi baanaw koshshees’ ” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Hinteno, maccasato, Godaa qaala si7ite! Hinte haythay iya doonape keyiya qaala hayzo. Hinte macca nayta zelelsi tamaarsite; issoy issuwa yeeho tamaarso. <verse eid="JER 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />Hayqoy yooga nayta ogen, na7atethata dabaaban qeexishe yidi, nu maskooteta gakis; nu miixaa gelis.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />“Asa ahi buureda denban yegetana; cakeysati cakidi guye yeggida katha mela enta oonika shiishenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />“Cinci ba cincatethan ceeqofo; wolqaami ba wolqan ceeqofo; durey ba duretethan ceeqofo. <verse eid="JER 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />Shin ceeqiya oonika tana eroninne akeekon ceeqo. Maarotethi, suure pirdanne xillotethi sa7a bolla oothiya Godaa, tana eridi ceeqo; hessi tana ufaysees” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />“Banta asho xalaala qaxaretida asaa ta seerana wodey yaana. <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" />Hessatika Gibxe, Yihuda, Edoome, Amoonenne Moo7abe asaanne banta huuphiya yuushuwa meedidi, mela biittan de7iya asa ubbaa. Ha kawotethati ubbay tuma qaxaretibookona; Isra7eele asa ubbayka banta wozanan qaxaretibookona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tuma Xoossinne Eeqata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Hinteno, Isra7eele asaw, Goday odiya qaala si7ite! <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />Goday haysada yaagees: “Hara kawotethata ogiya tamaaropite. Enti salo bolla malaata be7idi dagammikoka, hinte dagammopite. <verse eid="JER 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Enta wogay hada; enti worape mithi qanxoosona; masseysi kaltan massees. <verse eid="JER 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Enti biraninne worqan alleeqisosona; qaaxonnaada misimaaren dhishidi oythoosona. <verse eid="JER 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Enta eeqati leehe giddon kafo daganthanaw essiya malla mela. Enti odetokona; enti hemetanaw danda7onna gisho asay enta tookosona. Entas kumthi yayyofite. Enti qohanawuka maaddanawuka danda7onna gisho entaw yayyofite” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />Abeeti Godaw, ne mali oonika baawa. Neeni gita; ne sunthayka gitanne wolqaama. <verse eid="JER 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />Abeeti kawotethata Kawaw, nena bonchonay oonee? Cinca asaa giddoninne enta kawotethaa giddon ne meli bayna gisho new boncho bessees. <verse eid="JER 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Enti eeyanne eri dhayidaysata; enti mithafe massida, pathonna eeqatape ay tamaarona? <verse eid="JER 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />He eeqati Tarsesa biraninne Afeeza worqan alleeqetidosona. Enti ubbay kushe hiillanchotan oosetida woynenne kaalose daaniya ma7uwan kametidosona. <verse eid="JER 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Shin Goday tuma Xoossaa; I de7o Xoossaanne merinaa kawa. Iya hanquwan biittay qaaxees; kawotethati iya yiluwa danda7okona.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />“Haysati salonne sa7a medhiboonna xoossati sa7apenne salope dhayana” yaagada neeni entaw oda.<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />Ba wolqan sa7aa medhiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">ba cincatethan sa7aa essiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">ba akeekan salota micciday, Xoossaa.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />I, ba kooshincha sissiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">salon de7iya haathati guummoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">I shaara sa7a gaxape pude denthees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">wol7anthi irara yeddees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">carkuwa ba minja keethaafe kessees.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Asi ubbay era dhayidi eeyis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">worqaa sheeshiya ubbay ba eeqan yeellatis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Enti medhida eeqati wordo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">entaw shempoy baawa.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Enti pathonnabaanne hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:15">enti seeretiya wode dhayana.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Shin I ubbaa medhida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">Yayqooba Saama gidida Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">hessa mela gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">Isra7eeley, I baw doorida kawotethi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">iya sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaana Dhayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Hinteno, morkey teqidaysato, biittafe keyanaw hintew de7iyaba shiishite. <verse eid="JER 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />“Taani, ha wodiyan, ha biittan de7iya asaa kessada yambarana. Enta qohoy eretana gakanaw enta bolla iitabaa ehana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />Ta madunxas! Ta madunthay paxenna. Shin taani, “Haysi ta harge; ta danda7anaw bessees” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />Ta dunkaaney laaletis; iya wodoro ubbay duuxeretis. Ta nayti ubbay taape shaaketidi bidosona; enti baawa. Ta dunkaaniya zaaridi tokanaw woyko ta magarajuwa kaqanaw issi asika attibeenna.<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Henthanchoti eeyidosona; enti Godaa oychibookona. Hessa gisho, entaw injetonna ixis; enta wude ubbay laaletis. <verse eid="JER 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Ooratha odi yis; si7ite. Pudeha baggan de7iya kawotethan gita dirgoy medhetis. Iya olanchoti yidi, Yihuda katamata baysanne workanati gupiya bessi kessana.<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />Abeeti Godaw, asa de7oy iyaw buzo gidonaysanne ba ogiya suurisanaw iya shene gidonnaysa ta erayis. <verse eid="JER 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />Abeeti Godaw, tana seera; shin likera gido. Ta dhayonna mela ne hanquwan ta bolla yoopa. <verse eid="JER 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />Ne sheniya, nena eronna kawotethata bollanne ne sunthaa xeegonna asaa bolla gussa. Enti Yayqooba asaa midosona; enta mittidosona; enta biitta dhaysidosona.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s1">Naagetiboonna Caaquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />Godaape Ermiyaasako yida qaalay haysa: <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" />“Ha caaqo qaala si7ada Yihuda asaasinne Yerusalaame kataman de7iya asaas oda. <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" />Goday Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees gada oda. ‘Ha caaquwa naagonna asi oonika baadetidaysa gido’. <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />Taani kase hinte aawata Gibxe biittafe, birata seerisiya coociyape kessiya wode, ‘Taw kiitetite; ta hintena kiittiyaba ubbaa oothite. Hinte ta ase gidana; taka hinte Xoosse gidana’ yaagada odas. <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />Hessadaka, maathinne eessi goggiya biitta kase hinte aawatas immanaw, taani caaqida caaquwa polana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Taani, “Ero, Godaw, amin77i” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />Goday taako, “Ha qaalata ubbaa Yihuda katamataninne Yerusalaame ogetan haysada yaagada awaaja: ‘Ha caaqo qaala si7ite; iya kaallite. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Kase hinte aawata ta Gibxe biittafe kessida wodiyape hachi gakanaw, zaara zaarada, “Taw kiitetite” gada seeras. <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Shin enti ta qaala si7ibookona woyko taw kiitetibookona. Enti banta iita wozanaa kaallidosona. Ta caaqo qaala enti naagana mela kiittas; shin enti ixidosona. Hessa gisho, he caaquwa baadetha ubbaa enta bolla ehas’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Zaaridika Goday taako haysada yaagis: “Yihuda asaynne Yerusalaamen de7iya asay ta bolla maqetidosona. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Enti kase ta qaala si7onna ixida banta mayzata nagarako guye simmidosona. Enti hara xoossata goyinnidosona; entaw oothidosona. Isra7eele asaynne Yihuda asay ta kase enta mayzatara caaqida caaquwa menthidosona. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Hessa gisho, ‘Enti baqatidi attanaw danda7onna metuwa enta bolla ehana. Enti taako waassinka ta enta si7ike. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />He wode Yihuda asaynne Yerusalaame asay, ixaane cuyisiya banta xoossatako waassana. Shin meto wode he xoossati enta maaddokona. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Hinteno, Yihuda asaw, hinte xoossati hinte katamata mela daro. Qassi Ba7aale geetetiya yeellaya xoossaas ixaane cuyisanaw hinte giigisiya yarsho bessati Yerusalaame ogeta mela daro’ yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />“Ermiyaasa, ha asaas tana aykoka woossofa; enta gisho gaannatopa woyko oychofa. Enti banta metuwa gallas tana xeegiya wode ta enta si7ike.<verse eid="JER 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />“Daro asaara ba iita maquwa maqetashe, ta dosiya ta asay, ta keethan bentanaw bessii? Hinte hinte iita oosuwa oothishin, yarshetida mehiya ashoy hintena seerape ashshanee? Hessa gidiyako hinte ufaytanashin” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />Goday nena, dicciya, lo77o ayfe ayfiya shamaho yaagidi sunthis. Shin, I he shamahuwa wolqaama dada guunthan, taman xuuggana; iya tasheyka meqana.<verse eid="JER 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />Taani, hintena tokida Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, hinte bolla iitabaa ehanaw awaajas. Isra7eele asaynne Yihuda asay Ba7aales ixaane cuyisidi tana yiloyidosona.<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasa Bolla Maqetida Maquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />Goday enta maquwa taw qoncisida gisho ta eras. He wode enti oothiya iita oosuwa tana bessis. <verse eid="JER 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Taani shukas giigida dorsada hanas. Enti, “Ane mithaanne iya ayfiya dhaysoos. Iya sunthay hassayetonna mela iya paxa de7eyisata giddofe shoddidi diggoos” yaagidi maqetidaysa ta erabike. <verse eid="JER 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Shin abeeti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaw, xillo pirdeyso, asa wozananne qofaa shaakada ereyso, ne enta bolla ne haluwa keyada tana bessa. Taani ta qohuwa nena bessaas.<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Hessa gisho, “Godaa sunthan tinbite odopa ixiko, ne nu kushen hayqanna” yaagidi, nena wodhanaw koyiya Anatoota asaaba Goday haysada yaagees. <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “Ta enta seerana; enta panthati mashshan hayqana; enta macca naytinne adde nayti koshan hayqana; <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />entafe issoynne attenna. Ayis giiko, taani seeriya laythi Anatoota asa bolla iitaba ehana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasa Oysha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />Abeeti Godaw, ta neera mootetiya wode ubbanka ne xillo. Gidoshin, ne xillo pirdaba neera odetanaw koyayis. Iita asati oothiyabay entaw ayis injetii? Gene asati ayis duretidi de7oona? <verse eid="JER 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />Neeni enta tokadasa; enti xapho yeddidosona; diccidi ayfe ayfidosona. Enti nena doonape yeggokona; shin enta wozanaape ne haahon de7aasa. <verse eid="JER 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Shin abeeti Godaw, ne tana eraasa; tana be7aasa; ta nebaa ay qopiyako paacasa. Shuka dorsada, he iita asata goochada kessa; shuka gallasas enta dummayada wotha. <verse eid="JER 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Biittay ira dhayidi qohetannay, denban de7iya maatay melanay awude gakanaasee? Asaa iitatethaa gaason, do7inne kafoy wuris. Asay qassi, “Goday nu oothiyaba demmenna” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Zaaruwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />Goday Ermiyaasako, “Neeni tohon woxiya asatara gaaddetada daaburiko, parara waanada gaaddetanee? Ne saro biittan dhubetiko, Yordaanose wora giddora waanada hemetanee? <verse eid="JER 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />Ne ishati, hinte soo asati nena aathidi immidosona; ne bolla dendidosona. Hessa gisho, lo77oba odikoka enta ammanopa.<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />“Ta Isra7eele aggas; ta dooretida kawotetha yeggas; ta siiqiya asaa iya morketa kushen aathada immas. <verse eid="JER 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Ta doorida asay taw woran de7iya gaammo mela gidis. I ta bolla gudis; hessa gisho, ta iya ixas. <verse eid="JER 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Ta doorida asay ubba baggara phircoy teqida kafo mela gididosona. Bidi do7ata ubbaa shiishidi iya maana mela ehite.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />“Daro allaga kawoti ta woyne gadiya iissidosona; ta gadiya yedhidosona; ta lo77o goshsha baysa kessidosona. <verse eid="JER 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />He biittay iitidi oxis; ta sinthan melanne baysa gidis. Qadhetey bayna gisho biittay kumethi iitis. <verse eid="JER 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Mela biittan de7iya aykoka bayna dere kanthidi, bonqeysati yidosona. Godaa mashshay biitta ha gaxape ya gaxaa gakanaw mis. Hessa gisho, oonika saro attanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="JER 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />Enti giste zeridi, agunthu cakidosona; enti daro daaburidosona; shin aykoka demmibookona. Godaa wolqaama sheniya gaason enta kathay dhayis” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />“Taani ta asaa, Isra7eeles, immida biitta oykida, iita shooro kawotethata enta biittafe shoddana. Qassi Yihuda asaa enta giddofe kessana. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Shin enta biittafe shoddidaape guye, zaarada entaw qadhetana. Enta issuwa enta laata biittanne enta kawotethaa zaarada ehana. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Kase ta asaa Ba7aale sunthan caaqana mela tamaarsidaysada enti ta asaa ogiya tamaarikonne ta sunthan caaqiko enti ta asaa giddon minnidi daana. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Shin kiitetonna ixida kawotethata taani polo shoddada dhaysana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s1">Liino Danco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />Goday taako, “Bada liino qacinape dadetida danco shammada, ne xeessan danca; shin haathan boshisopa” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Hessa gisho, taani Goday kiittidaysada dancuwa shammada ta xeessan dancas.<verse eid="JER 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Goday nam7antho taako haysada yaagis: <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“Ne shammada dancida dancuwa ekada, Efraxiisa shaafa bada shucha qophon qosa” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Goday taw odidaysada efada, Efraxiisa shaafa lanqen qosas.<verse eid="JER 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Daro gallasape guye Goday, “Efraxiisa shaafa bada, ta nena, ‘Yan qosa’ gida dancuwa eka” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Taani Efraxiisa shaafa bada, dancuwa moogida bessaafe ekas. Shin he dancoy iitidi aykoka maaddonnaba gidis.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Hessafe guye, Godaa qaalay taako, <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“Taani Yihuda ceeqetethaanne Yerusalaame otoruwa haysada oothada dhaysana. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Ta qaala si7onna ixidi, banta wozanaa muumisidi, hara xoossata goyinnanawunne entaw oothanaw biya ha iita asati, ha dancuwada maaddonnaba gidana. <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Dancoy asa xeessi baqidi oykeysada Yihudinne Isra7eeley taara oyketidi, ta sunthaas galatanne boncho gidana melanne ta ase gidana mela oothas; shin enti si7onna ixidosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyne Xugga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />Goday taako, “Goday Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees gada oda yaagis: ‘Issi issi xuggay woyne ushshan kumana’ yaaga. Enti neeko, ‘Nuuni issi issi xuggay woynen kumanaysa erokoyee?’ yaagiko, <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />ne entako, ‘Taani ha biittan de7iya asa ubbaa, hari attoshin, Dawita araatan uttiya kawota, kahineta, nabetanne Yerusalaamen de7iya asa ubbaa, enti mathotana gakanaw woyne ushshan kunthana. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Taani enta, issuwa issuwara, aawa na7aara dom7ethana. Ta enta dhaysana; ta entaw keehike, qadhetike; enta maarike’ ” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otoroy Ehiya Meto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Haysa odey Godaa gidiya gisho hinte otoruwa aggidi si7ite; akeekite.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />I dhuma ehanaape sinthe, hinte tohoy dhumiya deriyan dhubetanaape sinthe, Godaa hinte Xoossaa bonchite. Hinte, “Poo7oy yaana” gidi naageta; shin I sakana dhuman laammana.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Shin hinte si7onna ixiko, hinte otoruwa gisho ta geeman yeekayis. Godaa wudey di7etidi bida gisho, ta yeekayis; ta ayfey afuthu gussees.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />Goday taako, “Kawuwasinne kawa aayes, haysada yaagada oda: Hinte boncho kallachay hinte huuphiyape kundida gisho, hinte kawotetha araatape duge wodhite. <verse eid="JER 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Negebe biittan de7iya katamati ubbay gordetidosona. Enta dooyanaw issi asika yan baawa. Yihuda asay kumethi di7etidi bidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />Goday, “Ane dhoqu gada, pudeha baggafe yeyisata xeella. New imetida wudey, ne ceeqetida dorsati awun de7oona? <verse eid="JER 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Neeni, new lagge gidana mela koydaysati nena xoonidi haariya wode woygay? Yelos keyida maccasada iqethi nena oykennee? <verse eid="JER 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />Yerusalaame, neeni ne wozanan, ‘Ha ubbay tana ayis gakidee?’ giiko, ne ma7oy qaaretidaynne ne bonqetiday ne nagaray darida gishosa. <verse eid="JER 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Tophey ba malaa woyko maahey ba gazzatethaa laammanaw danda7ii? Hessadaka, iita ooson meezetida hinte, lo77o ooso oothanaw danda7eketa” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />“Ta hintena bazzo carkoy efiya suullada laallana. <verse eid="JER 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Hinte tana dogida gishonne wordo xoossatan ammanetida gisho hinte saamaynne ta hintew immiya gishoy haysa. <verse eid="JER 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Hinte kalloy bentana mela ta hinte ma7uwa qaara yeggana. <verse eid="JER 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />Ne borso oosuwa, korma parada ziitas caageysa, yeelli bayna laymatethi, zuma bollanne denban ne oothiya ixetida oosuwa ta be7as. Yerusalaame, nena ayye! Ne awude gakanaw geeyonna daanee?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kosha, Mashshenne Bosha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Koshaba Goday Ermiyaasas odida qaalay haysa: <verse eid="JER 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“Yihuda biittay kayotees; iya katamati labbanidosona. Yan de7iya asati biittan uttidi yeekosona; Yerusalaamepe gita waasoy si7etis. <verse eid="JER 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Dure asati haathe tikanaw banta aylleta kiittoosona. Enti haatha ollaako boosona; shin haathe demmokona; banta otuwa mela tooki ekidi simmoosona. Haniyaba dhayidi yeellatishe, banta huuphiya guuluntoosona. <verse eid="JER 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Iri bukonna gisho biittay melidi za77is. Goshshanchoti yeellatidi, banta huuphiya guuluntidosona. <verse eid="JER 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Maati bayna gisho woshi7ey ba yelida galo mariw denban yeggada bawusu. <verse eid="JER 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Bazzo hareti aybika bayna dhoqa zumata bolla eqidi, workanada lafettoosona. Entaw miyabay dhayin, enta ayfey xeellanaw daaburis” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Asay haysada yaagidi woossis: “Abeeti Godaw, nu nagaray nu bolla markatikoka, ne sunthaa gisho, nuus issiba ootha. Nu nena aggidi daro wode guye simmida; ne bolla nagara oothida. <verse eid="JER 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />Abeeti Isra7eele ufaysaw, meto wode ashsheyso, ne imathada, issi qamma aqanaw gelida oge asada ayis hanay? <verse eid="JER 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Ne dagammida asada, ashshanaw danda7onna asada ayis hanay? Abeeti Godaw, ne nu giddon de7aasa! Nuuni ne sunthan xeegetida; nuna aggofa!” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />Ha asataba Goday haysada yaagees: “Enti toylatethi daro dosoosona; banta tohuwa teqokona. Hessa gisho, Goday entan ufaytenna. I enta iita oosuwa hassayidi, enta nagaraa gisho enta seerana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />Hessafe guye, Goday taako, “Ha asaa sarotethaas woossofa. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Enti xoomikoka, ta enta waasuwa si7ike. Xuussa yarshonne katha yarshuwa enti yarshikoka, ta ekike. Taani enta olan, koshaninne gadon dhaysana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Taani zaarada, “Abeeti Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, nabeti ‘Hinte ola be7eketa woyko koshi gakenna. Goday ha biittan polo sarotethi immana’ yaagosona” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />Goday zaaridi, “Nabeti ta sunthan wordo odoosona; ta enta kiittabike woyko entaw odabike. Enti hintew odey wordo qoncethi, pathonna kaayonne bantaw medhi kessida wordo haasayoosona. <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Hessa gisho, Godaa sunthan odiya nabeta ta kiittabike. Shin enti, ‘Oli woyko koshi ha biitta bochenna’ yaagosona. He nabeti bantaw olaninne koshan dhayana! <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Qassi tinbitey odetida asay koshanne ola gaason hayqana; enta ahay Yerusalaame ogiya bolla holetana. Enta woyko enta macheta, enta adde naytanne woyko enta macca nayta moogiya asi dhayana. Entaw bessiya waayiya enta bolla tigana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />Ta azzanuwaba ta asaas odana mela Goday tana kiittis. “Ta asay deshetidi, daro madunxida gisho, ta ayfey qammanne gallas qanxonna afuxana. <verse eid="JER 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Ta demba keyiko, mashshan hayqidaysata be7ayis. Katamaa geliko, koshan qohetidaysata be7ayis. Nabetinne kahineti banta oosuwa oothosona; shin ay oothiyako erokona” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Abeeti Godaw, ne Yihuda aggadii? Xiyoone asaa ixadii? Nu paxonnaada oothada ayis dechadii? Nu “Saro gidana” gidi naagida; shin aybika lo77obay bentibeenna. Nu “Paxana wodey yaana” gidi naagida; shin dagama xalaali gakis.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />Abeeti Godaw, nu iitatethaa erida; nu aawata balaa akeekida; nuuni nagara oothida. <verse eid="JER 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />Ne sunthaa gisho gada nuna kadhopa; ne boncho araata kawushofa. Ne nuura caaqida caaquwa hassaya; ne caaquwa menthofa. <verse eid="JER 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Kawotethata eeqatape issoy ira bukisanaw danda7ii? Saloy ba shenen puusanaw danda7ii? Danda7enna! Abeeti Godaw, nu Xoossaw, hessa danda7ey nena! Haysa ubbaa oothey nena gidiya gisho nenan ufaysi oothoos.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />Hessafe guye, Goday taako haysada yaagis: “Hari attoshin Museynne Sameeli ta sinthan eqidi woossiyakoka ta wozanay ha asaako simmenna. Enta ta sinthafe digga; enti boo. <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" />Enti nena, ‘Nu awu baanee?’ gidi oychiko, Goday haysada yaagees gada entaw oda: ‘Hayqos pirdetidaysati hayqos; mashshas pirdetidaysati mashshas; koshas pirdetidaysati koshas; di7etanaw pirdetidaysati di7etanaw boo’ yaagis.<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />“Taani oyddu qommo gadota enta bolla ehana yaagees Goday. Hessika, enta wodhanaw mashsha, enta aha goochanaw kanata, enta asho midi dhaysanaw salo kafotanne sa7a do7ata ehana. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" />Hizqiyaasa na7ay, Yihuda kawoy Minaasey Yerusalaamen oothida iita oosuwa gisho, ta enta sa7aa kawotetha ubbaas dagama oothana.<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />“Yerusalaame asaw, hintew oone qadhetanay? Hintew azzananay oonee? Hinte waanidetii? gidi hintena oychanay oonee?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />“Hinte tana aggideta; hinte guye simmideta. Hessa gisho, taani hinte bolla ta kushiya denthada hintena dhaysas; hizape ta hintew qadhetike. <verse eid="JER 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />Enti banta iita ogiyape simmonna ixida gisho enta katamata pengiyan pithe ekada harqas. Ta enta nayta wodha wursas; ta asaa dhaysas. <verse eid="JER 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Enta am7eta tayboy abba gaxan de7iya shafiyape daris. Taani seeta gallas na7atethata aayeta bolla dhayo ehana. Qoponna de7ishin, enta bolla dagamanne kokorsi ehana. <verse eid="JER 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Laapun nayti hayqida aayiya shempanaw xoonetada daaburasu. Iwu gallasi qammis; iya kawuyasunne yeellatasu. Paxa attidaysata enta morketa sinthan mashshan wursana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />Ta aaye, tana ayis yeladii? Tana ayye! Ta biitta ubban de7iya asaara kacciyanne baaxetiya asi gidas. Ta oodeska tal7abike; oodefeka tal7ada ekabike; shin asa ubbay tana baaddees.<verse eid="JER 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />Goday taako, “Tuma ta nena lo77o oosos ashshada ekana. Tuma ne morketi metuwa wodenne waaye wode nena woossana mela oothana. <verse eid="JER 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />Asi birata, pudeha baggafe yaa birata woyko naase birata menthanaw danda7ii? <verse eid="JER 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />Biitta ubban hinte oothida nagaraa gisho, hinte shaluwanne duretetha hinte morketas aathada immana. <verse eid="JER 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />Hintena eronna biittan hinte morketi hintena aylle oothana. Ta hanqoy miya tama gididi merinaw eexana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />Abeeti Godaw, ne eraasa. Tana hassaya; tana maadda; tana yedetheyisata bolla ta haluwa keya. Ne danda7an tana wora yeggofa. Ta ne gisho cayeteysa qopa. <verse eid="JER 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />Abeeti Godaw, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossaw, ta ne sunthan xeegetida gisho, ne qaalay taako yin mas. Ma simmin tana pashkisis; ta wozanaa ufaysis. <verse eid="JER 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Qelqiseyisata cugan uttabike; entara ufaytabike. Neeni ne kushiya ta bolla wothida gishonne ta bolla yilotida gisho ta tarka dumma uttas. <verse eid="JER 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Ta hargey paxonnay, ta madunthay melonnay aybisee? Ne taw eqiya shaafada, meliya pultoda hanayee?<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Hessa gisho, Goday haysada yaagees: “Ne taako simmiko, ta zaarada nena ekana; ne taw oothana. Hada oda aggada, boncho qaala xalaala odetiko, ne ta doona gidana. Enti neeko simmana; shin ne entako simmaka. <verse eid="JER 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Ta nena ha asaas naase biratan gimbetida gimbe oothana. Enti neera oletana; shin nena xoonokona; ta nena ashshana. <verse eid="JER 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />Iitata kushepe ta nena ashshana; qadhey bayna wozana mino asaape ta nena wozana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s1">Dhayo Gallasi Gakis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Godaa qaalay, haysada yaagishe taako yis: <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />“Neeni macho ekofa; macca na7anne adde na7a ha bessan yelopa. <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Ha bessan yeletiya macca naytabaanne adde naytabaa, enta yeliya aayetanne aawataba Goday haysada yaagees. <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" />Enti iita hargen hayqana; entaw yeekiya woyko enta moogiya asi bentenna. Enta ahay biitta bolla pito mela yegetana; enti mashshaninne koshan wurana; enta ashoy salo kafotasinne sa7a do7atas kathi gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />“Yeeho keethi gelopa; yeekanaw woyko qadhetanaw boopa. Taani ha asaa bollafe ta sarotethaa, ta siiquwanne ta maarotethaa diggas. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />Gitinne guuthi ha biittan hayqana; enti moogetokona. Oonika entaw yeekenna; oonika bana gaarenna woyko huuphe meedetidi kayotenna. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Yeekiya asaas shochu efidi, entara issife midi uyidi, kayuwa balethiya asi issoyka deenna. Hari attoshin, aayiya woyko aawi hayqida asaaka minthethiya asi baawa.”<verse eid="JER 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />“Entara maanawunne uyanaw gibiri de7iya keethi gelopa. <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: ‘Taani ufaysinne ililsi, yaagano yethi ha bessaafe diggana. Hessa asay banta laythaninne banta ayfiyan be7ana.’ ”<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />“Ne ha qaala ubbaa asaas odiya wode, enti, ‘Goday ayis haysa mela iitabaa nu bolla awaajidee? Nu ay balido? Godaa, nu Xoossaa bolla nu ay nagara oothido?’ ” yaagana. <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />He wode ne entako; “Hinte aawati tana aggida gishosa, enti hara xoossata kaallida gishosa, entaw oothidanne goyinnida gishosa, tana aggidi ta higgiya naagonna ixida gishosa. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Hinte, hinte aawatape aadhidi iita oothida gishosa. Hinte issoy issoy ero goonna hinte iita wozanaa kaallideta; taw kiitetonna ixideta. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Hessa gisho, ta hintena ha biittafe denthada, hinte woyko hinte aawati eronna biitta holana. Yan hinte hara xoossata gallasinne qamma haggaazana; taani hintew qadhetike” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />Asay, “Isra7eele asaa Gibxe biittafe kessida Goday eriya mela” yaagidi caaqonna wodey yaana. <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />Hessa aggidi, “ ‘Isra7eele asaa pudeha bagga biittafenne enta laallida biitta ubbaafe zaaridi ehida Goday eriya mela’ yaagidi caaqana. Taani enta kase enta aawatas immida biitta zaarada ehana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />“Ta molo oykiya daro asaa kiittana; enti enta oykana. Hessafe guye, daro shankatiya asaa kiittana; derepe, zumapenne shucha qophope enta shankatidi kessana. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Ta ayfey enta ogiya bolla de7ees; enti taape qosetibookona; enta nagaray ta sinthafe geemmibeenna. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Ta enta iitatethaanne enta nagaraa gisho entaw nam7u kushe zaarana. Enti aha daaniya banta ixetida eeqatan ta biitta tunisidosona; shaatiya banta misiletan ta laata kunthidosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />Abeeti Godaw, ta wolqaw, ta miixaw, meto gallas ta baqatada attiya bessaw, kawotethati sa7aa gaxape neeko yidi, “Nu aawati pathonnanne maaddonna wordo xoossata xalaala laattidosona. <verse eid="JER 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Asay bantaw xoossata medhanaw danda7oona? Ee, enti medhiyakoka tuma xoossata gidokona!” yaagana.<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />“Hessa gisho, ta enta tamaarsana; ta wolqaanne ta gitatetha enta erisana. He wode enti ta sunthay Godaa gideysa erana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />“Yihuda nagaray birata biiren xaafetis; enta wozanaa bollanne yarsho bessan de7iya kaciya bolla almaaze geetetiya shucha xeeran xaafetis. <verse eid="JER 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />Enta nayti irxa mitha garsan, zumata bollanne dereta bolla giigisida yarsho bessan Asheera geetetiya xoossees essida misiliya goyinnoosona. <verse eid="JER 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />Hinte biitta bolla oothida nagaraa acuwa qanxisanaw hinte shaluwanne hinte miishiya hinte morketas immana. <verse eid="JER 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Hinte merinaw eexiya ta sheniya denthethida gisho, hintena laatisida biittafe shoddana; hinte eronna biittan hinte morketas aylle oothana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />Goday haysada yaagees: “Asan ammanetey, asho ma7ida asan ceeqeteynne ba wozanaa Xoossafe haassey baadetidaysa gido. <verse eid="JER 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />Hessa mela asi bazzon de7iya tushe mela; lo77obay yaa wode I be7enna. I bazzon, mela bessan, asi doonna maxine biittan daana.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />“Godan ammanetiya asi, iya ceeqoy Godaa gidida asi anjetidaysa. <verse eid="JER 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />I haatha matan toketidi, ba xaphuwa goggiya haathan yeddida mitha mela. I awa suulas yayyenna. He mithaa haythay cil7oshin de7ees. Iri bukonna laythan hirgenna; ubba wode ayfe aggenna.<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />“Asa wozani ubbaafe aadhidi cimmeesinne iita; iya gaatha qofaa ooni eranaw danda7ii? <verse eid="JER 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />Taani Goday, asa ubbaas iya ogiyadanne iya oosuwada immanaw, asa wozanaa pilgayis; iya kahaa paacayis” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Bessonna ogen shalo shiishiya asi babaa gidonna phuuphulle qoxiya kuraacho mela. Ba laytha bagga zawan aggidi baana; wursethan iya eeyatethay qoncana.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Nu Xoossa keethay koyrope doomidi, boncho kawotetha araatada dhoqa deriya bolla de7ees. <verse eid="JER 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />Abeeti Godaw, Isra7eele ufaysaw, nena aggida ubbay yeellatana. De7o pulto haatha, nena Godaa enti aggida gisho baanan xaafetida sunthada dhayana.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />Abeeti Godaw, ne ta galataa gidiya gisho, tana patha; ta paxana; tana ashsha; ta attana.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Asay taako, “ ‘Goday taw odis’ yaagada ne odida qaalay awun de7ii? I ayis poletennee?” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />Taani henthancho gidada nena haggaazo aggabike; enti metootana gallasaa ta amottabike. Ta doonape keyida qaala ne eraasa. <verse eid="JER 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />Tana daganthofa; meto gallas taani baqatada attiya bessay nena. <verse eid="JER 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Tana yedetheysati yeellato; shin tana yeellayopa. Enta dagantha; shin tana daganthofa. Enta bolla meto eha; enta nam7u kushe seera.<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambaata Bonchite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />Goday taako, “Koyro bada Yihuda kawoti katamaa geliyanne keyiya, asay geliya pengiyaninne hara Yerusalaame pengeta ubban eqa. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />Asaako haysada yaaga: ‘Hinteno Yihuda kawoto, hinteno Yihuda asaw, hinteno Yerusalaame asaw, ha pengetara geliya asaw, ubbay Godaa qaala si7ite. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" />Sambaata gallas tooho tookidi Yerusalaame pengiyara gelonna mela naagetite. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" />Sambaata gallas hinte keethaafe tooho tookidi kessofite, woyko aybi oosoka oothopite. Kase hinte aawata ta kiittidaysada Sambaata gallas bonchite. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Gidoshin, enti si7ibookona; banta haythaa taako zaaribookona. Enti tana si7onnanne taape tamaaronna ixidosona. <verse eid="JER 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />Shin hinte taw kiitetiko, Sambaata gallasan tooho tookidi, ha katamaa pengetara gelonna aggiko, Sambaata gallas aykoka oothonna dummayidi bonchiko, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />Dawita araatan uttiya kawoti banta moorinnatara paratanne para gaareta toggidi, ha pengetara gelana. Enti Yihuda asaaranne Yerusalaame kataman de7iya asaara gelana; ha katamay merinaw asi de7iya katama gidana. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Asay xuussa yarsho, hara yarsho, katha yarsho, ixaanenne galata yarsho ekidi, Yihuda katamatape, Yerusalaame yuushuwan de7iya gutatape, Biniyaame biittafe, gadhape, derey dariya biittafenne, Negebape Godaa Xoossa keethaa yaana. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Shin hinte Sambaata gallasa dummayidi bonchona aggidi, Sambaata gallasan tooho tookidi, Yerusalaame pengetara gelidi, ta higgiya menthiko, ta he pengetan tama oythana. Yerusalaame kawo keethata maana; he tamay to7enna’ ” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi Oto Medhiya Keethan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />Godaape Ermiyaasako yida qaalay haysa: <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“Dendada urqa medhiya addiya soo ba. Yan ta nena ta qaala sissana” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Taani duge urqa medhiya addiya soo bada, I ba gertuwa bolla urqa medhishin be7as. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />I medhishin, he miishey iya kushen iitis. I he urqa zaaridi munuqidi, bana lo77iya hara miishe kessidi medhis.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />He wode Godaa qaalay, haysada yaagishe taako yis: <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />“Isra7eele asaw, urqa medhiya addey ootheysada ta hintena oothanaw danda7ikina? Isra7eele asaw, urqay bana medheysa kushen de7eysada, hinteka ta kushen de7eeta. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" />Issi kawotethi woyko issi derey shodetana mela, laaletana melanne dhayana mela ta odida wode, <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" />he kawotethay ba iitatethaafe simmiko, ta enta bolla ehana gida iitabaa ehonna aggaagana. <verse eid="JER 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Qassi hara wode issi deriya woyko kawotethaa, ‘Ta hintena keexananne tokana’ gada odida wode, <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />he kawotethay ta odeysa si7onna ixidi, ta sinthan iitabaa oothiko, ta oothana gida lo77oba oothonna aggaagana.<verse eid="JER 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />“Hessa gisho, Yihuda asaasinne Yerusalaamen de7iya asaas haysada yaaga. Taani hintew dhayo giigisaysinne iitabaa halchayis. Hinte ubbay hinte iita ogiyape simmite; hinte ogiyanne hinte oosuwa laammite. <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Shin enti, ‘Haysi aykoka maaddenna! Nuuni nu qofaada hanana; nu issoy issoy nu iita wozanaa kaallana’ yaagana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />Hessa gisho, “Goday, ‘Haysa melaba si7i ereetii?’ yaagidi kawotethata oychite. Geela7o gidida Isra7eeley daro shaatiyaba oothasu. <verse eid="JER 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Libaanose zuma bolla de7iya shachay, zaalla bollafe dhayidi erii? He zumaape goggiya irxa haathi meli erii? <verse eid="JER 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Shin ta asay tana dogidosona; pathonna xoossatas ixaane cuyisidosona. Banta ogiyape, banta beni ogiyape, gaxa keyidi dhubetidosona. <verse eid="JER 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Enti banta biitta baysanne kadhetidaba kessidosona. Yaara aadhiya oonika malaaletidi ba huuphiya qaathees. <verse eid="JER 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Baani doloha bagga carkuwan laaleteysa mela, taani ta asaa morketa sinthan laallana. Enta metuwa gallas ta entaw zoko zaaranaape attishin, ta som7uwa enta bessike” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Asay, “Kahineta matan higgey, cincata matan zorey, nabeta matan qaali dhayonna gisho ane Ermiyaasa bolla maqetoos. Nu inxarsan oykoos; I odiya qaala si7onna ixana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />Abeeti Godaw, tana si7a; ta morketi ta bolla giyaba hayza. <verse eid="JER 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Lo77o oothida asas zaaroy iiteyee? Shin enti taw olla bookosona. Ne hanqoy entafe simmana mela ta enta gisho gaannateysa be7a. <verse eid="JER 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Hessa gisho, enta nayta koshas aathada imma; enta mashshas aathada imma. Enta macheti na7i baynaysatanne am7o gido. Enta addeti wodhiya hargen gahetonna; enta na7atethati olan wuro. <verse eid="JER 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Enti tana oykanaw olla bookida gishonne ta tohuwas xihe wothida gisho, qoponna bonqeyisata enta bolla yedda; enta keethan waasoy keyo. <verse eid="JER 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Shin abeeti Godaw, enti tana wodhanaw maqeteysa ne eraasa. Ne enta iitatethaa atto goopa woyko enta nagaraa ne sinthafe quchofa. Enti ne sinthan xoonetidi kundo; ne shenetiya wode enta haysada ootha.<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="s1">Meqida Xugga leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />Goday taako, “Bada oto medheysafe xugga shamma. Neera guutha biitta cimatanne guutha kahine cimata ekada, <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" />Kun7a Me7o Pengiya matara aadhada, Hinooma Zangaara ba; yan ta new odiya qaala awaaja. <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />‘Hinteno, Yihuda kawoto, hinteno Yerusalaame katama asaw, Godaa qaala si7ite!’ Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: ‘Si7iya ubbaa haythas iitiya palaba ha biitta bolla ta ehana.’ <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Ha asay tana aggidi, enti woyko enta aawati woyko Yihuda kawoti eronna hara xoossatas ixaane cuyisidi ha bessaa tunisidosona. Enti xillo asaa suuthaa ha bessan gussidosona. <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" />Ta enta kiittonaba woyko entaw odonnaba woyko ta qoponnaba oothidosona; banta adde nayta nagaras taman xuussa yarsho oothidi yarshanaw, dhoqa goyinno bessata gimbidosona. <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Hessa gisho, ha bessay Toofeta woyko Hinooma Zangaara geeteteysi attidi, Shuha Zangaara yaagetidi xeegetana gallasay yaana. <verse eid="JER 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />Yihudanne Yerusalaame asaa halchuwa ta ha bessan laallana. Enti banta morketa mashshaninne bantana wodhanaw koyiya asaa kushen hayqanaada oothana. Enta aha salo kafotasinne sa7a do7atas kathi oothada immana. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Taani ha katamaa baysanne miichas kessana. Yaara aadhiya ubbay iya dhayuwan malaaletidi, ‘Poora’ yaagana. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Enti banta macca naytanne adde nayta ashuwa maanada oothana. Enta wodhanaw koyiya morketi enta teqidi waaysiya wode un7etidi enti issoy issuwa ashuwa maana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />“Hessafe guye, neera bida asaa sinthan xuggaa mentha. <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" />Entako haysada yaaga: xuggay meqidaysadanne zaaridi koolanaw danda7etonnaysada ta ha kawotethaanne ha katamaa mentherethana. Asi aha moogiya bessi bayna gisho Toofetan moogetana. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Ha bessaaninne iyan de7iya asaa bolla haysa oothana. Ha katamaa Toofetada oothana. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />Yerusalaame asaa keethatinne Yihuda kawota keethati, keethaa bolla dembayidi oothida bessan salo xoolintotas ixaane cuyisidanne hara xoossatas ushsha yarsho gussida keethati ubbay Toofetada tuna gidana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />“Hessafe guye, Ermiyaasi Goday tinbite odana mela kiitida Toofetape simmidi, Xoossa keetha giddon de7iya dabaaban eqidi asa ubbaako haysada yaagis: <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />Enti morgiya gabbisidi, ta odiyaba si7onna ixida gisho ha katamaa bollanne iya heeran de7iya gutata bolla ehana gida iitabaa ubbaa ehana hanayis” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasanne Phaskora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />He wode Godaa keethaanne halaqa gidiya, Imera na7aa kahiniya Phaskori Ermiyaasi tinbite odishin si7is. <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />Phaskori nabiya Ermiyaasa deshisidi, Qommo Biniyaame Pengiyan Xoossa keethaa geliya pengen gonge luhon qashisis. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Wontetha gallas Phaskori Ermiyaasa qashope birshin, Ermiyaasi iyaw haysada yaagis: “Hachife doomin, Goday ne sunthaa Phaskori yaagenna; I ne sunthaa ‘Yan Han Dagama’ yaagana. <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Goday haysada yaagees: ‘Taani nena, newunne ne laggeta ubbaas dagama oothana. Enti neeni xeellishin, banta morketa mashshan wurana. Taani Yihuda asa ubbaa Babiloone kawa kushen aathada immana. I enta di7idi, Babiloone efidi, yan mashshan wodhana. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Hessadaka, ha katama shaluwanne duretetha ubbaa, oyki yedhidaba ubbaa, haaridaba ubbaanne Yihuda kawota miishiya ubbaa taani enta morketas aathada immana; enti enta bonqidi Babiloone efana. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Qassi neeni Phaskori, ne son de7iya asa ubbay di7etidi, Babiloone baana. Neeni wordo tinbite odida ne laggeta ubbaaraka yan hayqananne yan moogetana’ yaagees” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasa Mootuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />Abeeti Godaw, neeni tana cimmadasa; taanika cimetas. Neeni taape minnada, tana xoonadasa. Gallasa kumetha taani asa miichas attas; ubbay tana qelqisis. <verse eid="JER 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Taani haasaya wode ubban, “Makallabaynne dhayoy gakis” gada waassayis. Godaa qaalay taw gallas gallas borenne qelqisethi ehis. <verse eid="JER 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />Taani, “Taani GODAABA denthada odike” woyko, “Iya sunthan nam7antho odike” giiko, Godaa qaalay ta meqethaa giddon qum7etidi, eexiya tama mela gididi, ta wozanan michees. Taani giddon oykada ashshona gada daaburas; shin teqanaw danda7abike. <verse eid="JER 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Taani daro kalkasha si7as; “Yan han dagami de7ees! Ane iya mootite! Nuunika iya mootoos” yaagosona. Taw mata laggeti ubbay ta kundethaa naagidi, “Ooni eri, nuuni iya oykana melanne nu haluwa keyana mela, I cimmanaw danda7ees” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Shin Goday yashisiya toora qaradan taara de7ees. Hessa gisho, tana yedetheysati dhubetana; enti tana xoonokona. Entaw giigonna gisho, enti gita yeella yeellatana. Enta kawushay kumthi dogetenna. <verse eid="JER 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />Abeeti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaw, xillota paaceyso, wozananne kaha be7eyso, neeni ta morketa bolla ne haluwa keyada tana bessa. Ayis giiko, taani ta mootuwa new aathas.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />Godaas yexite! Godaa galatite! ayis giiko, I manqota iitata kushepe ashshees.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />Taani yeletida gallasay baadetidaysa gido! Ta aayiya tana yelida gallasay anjetofo! <verse eid="JER 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />Ta aawas, “New mishiraacho; new adde na7i yeletis!” yaagi odidi, daro ufaysida urayka baadetidaba gido! <verse eid="JER 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />He addey Goday qadhetonna aathidi yeggidi dhaysida katamatada hano. He addey wonta waasuwa, gallas seetan, “Olay gakis!” giya odaa si7o. <verse eid="JER 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />Ayis giiko, ta aayiya taw duufo gidana melanne I uloyka tana merinaw oyki uttana mela, tana ulon wodhibeenna. <verse eid="JER 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Taani metonne azzano be7anawunne laytha ubbaa yeellatashe wursanaw, ayis ta aaye ulope keyadina?<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kawa Sedeqiyaasas Imetida Zaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />Kawoy Sedeqiyaasi Malkiya na7aa Phaskoranne Ma7iseya na7aa kahiniya Sofoniyaasa kiitida wode, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis: <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" />Enti, “Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori ba olanchotara ha katamaa teqida gisho nuus Godaa oycha. Ooni eri, Goday beniysada malaalsiya oosuwa nu gisho oothidi, iya guye zaaronna aggenna” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JER 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Ermiyaasi entaw zaaridi, “Bidi Sedeqiyaasako yaagite: <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />‘Neeni Babiloone kawuwaranne gimbiyafe karera ne katama teqida iya olanchotara oletiyanne ne kushen de7iya ola miishiya ta ne bolla zaarana; enta ubbaa ha katamaa giddo gelsana. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />Taani, ta huuphen seeras micetida kushen, wolqaama qesiyan, yilon, hanqoninne wolqaama gadon nena olana. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Ta ha kataman de7iya asaanne mehiya shocana; enti iita gadon wurana. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />Hessafe guye, Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasa, iya moorinnata, gadope, mashshafenne koshape attida, ha katama asa ubbaa, Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoorasinne enta wodhanaw koyiya morketas aathada immana. I enta qara mashshan goyrana. I entaw qadhetenna; saletidi aggenna; maarenna’ ” yaagees Goday Isra7eele Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />Goday Ermiyaasako, “Gujada asaako haysada yaaga: ta hinte sinthan de7o ogiyanne hayqo ogiya wothas. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Ha kataman gam7iya oonika mashshan woyko koshan woyko gadon hayqana. Shin katamaape keyidi katamaa teqidi oykida Babiloonetas ba kushiya immiya oonika paxa attana; he uray ba shempuwa ashshana. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Taani ha katamaa bolla lo77oba gidonashin iitabaa oothanaw dendas. Ta iya Babiloone kawas aathada immana; I ha katamaa taman xuuggana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />Yihuda kawa keetha asaas haysada yaaga: Godaa qaala si7ite! <verse eid="JER 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />Hinteno, Dawita kochato, Goday hinteko haysada yaagees; “Wonta wonta suure pirdite; bonqetidaysata un7ethiya asaa kushepe ashshite. Hessa hinte oothonna ixiko, hinte iita oosuwa gaason ta hanqoy tamada eexana; oonika iya toysenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />Neno, Yerusalaame, denban de7iya zaallada, zangaarape dhoqu gada bentaasa; shin ta nena olana. Neeni, “Oonika ta bolla xaalenna woyko ta de7iya bessaa gelenna” yaagasa.<verse eid="JER 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Shin, “Taani Goday nena ne oosuwada seerana. Taani ne kawo keethan tama oythana; ne yuushuwan de7iya ubbaa midi dhaysana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s1">Iita Kawota Bolla Xoossa Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Goday haysada yaagees; “Duge Yihuda kawa gadho bada, yan ha qaala oda. <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />‘Neno Yihuda kawaw, Dawita araatan uttidayso, neeni, ne moorinnatinne ha pengiyara geliya ne asay Godaa qaala si7ite! <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />Suure pirdaa pirdite; xillo oothite. Bonqetidaysa un7ethiya asaa kushepe ashshite. Bete asaas, yi7otasinne am7etas gene oothopite woyko sugopite. Xillo asa suuthu ha bessan gussofite. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Ha kiitata hinte naagiko, Dawita araatan uttiya kawoti paranne para gaare toggidi, banta moorinnataranne banta asaara ha kawo gadho pengiyara gelana. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" />Shin hinte kiitetonna ixiko, ha kawo gadhoy baysa gidana yaagada ta Goday ta huuphen caaqas’ ” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Goday Yihuda kawo gadhuwaba haysada yaagees: “Neeni taw Galada biittanne Libaanose zuma mela gidikoka, ta nena mela biittanne asi doonna katama oothana. <verse eid="JER 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Taani nena laaliya asaa ola miishe oythada kiittana; enti ne ziga tuuqeta qanxerethidi, taman yeggana.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />“Dumma dumma kawotethatape asay he katamaa matara aadhishe, ‘Goday ayis ha gita katamaa haysada oothidee?’ yaagidi issoy issuwa oychana. <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Enti zaaridi, ‘Godaa banta Xoossara caaqida caaquwa menthidi, hara xoossata goyinnida gishonne oothida gishosa’ ” yaagana.<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Hayqida kawa Iyosiyasas yeekofite woyko kayotofite. Hessa aggidi, di7etidi bida Saalomas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saalomas hara sunthay Iyo7akaaza. Iyo7akaazi kawotetha sunthu gidishin, Saloomi soo sunthu woyko buzo sunthu.</char></note>seeletidi yeekite. I guye simmenna; ba yeletida biitta zaaridi be7enna.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />Ba aawa bessan Yihudan kawotidi de7ishe, ha bessaafe bida Iyosiyaasa na7a Saloomaba Goday haysada yaagees. “I guye simmenna. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />I di7etidi bida biittan hayqana; simmidi ha biitta be7enna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />Ba keetha genen keexeysa, geella ogen pooqe bolla pooqe gujeysa, ba asaas aykoka immonnanne gate qanxonna oosiseysa ayye! <verse eid="JER 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />He uray, “Taani taw gita pooqey de7iya dalga keethi keexana” yaagdi, ba keethas dalga maskooteta kessidi, ziga mithan alleeqisidi, zo7o qalame tiyees.<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />Ne daro zigan keexidaysi nena lo77o kawo kessees gada qopay? Ne aawa Iyosyaasas miyabaynne uyaabay dhayidee? I suure pirda pirdis; xillo oothis. Hessa gisho, iyaw ubbabay injetis. <verse eid="JER 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />I manqotasinne metootanchotas suure pirdiya gisho, ubbabay iyaw injetis. Godaa erees guussay haysa. <verse eid="JER 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />Shin ne ayfeynne ne wozanay shempiday, cimon go77a demo, xillo suuthi guso, genenne un7etho bollana.<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />Hessa gisho, Goday Iyosyaasa na7aa, Yihuda kawa Iyo7aqeemaba haysada yaagees: “I hayqiya wode enti iyaw, ‘Woo! Ta ishaw, woo! Ta ishaw’ yaagidi yeekokona. Qassi, ‘Woo! Ta godaw, woo! Ta kawaw’ yaagidi zeleelokona. <verse eid="JER 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Iya moogoyka hare moogo mela gidana. Iya ahay gooshetidi, Yerusalaame pengetape ya baggan yegetana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />Goday Yerusalaameba haysada yaagees: “Olas neera zupeteysati ubbay xoonetida gisho, pude Libaanose bada, yan waassa. Baasane biittan waaso suulisa; Abariima zuman waassa. <verse eid="JER 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Ne saro de7iya wode ta new odas; shin ne tana si7onna ixadasa. Ne na7atethafe doomin ne hanoy haysa; ne taw kiitetonna ixadasa. <verse eid="JER 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />Ne henthanchota ubbaa carkoy efana; olas neera zupeteysati di7etidi baana. He wode ne iitatetha ubbaa gisho yeellatananne kawuyana. <verse eid="JER 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Hinteno, Libaanose zigan keexetida keethan de7eysato, iqethi oykida maccasada un7i hinte bolla puttu giiko hinte waananee?” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />Goday haysada yaagees: “Ta de7oy ero! Neeni Iyo7aqeema na7ay, Yihuda kawoy Yo7akini, ta ushacha kushen de7iya ta attamiya migiddo gidiyakoka ta nena kessa yeggana. <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />Nena wodhanaw koyeysatas, ne yayiya Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoorasinne iya olanchotas ta nena aathada immana. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />Ta nenanne ne aayiw hinte yeletonna hara biitta holana; hinte nam7ayka yan hayqana. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Hinte simmanaw laamotiya biitta polo simmeketa” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Ha addey Yo7akini, kadhetidanne meqida xuggee? I, oonika koyonna miishee? Inne iya nayti ayis goodetidi, eronna biittan yegetidi attidonaa? <verse eid="JER 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />Biitte, biitte, biitte, Godaa qaala si7a! <verse eid="JER 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />“Iya kochaafe issuwasika injetonna gishonne Dawita araatan uttiya woyko Yihudan kawotiya asi issoyka bayna gisho, ha addiya, na7i bayna asi, ba laytha ubban de7oy injetonna asi” gada xaafa yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s1">Xillo Aaca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />“Ta hentha bessan de7iya dorsata dhaysiyanne laaliya henthanchota ayye!” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, ba asaa heemmiya henthanchota haysada yaagees: “Hinte ta dorsata laallida gisho, gooddida gisho, naagiboonna gishonne hinte oothida hinte iita oosuwa gisho ta hintena seerana. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />Ta wudiyape attidaysata ta kase laallida biitta ubbaafe ta huuphen shiishana. Enta guye enta hentha bessaa zaarana; enti yan yeletidi darana. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Enta loythidi heemmiya henthanchota entaw shuumana. Enti zaaridi yayyokona; dagammokona; entafe issoyka dhayenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />“Dawita kochaafe xillo aaca denthana wodey yaana. I kawotethaa cincatethan aysana; biitta bolla suurenne xillo oothana. <verse eid="JER 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Iya kawotetha wodiyan Yihudi attana; Isra7eeley saro daana. Iya sunthay, ‘Xoossay nu Xillotethaa’ geetetana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />Hessa gisho, “Asay, ‘Isra7eela asaa Gibxe biittafe kessida Goday eriya mela’ yaagidi caaqanaysa aggidi, <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />‘Isra7eela kochaa pudeha bagga biittafenne enta laallida biitta ubbaafe ehida Goday eriya mela’ yaagidi caaqana wodey yaana. Hessafe guye, enti banta buzo biittan daana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wordo Nabeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Nabetaba ta qopiya wode ta wozanay daaburees; ta meqethati kokoroosona. Godaa gishonne iya geeshsha qaala gisho woyney xoonin mathotida asi gidas. <verse eid="JER 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Biittay laymatethan kumis. Qangetha gisho, biittay yeekees; bazzo hentha bessati melidosona. Nabeti iita ogen hemetoosona; banta maata like gidonna ogen go7etoosona.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />“Nabetinne kahineti tunidosona; hari attoshin ta keethan enti oothiya iitaa ta be7as” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />“Hessa gisho, enta ogey hallixana; enti dhuman yegetana, dhubetidi kundana. Enti seeretiya wode enta bolla gado ehana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />“Samaare nabeta giddon iitabaa be7as. Enti Ba7aale sunthan tinbite odoosona; ta asaa Isra7eele balethoosona. <verse eid="JER 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />Qassi Yerusalaame nabeta giddonka haythas deexiyaba be7as. Enti laymatoosona; wordotidi de7oosona. Oonika ba iita oosuwape simmonna mela enti iitaa ootheyisata minthethoosona. Enti ubbay taw Soodoma mela; Yerusalaame asay Gamoora mela” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />Hessa gisho, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday nabetaba haysada yaagees: “Yerusalaame nabeta doonape tunabay keyidi, biitta ubban laaletida gisho, ta enta cammiya kathi muzana; enta wodhiya haathi ushshana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />“Nabeti odiyaba si7opite; enti hanonna ufaysan kunthoosona. Goday odonnashin enti bantafe medhi kessidi qoncethi odoosona. <verse eid="JER 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Tana kadheysatako, ‘Hinte saro daana’ yaagosona; qassi banta wozana iitatethaa kaalleysatako, ‘Hintena iitabay gakenna’ yaagosona” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />“Shin be7anaw woyko iya qaala si7anaw Goday zoriya bessan entafe oone eqiday? Iya qaala si7iday oonee? <verse eid="JER 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Godaa gotey hanqon dendana; wolqaama hobbey iitata huuphiya shocana. <verse eid="JER 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />Ba wozanaa qofaa polonna de7ishe, Godaa hanqoy simmenna. Wursetha wodiyan haysa hinte akeekana. <verse eid="JER 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />Ta ha nabeta kiittabike; shin enti banta kiita ekidi woxoosona. Ta entaw odabike; shin enti tinbite odoosona. <verse eid="JER 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Enti ta zoriya bessan eqidabaa gidiyako, ta qaala, ta asaas odanashin. Enti iita ogiyapenne enta iita oosuwape zaaranashin” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />“Ta mata xalaala Xoossee? Haaho Xoossi gidikina? <verse eid="JER 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Ta be7onnaada, asi geema bessan bana qosanaw danda7ii? Saloninne sa7an kumiday tana gidikina?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />“Ta sunthan wordo tinbite odeysati giyaba si7as. Enti, ‘Ta amuho be7as; ta amuho be7as’ yaagosona. <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Ha nabeti bantaw medhidi kessidi odiya wordo tinbitey enta wozanan awude gakanaw gam7anee? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Enta aawati Ba7aale eeqa goyinnidi ta sunthaa dogidaysada, enti issoy issuwas odiya amuhuwan, ta asay ta sunthaa dogana mela oothanaw qopoosona. <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Amuho amuhiya nabey ba amuhuwa odo; shin ta qaala si7iya nabey ta qaala ammanetidi odo. Dalinne gistey awun gahetii? <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />Ta qaalay tama mela gidennee? Zaalla mentherethiya naariqa mela gidennee?” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />“Hessa gisho, ta qaala issoy issuwafe kaysotidi taape ekida daanisidi tinbite odiya nabeta ta ixayis. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Hessadaka, banta wozanaa qofaa odishe, ‘Goday yaagees’ giya nabetaka taani ixayis. <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Wordo amuhishe tinbite odiya nabeta bolla ta dendana. Enti banta amuhuwan katidi tinbite odiya nabeta taani ixayis. Ta enta kiittonnashin woyko shuumonnashin wordo tinbite odoosona; ta asaa balethoosona. Enti ha asaa aykoka maaddokona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />“Goday taako, ‘Ha asay woyko nabey woyko kahiney, Godaa kiitay aybee?’ gidi oychiko, ne entako, ‘Goday, ta hintena holana’ yaagees” gada oda.<verse eid="JER 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />“Nabey woyko kahiney woyko asay, ‘Haysi Godaa kiita’ yaagidi odiko, ta he addiyanne iya soo asaa seerana. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Hessa aggidi issoy issoy, ‘Goday woygidee? woyko Goday ay odidee?’ yaagidi ba laggetanne ba dabbota oychanaw bessees. <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Hizape oonika, ‘Godaa kiita’ yaagidi zaaridi odetanaw bessenna. Hessa gisho, iya doonape keyiya qaalay iyaw kiita gidiya gisho, de7o Xoossaa, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa, nu Xoossaa qaala hinte mirqeeta. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Neeni nabetako, ‘Goday hintena woygidee?’ woyko ‘Ay odidee?’ yaagada oychanaw bessees. <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Shin hinte, ‘Haysi Godaa kiita’ giiko, Goday haysada yaagees: taani hintena, ‘Haysi Godaa kiita goopite’ yaaginka hinte, ‘Haysi Godaa kiita’ gideta. <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />Hessa gisho, ta hintena dogana; hintenanne hinte aawatas immida katamaa kumethi ta sinthafe diggana. <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Ta hinte bolla merinaa kawushanne dogetonna yeella ehana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s1">Balase Ayfey De7iya Nam7u Daachota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />Kawoy Nabukadanaxoori, Iyo7aqeema na7aa, Yihuda kawa Ikoniyaana, Yihuda halaqatara, kushe hiillataranne birata qoxeysatara Yerusalaamepe Babiloone di77idi efidaape guye, Goday tana qoncethi bessis. Goday tana, Xoossa keethas sintha baggara balasey de7iya nam7u keesheta bessis. <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Issi keeshiyan koyro teerida daaniya lo77o balasey de7ees; hanko keeshiyan qassi maanaw giigonna iita balasey de7ees. <verse eid="JER 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />Goday taako, “Ermiyaasa, ne be7ey aybee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Taani, “Balase be7ayis; lo77o teeray daro lo77o; iita teeray qassi maanaw giigonna daro iita” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Hessafe guye, Godaa qaalay taako yis: <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />Goday Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: “Yihuda biittafe di7on Babiloone biitta yeddida asata, ha lo77o balase teerada lo77o gaana. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Taani lo77o ayfen enta xeellana; qassi enta zaarada ha biitta ehana. Ta enta keexanape attishin, laallike; enta tokanape attishin, shoddike. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Taani Godaa gididaysa enti erana mela entaw wozana immana. Enti banta kumetha wozanape taako simmanaw de7iya gisho, enti ta ase gidana; ta enta Xoosse gidana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />Gidoshin, “Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasa, iya moorinnata, ha biittan gidin Yerusalaamen attida asaanne Gibxe biittan de7eyisata maanaw giigonna daro iita balase teerada iita gaana. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Taani enta gooddada yeddiya biitta ubban, ha sa7a kawotethati enta be7idi dagammana. Taani enta ixetidaysata, cayetidaysata, boretidaysata, leemiseteyisata, qelqiseteyisata, baadetidaysata oothana. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Ta entawunne enta mayzatas immida biittafe enti polo dhayana gakanaw mashsha, koshanne bosha enta bolla yeddana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s1">Laapun Tammu Laytha Aylletethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />Iyosyaasa na7ay, Yihuda kawoy Iyo7aqeemi kawotida oyddantho laythan, Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori kawotida koyro laythan, Yihuda asaabay Ermiyaasako yida qaalay haysa. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Nabey Ermiyaasi Yihuda ubbaasinne Yerusalaamen de7iya ubbaas haysada yaagis: <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />Amoxe na7ay, Yihuda kawoy, Iyosyaasi kawotida tammanne heedzantho laythafe doomidi, hachi gakanaw, laatamanne heedzu laythi Godaa qaalay taako yis. Ta hintew zaara zaara odas; shin hinte si7onna ixideta.<verse eid="JER 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />Goday ba aylleta, nabeta ubbaa zaari zaari hinteko kiittis; shin hinte si7onna ixideta. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Enti, “Hinte ubbay hinte iita ogiyapenne hinte iita oosuwape simmite. Goday hintewunne hinte mayzatas merinaw immida biittan hinte daana. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Hara xoossata goyinnanawunne entaw oothanaw kaallopite. Qassi hinte, hinte kushen oothida eeqatan Godaa hanquwa denthethofite. Hessi haniko Goday hintena qohenna” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />“Hinte ta odidaysa si7onna ixidi, hinte kushey oothidaban tana yiloyideta. Hinte, hintena qohiyaba oothideta” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />“Hessa gisho, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: hinte ta qaalas kiitetonna ixida gisho, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />pudeha bagga asa ubbaanne ta aylliya Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoora xeegana. Enta ha biitta bolla, ha biittan de7iya asa bollanne heeran de7iya kawotethata ubbaa bolla ehana. Ta ha biitta kumethi dhaysana; qassi be7ida ubbay shaatiyabanne qelqisiyaba oothana” yaagees Goday. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" />Enta giddofe ililsinne ufaysa qaala, yaagano girsi, woxa girsinne xompe poo7o dhaysana. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" />Ha biittay kumethi laaletidanne baysa biitta gidana; kawotethati Babiloone kawas laapun tammu laythi haaretana.<verse eid="JER 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />“Laapun tammu laythay poletidaape guye, taani Babiloone kawanne iya asaa enta nagara gisho seerana; enta biitta merinaw baysa oothana. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Ta ha biitta bolla odida ubbaa, Ermiyaasi kawotethata ubba bolla odida tinbitiyanne ha maxaafan xaafetida ubbaa ha biitta bolla ehana. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Daro kawotethatinne gita kawoti Babiloone asaa haarana. Ta entaw, enta hanuwadanne enta kushe oosuwada zaarana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Hanqo Xuu7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />“Ta hanquwan kumida woyne wanca ta kushepe eka. Efada ta nena kiittiya kawotethata ubbaa ushsha. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Enti uyidi, taani enta giddo yeddiya mashshaa gaason gandigarananne gooyana” yaagees Goday Isra7eele Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Taani Godaa kushepe wanca ekada, I tana kiitida kawotethata ubbaa ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Hachi hanidaysada enta ubbaa dhayonne dagama, cashshenne baadethi oothana mela Yerusalaamenne Yihuda katamata, iya kawotanne iya moorinnata ubbaa ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Gibxe kawa, iya aylleta, iya moorinnata, iya biitta asa ubbaanne <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />yan de7iya allaga asa ubbaa ushshas. Oxa kawota ubbaa ushshas. Filisxeemen de7iya Asqaloona, Gaaza, Eqroonanne Ashdoodape attida kawota ubbaa ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />Edoome, Moo7abenne Amoone ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />Xiroosa kawota ubbaa, Sidoona kawota ubbaanne Medetiraane Abbaafe hefinthan, haahon de7iya kawota ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />Dedaana, Temaana, Buzanne banta huuphiya gaxa meediya asa ubbaa ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />Arabe kawota ubbaanne mela biittan de7iya walaka asaa kawota ubbaa ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />Zimira, Elaamanne Meedona kawota ubbaa ushshas. <verse eid="JER 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />Pudeha biitta kawota ubbaa, haahoninne matan de7iya kawota ubbaa kaallada kaallada sa7aa bolla de7iya kawotethata ubbaa ushshas. Entafe guye Babiloone kawoy uyana.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />Goday taako, “Hessa gisho, ‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay hinteko haysada yaagees’ yaaga. ‘Uyitenne mathotite; cooyitenne kundite. Taani hinte giddo yeddiya mashshaa gaason zaaridi dendofite’ yaagis. <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />Shin enti ne kushepe wanca ekonnanne uyonna ixiko, entako haysada yaaga. ‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday hinteko haysada yaagees: hinte uyanaw bessees. <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Ta sunthan xeegetida katamaa bolla iitabaa oothanaw doomayis. Yaatin hinte seerettona attanaw danda7eetii? Ta sa7an de7iya ubbaa bolla mashsha xeegida gisho hinte seerettonna atteketa’ ” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />“Hessa gisho, Ermiyaasa, ha qaala ubbay enta bolla poletanaysa entaw oda. Goday dhoqan guummana; Goday ba geeshsha bessaafe ba guntha sissana. I ba biitta bolla xaaggana; woyne gum7eysati waasseysada sa7an de7iya ubbaa bolla waassana. <verse eid="JER 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Godaas kawotethatara mootoy de7iya gisho iya waasoy sa7a gaxaa gakidi si7etees. Goday asa ubbaara pirdetana; I iitata mashshas aathidi immana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />“Iitabay kawotethaafe kawotethaa laaletis; sa7aa gaxape gotey dendis” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />He wode Goday wodhidaysata ahay, biitta bolla ha gaxape ya gaxa gakanaw laaletana. Entaw yeeketenna, enta ahay shiiqenna woyko moogetenna; enti biittan pito mela gidana.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Hinteno, henthanchoto, yeekitenne waassite. Hinteno, wudiya kaaletheysato, bidon gondoretite. Hinte shuketiya wodey gakis; hinte kundananne lo77o urqa miishada meqeretana. <verse eid="JER 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Henthanchoti baqatidi attiya bessi baawa; wudiya kaaletheysati kessi ekiya bessi baawa. <verse eid="JER 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Goday enta hentha gadiya dhaysiya gisho, henthanchoti waassiya waasuwanne wudiya kaaletheysati yeekiya yeehuwa si7ite. <verse eid="JER 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />Godaa suulliya sheniya gaason saro biittay baysatana. <verse eid="JER 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Gaammoy ba de7iya worape keyeysada Goday ba de7iya bessaafe keyana. Enta biittay un7etheyisata mashshaninne Godaa suulliya hanquwan baysa gidana.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi Hayqope Attis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />Iyosyaasa na7ay Yihuda kawoy Iyo7aqeemi kawotida wode Godaa qaalay yis. <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />Goday, “Xoossa keetha dabaaban eqa. Xoossa keethan goyinnanaw Yihuda katamatape yaa ubbaas, ta nena kiitida qaalape issuwaka ashshona oda. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Enti si7idi, banta iita ogiyape simmaneko ooni eri. Hessa gidiko, taani enta iitatetha gisho dhaysanaw qopidaysa aggaagana.”<verse eid="JER 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Entako haysada yaaga: “Hinte tana si7onna ixikonne ta hintew immida higgiya kiitetonna ixiko, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />hinte si7onna ixikoka ta zaara zaarada hinteko kiitida, ta aylleta nabeta qaala si7onnan ixiko, <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" />ta ha xoossa keethaa Seeloda oothana. Ha katamaa sa7an de7iya kawotethata ubbaas baadethi oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />Ermiyaasi Xoossa keethan ha qaala odishin, kahineti, nabetinne asa ubbay si7idosona. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Ermiyaasi, Goday, oda gidi immida kiita odidi ongida wode kahineti, nabetinne asa ubbay iya oykidi, “Ne hayqanaw bessaasa” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Neeni, “ ‘Ha xoossa keethay Seeloda hanana; qassi ha katamay dhayana; baysa gidana’ yaagada, Godaa sunthan ayis tinbite odadii?” yaagidi, Xoossa keethan shiiqida asa ubbay Ermiyaasa teqidosona.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Yihuda halaqati hessa si7ida wode, kawo gadhope keyidi, Xoossa keethi yidosona. Xoossa keethan Ooratha Penge geetetiya pengiyan uttidosona. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Kahinetinne nabeti halaqatakonne asa ubbaako haysada yaagidosona: “Hinte, hinte haythan si7idaysada, ha addey ha katamaa bolla tinbite odida gisho, I hayqanaw bessees!” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Ermiyaasi halaqatakonne asa ubbaako haysada yaagis: “Ha hinte si7ida qaala ubbay ha xoossa keethaa bollanne ha katamaa bolla hanana gada ta odana mela Goday tana kiittis. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />Hiza hinte ogiyanne hinte oosuwa laammite; Godaa hinte Xoossaa qaalas kiitetite. Hessa hinte oothiko, Goday hinte bolla ehana gida iitabaa aggaagana. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Tana gidiko, ta hinte kushen de7ayis. Hintew lo77onne suure daanidaba ta bolla oothite. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Taani ha qaala ubbaa hintew odana mela Goday tuma tana kiitida gisho, hinte tana wodhiko, hinte hinte bolla, ha katama bollanne iyan de7iya asaa bolla xillo suutha aco ehanaysa erite” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Halaqatinne asa ubbay, kahinetinne nabeti, “I, Godaa, nu Xoossaa sunthan nuus odida gisho, ha addey hayqanaw bessenna” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Biitta cimatape issoti issoti dendi eqidi, shiiqida asaako haysada yaagidosona: <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />“Hizqiyaasi Yihudan kawotida laythan Mooreseeta addey Mikiyaasi kase Yihuda asaas haysada yaagidi, tinbite odis: ‘Xiyooney shooqada goyetana. Yerusalaame katamay laaletidi, laaletha doore gidana. Xoossa keethay keexetida derey wora gidana’ yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />Yaatin, “Yihuda kawoy Hizqiyaasinne Yihuda asa ubbay iya wodhidona? Akay, Hizqiyaasi Godaas yayyidi, Godaa maarotethi oychibeennee? Godaay enta bolla ehana gida iitabaa aggibeenee? Shin nuuni nu bolla iitabaa ehana hanoos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyo7aqeemi Ooriyoona Wodhisis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />Qiriyat-Yi7aarima geetetiya bessan, Shamaya na7aa, Ooriyoona geetetiya issi addey de7ees. Ika Ermiyaasi odidaysada, ha katamaa bollanne ha biitta bolla Godaa sunthan kase tinbite odis. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Kawoy Iyo7aqeemi, iya olanchoti, iya moorinnati, Ooriyooni odidaysa si7ida wode kawoy iya wodhanaw koyis. Ooriyooni hessa si7ida wode yayyidi, Gibxe baqatis. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Gidoshin, kawoy Iyo7aqeemi Akboora na7aa Elnaatananne hara asata Gibxe kiittis. <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />Enti Ooriyoona Gibxefe kessidi, kawa Iyo7aqeemeko efin, iya mashshan wodhisidi derey moogetiya duufon moogidosona.<verse eid="JER 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Shin Safaana na7ay, Akqaami Ermiyaasa maaddida gisho asay iya wodhanaw aathidi immibookona.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yihudi Nabukadanaxoora Kushen Kundis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Iyosyaasa na7ay Sedeqiyaasi, Yihudan kawoto doomida wode ha qaalay Godaape Ermiyaasako yis. <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />“Dafo gonne wodorora de7iya qambara medhada ne gannan wotha. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasako Yerusalaame kiitetida asaa baggara, Edoome, Moo7abe, Amoone, Xiroosanne Sidoona kiitta. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Enti banta godatas odana mela enta kiitta. Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />‘Ta gita wolqaaninne ta micetida kushen sa7aa, sa7an de7iya asaa, mehenne do7ata medhas; taani iya, ta koyiya oodeska immayis. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />Ha77i ta biitta ubbaa ta aylliyas, Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxooras immas. Qassi ta bazzo do7atika iyaw haaretana mela oothas. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Iya biittay haratas haaretiya wodey gakanaw kawotethati ubbay iyaw, iya na7aasinne iya na7aa na7aas haaretana. Hessafe guye, daro kawotethatinne gita kawoti iya haarana.’<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />“Shin ay biitti woyko ay kawotethi Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxooras kiitetonna ixikonne iya qambaran gelonna ixiko, he kawotethay iya kushen dhayana gakanaw mashshan, koshaninne boshan seerana. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Hessa gisho, ‘Babiloone kawas haareteketa’ giya hinte nabeta, hintew kaayeyisata, hinte amuho billeyisata, hinte marotanne moytille xeegeyisata si7opite. <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Enti hintew wordo odoosona; hintena hinte biittafe shoddana; hintena gooddada kessana; hinteka dhayana. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Shin ay kawotethika Babiloone kawa qambaran gelidi, iyaw haaretiko, ta he kawotethaa iya biittan ashshana; enti he biitta goyana; yan daana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Taani, Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasaska ha qaala odas; “Babiloone kawa qambaran gelada iyawunne iya asaas haaretiko, ne de7on daana. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Goday Babiloone kawas haaretonna ixiya kawotethas odidaysada mashshan, koshaninne boshan nenne ne asay ayis hayqeetii? <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Enti odey wordo gidiya gisho, ‘Hinte Babiloone kawas haareteketa’ yaagidi odiya nabeta si7opite. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />Ta enta kiittabike; shin enti ta sunthan wordo tinbite odoosona. Hessa gisho, ta hintena gooddada kessana; hintenne hinte nabeti dhayana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Hessafe guye, ta kahinetasinne asa ubbaas haysada yaagada odas: “Xoossa keetha miishey Babiloonepe matara simmidi yaana” yaagidi wordo odiya nabeta si7opite. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Enti giyaba si7onna aggidi, Babiloone kawas haaretite; hinte de7on daana. Ha katamay ayis laaletida bessi gidanee? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Enti tuma nabe gidikonne Godaa qaalay entan de7iko, Xoossa keethan, Yihuda kawo gadhoninne Yerusalaamen attida miishey Babiloone boonnada Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa Xoossaa woosso.<verse eid="JER 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" />“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, xoossa keetha karen eqida nam7u naase birata tuussatabaa, gita keretabaa, caana gaaretabaanne hara miishetaba haysada yaagees: <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori Iyo7aqeema na7aa, Yihuda kawa Ikoniyaananne Yihudaninne Yerusalaamen de7iya gita asa ubbaa di77idi efida wode, <verse eid="JER 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, Xoossa keethan, Yihuda kawo gadhoninne Yerusalaamen attida miishetaba haysada yaagees; <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" />Enti Babiloone biitta gaazetana; ta enta gisho yaana wodey gakanaw, enti yan daana. He wode ta enta guye zaarada enta bessan wothana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s1">Wordo Nabiya Hanaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />He laythi, Yihuda kawoy Sedeqiyaasi kawoto doomida oyddantho laythan, ichashantho ageenan Gaba7oona addey, Azuura na7ay nabey Hanaani, Xoossa keethan kahinetanne asa ubbaa sinthan taako haysada yaagis: <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, ‘Babiloone kawa qambara menthana. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Babiloone kawoy, Nabukadanaxoori, Babiloone efida Xoossa keethaa miishe ubbaa ta nam7u laytha giddon zaarada ha bessaa ehana. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Iyo7aqeema na7aa, Yihuda kawa Yo7akina, Yihudape di7etidi Babiloone bida asa ubbaa zaarada ha bessaa ehana. Taani Babiloone kawa qambara menthana’ ” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Xoossa keethaa giddon eqida kahinetanne asa ubbaa sinthan nabey Ermiyaasi, nabiya Hananako haysada yaagis. <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />“Amin7i! Goday ne gidaysada ootho. Xoossa keetha miishetanne di7etidi bida asa ubbaa Babiloonepe zaaridi, ne odiya qaala Goday polo! <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Gidoshin, ta newunne ne asaas odeysa si7a. <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />Neepenne taape kase de7ida nabeti, olaba, dhayobanne gadoba gita kawotethata bolla tinbite odidosona. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Shin, Saroba odiya nabey, tuma Xoossi kiitida nabe gideysi eretey, I odiya tinbitey poletiya wodena” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Hessafe guye, nabey Hanaani, nabiya Ermiyaasa gannaafe qambara ekidi menthis. <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />Hanaani asa ubbaa sinthan, “Taani nam7u laytha giddon Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoora qambara kawotethata ubbaa gannaafe denthada haysada menthana” yaagees Goday. Hessafe guye, Ermiyaasi dendidi, ba ogiya bis.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Nabey Hanaani, nabiya Ermiyaasa gannaafe menthida guutha wodepe guye, Godaa qaalay nabiya Ermiyaasako haysada yaagishe yis. <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />Bada Hanaanas oda; “Neeni mitha qambara menthadasa; shin neeni iya gisho birata qambara medhana. <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxooras haaretana mela taani ha kawotethata ubbaa gannan birata qambara wothana; entika iyaw haaretana. Taani hari attoshin, bazzo do7atika iyaw haaretana mela oothana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Hessafe guye, nabey Ermiyaasi, nabiya Hananako haysada yaagis: “Hananiya, si7a! Goday nena kiittibeenna; shin neeni ha asay wordoban ammanetana mela oothadasa. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Hessa gisho, Goday, ‘Ta nena sa7a bollafe diggana. Neeni ha asay ta bolla makallana mela oothida gisho ne ha laythi hayqana’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />He laythi laapuntha ageenan nabey Hanaani hayqis.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasa Dabdaabiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />Nabiya Ermiyaasi di7etida asaa giddon de7iya attida cimatas, kahinetas, nabetasinne Nabukadanaxoori Yerusalaamepe di77idi, Babiloone efida ubbaas Yerusalaamepe yeddida dabdaabey haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />Haysi haniday, kawoy Ikoniyaani, iya aayiya kawiya, iya moorinnati, Yihudanne Yerusalaame halaqati, kushe hiillanchotinne birata qoxeysati Yerusalaamepe di7etidi bidi simmina. <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Ermiyaasi Yihuda kawoy Sedeqiyaasi Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoorako kiitetida Safaana na7aa El7aasanne Kalqqe na7aa Gamaara bolla he dabdaabiya yeddis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 29:3">Dabdaabey haysada yaagees: <verse eid="JER 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, Yerusalaamepe Babiloone di7etida asa ubbaas haysada yaagees: <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />Keethe keexidi yan de7ite. Kathi zeridi ayfiya miite. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Macho ekidi macca na7anne adde na7a yelite. Hinte adde naytas macho oychidi immite; hinte macca nayta azinas immite. Enti macca adde yelo; yan taybon darite; guuxofite. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Hinte di7etidi bida katamaas saroy daana mela koyite. He katamaas Godaa woossite. Iyaw saroy de7iko, hintewuka saroy daana. <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Hinte giddon de7iya hinte nabetinne maroti odiyaban cimetofite; enti amuhiya amuhuwa si7opite. <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />Enti ta sunthan wordo tinbite odoosona; ta enta kiittabike” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />“Hinte Babiloonen gam7iya laapun tammu laythay poletiya wode ta hinte gisho yada, hintena, hinte biitta zaarada ehana gada gelida qaala polana. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />Taani hintew qopiya qofaa erayis. He qofay, wursethay lo77onne ufaysi de7iya, hintena go77iya qofape attishin, qohiya qofa gidenna. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Hessafe guye, hinte tana xeegana; taako yaananne tana woossana; taka hintena si7ana. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" />Hinte tana koyana; hinte tana hinte kumetha wozanan koyida wode demmana. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Ta hintew bentana; ta hintena di7etethaafe zaarana. Taani hintena laallida kawotethatapenne dumma dumma bessaafe shiishana. Ta hintena di7on denthida hinte biitta guye zaarada ehana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Hinte, “Goday nabe nuus Babiloonen denthis” yaagideta. <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />Gidoshin, Dawita araatan uttiya kawabanne hinte mela di7etidi boonna attida asaabanne hinte dabbotabaa Goday haysada yaagees. <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />“Ta enta bolla mashshe, koshanne gado yeddana. Ta entana meetetanaw danda7etonna iitida balase mitha ayfeda oothana. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Taani enta mashshan, koshaninne gadon yedethada, enta sa7an de7iya kawotetha ubbaas dagama oothana. Qassi ta enta kessada yeddida biitta ubban baadethas, dagamas, boresinne cashshas oothana. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Ta aylleta nabeta baggara zaarada zaarada kiitida ta qaala enti si7onna ixidosona. Hinte di7etidi bidaysatika si7onna ixideta. <verse eid="JER 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Hinteno, Yerusalaamepe Babiloone di7etidi bida asaw, hinte ubbay Godaa qaala si7ite” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />Ta sunthan wordo tinbite odiya, Qolaya na7aa Akaababanne Maseya na7aa Sedeqiyasaba Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees. “Ta enta Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxooras aathada immana. Hinte xeellishin, I enta wodhana. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Hessafe guye, Yihudape di7etidi, Babiloone bida asay issi asi baaddanaw koyiko, ‘Babiloone kawoy taman xuuggida Sedeqiyasadanne Akaabada Goday nena ootho’ yaagana. <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Enti Isra7eelen iita nagara oothidosona. Enti banta shoorota machetara laymatidosona; ta enta kiittonna wordo tinbite ta sunthan odidosona. Hessa erey tana; hessas taani marka” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shamayas Xaafetida Dabdaabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Nahelame addiya Shamayas haysada yaagada oda: <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: ‘Neeni ne sunthan Yerusalaamen de7iya asaas, Ma7iseya na7aa kahiniya Sofoniyasasinne hara kahinetas dabdaabe yeddadasa.’ Ne Sofoniyasas haysada yaagadasa: <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />‘Xoossa keethan halaqa gidana mela Goday nena Yoodahe bessan kahine oothidi shuumis. Bana nabe gidi tinbite odiya gooya oonaka iya tohuwa duthan, iya qoodhiya santhalaatan neeni qachanaw bessees. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />Yaatin bana nabe giya Anatoota addiya Ermiyaasa ayis hessada oothabikii? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Ermiyaasi, di7etetha laythay daro gidiya gisho Babiloonen keethe keexidi de7ite; kathi zeridi ayfiya miite’ ” yaagidi nuna kiittis.<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Kahiney Sofoniyaasi nabiya Ermiyaasas dabdaabiya nabbabis. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis; <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Ha kiitaa di7on de7iya asa ubbaas kiitta; Nahelama addiya Samayeba Goday haysada yaagees; Taani kiittonna Shamayey wordo tinbite odidi hinte wordon ammantana mela oothis. <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />Ta Nahelama addiya Shamayanne iya soo asaa seerana. I ta bolla makallaba odida gisho ha asaa giddon iyaw issi asika de7on attenna. Taani ta asaas oothana keehatetha I be7enna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele asaa simuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />Godaape Ermiyaasako yida qaalay haysa. <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />“Ermiyaasa, ta new odida qaala ubbaa xaatha maxaafan xaafa. <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />Taani ta asaa Isra7eelenne Yihuda di7ope guye zaariya wodey matatis. Enta mayzatas immida biitta enta zaarana; enti iya laattana” yaagees Goday Isra7eele Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Goday Isra7eelebanne Yihudaba odida qaalay haysa. <verse eid="JER 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />“Ta yashshanne dagama waaso si7as; dagama waasope attishin, saro waaso gidenna. <verse eid="JER 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Ane oychite; be7ite; addey na7a yelanaw danda7ii? Yaatin, adde ubbay iqethi oykida maccasada, ba kushen ba uluwa oykidashin ta be7eysi aybee? Asa ubbaa som7oy ayis kareexidee? <verse eid="JER 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />He gallasay ay mela un7ethiya gallasee? Hessa mela gallas baawa. He gallasay Yayqooba zerethaas un7a wode gidana. Gidoshin enti he ubbaafe attana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “He gallasan ta enta gannaafe qambara menthana; enti qashetida santhalaata duuthana. Hessafe guye, allaga biitta asay enta aylleyena. <verse eid="JER 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Shin enti Godaas, banta Xoossaas, oothana; ta entaw denthiya kawa Dawitas haaretana.<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />“Hessa gisho, ta aylleto, Yayqooba kochato, yayyofite. Hinteno, Isra7eeleto, dagammopite. Hinte haaho bessan de7ishin, ta hintena ashshana; hinte kochata enti di7etida biittafe zaarana. Yayqooba zareti simmidi, saro daana; enta oonika yashisenna. <verse eid="JER 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Ta hintena ashshanaw hintera de7ayis. Hintena laallida kawotethata ubbaa dhaysana; shin hintena dhaysike. Ta hintena xillo pirdan seerana; shin seeronna hintena coo yeddike” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />“Hinte meqoy kooletenna; hinte madunthay paxenna. <verse eid="JER 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Hintew mootetey baawa; hinte madunthaas dhaley deenna; hintew paxoy baawa. <verse eid="JER 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Hinte doseysati hintena dogidosona; enti hintebaa wuda gookona. Hinte balaynne hinte nagaray daro gidiya gisho, ta hintena morkeda shocas; qadhey bayna seeras. <verse eid="JER 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Paxoy bentonna hinte hargiyasinne hinte madunthaas ayis waassetii? Hinte balaynne hinte nagaray darida gisho ta haysa hinte bolla oothas.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />“Shin hintena gaashidi mida ubbay meetetana; hinte morketi ubbay di7etana. Hintena bonqidaysati bonqetana; hintebaa ekidaysati eketana. <verse eid="JER 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Enti, ‘Oonika koyonnanne boretida Xiyoone’ gidoosona; shin ta hintew keehana; hinte madunthaa pathana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />“Yayqooba kochata di7etida bessaafe guye zaarada, keexana; enti de7iya bessaasika qadhetana. Yerusalaame katamay kase ba laaletida bessan, kawo gadhoy kase ba bessan simmidi keexetana. <verse eid="JER 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Yan de7iya asa ubbay galata mazmurenne ufaysa yethi yexana. Ta enta taybuwa darisanape attishin, guuxenna. Taani enta bonchetida dere oothana; enti kawuyokona. <verse eid="JER 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Enta nayti beni duussaada daana; enta maabaray ta sinthan minnidi daana. Enta un7ethiya ubbaa ta seerana. <verse eid="JER 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Enta kaalethanay enta giddofe keyana; enta haaranay enta giddofe dendana. Taani iya taw mata ehana; I taako shiiqana. Taani iya shiishonna de7ishin, minnidi taako shiiqanaw danda7ey oonee?” yaagees Goday. <verse eid="JER 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />Hessa gisho, hinte ta ase gidana; taka hinte Xoosse gidana.<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />Heko, Godaa hanqoy goteda dendees; shireti shireti wodhishe iitata huuphen wodhana. <verse eid="JER 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />Goday ba wozanaa qofaa wursidi polana gakanaw eexiya iya hanqoy guye simmenna. Hessa sinthafe yaana wodetan hinte akeekana.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asaa Simuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />“He wode taani Isra7eele zeretha ubbaas Xoosse gidana; entika ta ase gidana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />“Mashshafe attida asay mela biittan ta sinthan saba demmana. Taani Isra7eele asaas shempo immanaw yaana. <verse eid="JER 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />Taani entaw haaho bessafe qoncas; taani hintena merina siiquwan dosas; ta qadhiyan hintena taako shiishas. <verse eid="JER 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Geela7o Isra7eele, ta hintena zaarada keexana; hinteka keexetana. Neeni karaabuwa zaara oykada, ufayteysatara neeni yexananne durana. <verse eid="JER 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Samaare zumaa bolla woyne tokana; tokidaysati iya ayfiyan ufaytana. <verse eid="JER 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Efreema gezze biittan naageysati, ‘Haa yiite; Godaako, nu Xoossaako, pude Xiyoone boos’ yaagidi xeegiya wodey yaana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />“Yayqooba asaas ufaysan yexite; kawotethata ubbaafe aadhiya Isra7eeles ililite. ‘Isra7eele asaape attidaysata ashsha’ yaagidi galata mazmure yexite. <verse eid="JER 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Taani enta pudeha bagga biittafe ehana; sa7aa gaxape ta enta shiishana. Qooqeti, wobbeti, wodetha maccasatinne iqethi oykida maccasati entara issife yaana; daro asay banta biitta simmana. <verse eid="JER 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Ta enta zaarada ehiya wode enti ufaysafe dendoysan yeekishenne woossishe yaana. Taani enta shaafa lanqiyara, enti dhubetonna giigida ogiyara kaalethana. Taani Isra7eeles aawa; Efreemi taw bayra na7a.<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />“Hinteno, kawotethato, Godaa qaala si7idi, haaho bessan, yuushoy abban teqetida biittatan, ‘Isra7eele laallidaysi I enta shiishana; henthanchoy ba wudiya heemmeysada I enta heemmana’ yaagidi awaajite. <verse eid="JER 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Goday Yayqooba kochata wozana; I enta, entafe minneyisata kushepe ashshis. <verse eid="JER 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Enti yidi Xiyoone zuma bolla ufaysan yexana; enti, Goday immiya keehatethan, kathan, woynen, zayten, dorsaninne mehen ufaytana. Enti haathe loythidi ushshida atakilte bessa mela gidana; enti zaaridi azzanokona. <verse eid="JER 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />He wode geela7oti ufaysan durana; panthatinne cimati ufaytana. Ta enta yeehuwa ufaysan laammana; ta enta minthethana; enta azzanuwa gisho enta ufaysana. <verse eid="JER 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Taani kahinetas daro kathi immana; ta asay ta keehatetha kaallana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />“Yeehoynne zelelsi Rama kataman si7etis; Raheela ba naytas yeekasu; enti bayna gisho yeeho minthetho ixasu” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />“Yeehuwa aggidi, hinte afuthaa quchite. Hinte oothida oosuwas woyto hinte ekana; morke biittafe hinte nayti simmana. <verse eid="JER 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />Hinte nayti banta biitta simmanaw de7iya gisho, hintew ufaysi de7ees” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />“Efreema kochata zuuzuntha ta si7as. Enti, ‘Neeni nuna wadhetiboonna wofaanoda wadhadasa; nuka keedida. Neeni Godaa, nu Xoossaa gidiya gisho nuna zaara; nuuni neeko simmana. <verse eid="JER 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Nu kase neepe haakidi bida; shin ha77i nu nagara paaxida. Ne nuna seerin, yeellatidi nu tiraa baqida. Nuuni nu na7atetha laytha nagaraa gisho, kawuyidanne yeellatida’ yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />“Efreemi taw tuma al7onne ta dosiya na7a gidennee? Taani iya sunthaa denthiya wode ubban iya hassayayis. Hessa gisho, ta wozanay iya laamotees; ta iyaw daro qadhetayis” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />“Hinte ogiyan malaata wothite; malaata mithi essite; hinte bida ogiya akeekite. Geela7o Isra7eele, simma; ne katamata gela. <verse eid="JER 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Hinteno, ammanoy bayna Isra7eeleto, awude gakanaw toylatetii? Goday sa7a bolla oorathaba oothana; hessika maccasi adde yuushon eqana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees: “Taani Isra7eele asaa di7etethaafe zaarada ehiya wode Yihuda biittaninne iya katamatan enti, ‘Neno xillotethi aqiya bessaw, geeshsha deriyaw, Goday nena anjo’ yaagidi zaaridi odetana. <verse eid="JER 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />Yihudaninne Yihudan de7iya katamatan asay daana; goshshanchotinne henthanchoti banta wudiyara yan daana. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Taani daaburanchota gashtisana; qassi koshatidi gilqidaysata kalsana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />He wode barkada ta yuushuwa xeellas; ta dhiskoy taw mal7o dhisko gidis.<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />“Taani Isra7eeleninne Yihudan asenne mehe kunthiya wodey yaana. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Enta shoddanaw, laallanaw, shira yegganaw, dhaysanawunne gado ehanaw dendidaysada enta zaarada gimbanawunne tokanaw dendana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" />“He wode asay, ‘Aawati qaw7e woyne ayfe min, nayta achay doccis’ yaagidi haasaya leemisoy attana. <verse eid="JER 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />Shin issoy issoy ba nagaran hayqana; qaw7e woyne ayfe miya oodeska iya achay doccana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />“Taani Isra7eeleranne Yihudara ooratha caaqo caaqana wodey yaana. <verse eid="JER 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />He caaqoy ta enta Gibxefe kessanaw enta kushiya oykida wode enta mayzatara caaqida caaquwa mela gidenna. Ta entaw azina mela gida uttinka enti ta caaquwa menthidosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" />“Shin taani he wodiyape guye Isra7eelera caaqana caaqoy haysa: taani ta higgiya enta guuggiyan wothana; enta wozanan xaafana. Taani enta Xoosse gidana; entika ta ase gidana. <verse eid="JER 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" />Hizape guye, asi ba laggiya woyko ba ishaa, ‘Godaa era’ yaagidi tamaarsenna. Guuthafe gita gakanaw ubbay tana erana. Taani enta naaquwa atto gaana; enta nagaraa zaarada qopike” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />Gallas poo7ana mela awa wothiday, qamma poo7ana mela ageenanne xoolinto kiittiday, abba qaathidi, beetay guummanaada oothey, iya sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa geeteteysi haysada yaagees. <verse eid="JER 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />“Ha eqidi de7iya medhetetha higgey ta sinthafe shaaretiko, he wode Isra7eele kochay ta dere gideysi merinaw attana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />“Bolla salota wadhanaw woyko garsa sa7aa baasoy eretanaw danda7iko, he wode ta Isra7eele zeretha ubbaa, enti oothida nagaraa gisho ta sinthafe diggana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />“Hanaani7eela shako Gimbiyafe doomidi, Maazane Pengiya gakanaw Yerusalaame katamay ta katama gididi, keexetiya wodey yaana. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />He katamaa zaway wuloha baggafe bidi Gaareba zumanne Go7a yuushuwa gakanaw dalgana. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Aha moogiyanne bido yeggiya zangaaraynne Qediroona Zangaarape qommora doloha baggara bidi, Para Penge maazaniya gakanaw de7iya biitta ubbay Godaas dummatidi, geeshshi gidana. Hizape guye, katamay merinaw shodetenna; laaletenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi Gade Shammis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />Yihuda kawoy Sedeqiyaasi kawotida tammantho laythan, Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori kawotida tammanne hospuntho laythan Godaape ha qaalay Ermiyaasako yis. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />He wode Babiloone kawa olanchoti Yerusalaame teqidosona; nabey Ermiyaasi Yihuda kawo gadhon de7iya, naageysata dabaaban iya bolla gordetin de7ees.<verse eid="JER 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Yihuda kawoy Sedeqiyaasi iya haysada yaagidi qachidi wothis: “Ne ayis haysada yaagada tinbite oday? ‘Goday ha katamaa Babiloone kawa kushen aathidi immana; I iya oykana’ yaagada ayis oday. <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />Yihuda kawoy Sedeqiyaasi Babiloone aadhidi imetana; I Babiloone kawa kushen gelana. Iya sinthan eqidi, iyara odetana; I ba ayfen iya be7ana. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Nabukadanaxoori Sedeqiyaasa Babiloone efana; ta iyabaa be7ana gakanaw I yan daana. Neeni Babiloonetara oletanaw qopiko, hessi new hanenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Ermiyaasi, “Godaa qaalay he wode taako haysada yaagidi yis” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />“Ne aawa isha Saluma na7ay, Hanami7eeli neeko yidi, ‘Wozanaw maati de7iya mata dabboy nena gidiya gisho Anatoota kataman de7iya ta gadiya shamma’ yaagana. <verse eid="JER 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />Goday gidaysada, ta aawa ishaa na7ay Hanami7eeli taako naageysata dabaaba yidi, ‘Wozanaw maati de7iya mata dabboy nena gidiya gisho, Biniyaame biittan Anatootan de7iya ta gadiya shamma’ yaagin, taani hessa odiday Godaa gideysa eras.<verse eid="JER 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />“Anatoota kataman de7iya gadiya ta aawa ishaa na7aa Hanami7eelape shammas. Iya gatiya mizaanen likin, tammanne laapun bira santime gidis. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Shama pirimaa markati de7iya bessan paramas; gordas; maatame iya bolla wothas; miishiya mizaanen likada iyaw immas. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Hessafe guye, taani zal7iya hanota qoncisiya ashshagetidi attametida shama pirimaanne attametiboona shama pirimaa ekas. <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />Ta aawa ishaa na7ay Hanami7eeli, shama pirimaa paramida markatinne naageysata dabaaban uttida Ayhudeti ubbay be7ishin, he shama pirimaa Mahiseya na7aa, Neera na7aa Baarokas immas. <verse eid="JER 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />Enta sinthan ta Baaroka haysada yaagada kiittas: <verse eid="JER 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees: Daro wode gam7ana mela ha ashshagetidi attametida pirimaanne attametiboona pirimaa efada oton wotha.’ <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees: ha biittan asay zaaridi keethe, gadenne woyne tokiya bessi shammana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />Taani Neera na7aa Baarokas shama pirimaa warqatiya immidaape guye, haysada yaagada woossas. <verse eid="JER 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />“Abeeti Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, ne salotanne sa7aa ne gita wolqaaninne ne micetida kushen medhadasa. New danda7etonnabay baawa. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />Neeni ne siiquwa mukulu asaas bessaasa; shin aawata nagaraa enta nayta bolla zaarasa. Abeeti gitanne wolqaama Xoossaw, ne sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa geetetees. <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />Ne halchoy gita; ne oothiya oosoy wolqaama. Asa oge ubbaa ne be7aasa; asa ubbaas iya ogiyadanne iya oosuwada zaarasa.<verse eid="JER 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />“Ne Gibxen malaatanne mallata oothadasa; hachi gakanaw ha mallata Isra7eele asaa giddoninne hara kawotethata ubbaa giddon ooso aggabaaka. Hessafe dendoysan ne sunthay ubba bessan eretis. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Neeni ne asaa Isra7eele Gibxefe malaataninne mallatan, ne mino qesiyan, ne micetida kushiyaninne gita dagaman kessadasa. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Enta mayzatas ne immanaw caaqida biitta, maathinne eessi goggiya biitta entaw immadasa. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Enti he biitta gelidi laattidosona. Shin enti new kiitetibookona; ne higgiya naagibookona; enti oothana mela ne kiitida ubbaa oothibookona. Hessa gisho, ne enta bolla ha gaduwa ubbaa ehadasa.<verse eid="JER 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />“Babiloone asay katamaa oykanaw gimbiya yuushuwan biitta dooridi teqidosona. Olape, koshapenne boshape dendoysan katamay enta oliya Babiloone kushen aadhidi imetis. Ne ha77i be7eysada ne gidaba ubbay poletis. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Abeeti Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, katamay Babiloone asaas imetanaw haniya wodeka ne tana, ‘Marka xeegada, miishen gadiya shamma’ gadasa” yaagada woossas.<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Hessafe guye, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis: <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“Taani Godaa, asa ubbaa Xoossaa. Taw danda7etonnabay de7ii?” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />Taani ha katamaa Babiloone asaasinne Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxooras aathada immana; enti iya oykana. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Ha katama teqida Babiloone asay yidi, katamaa taman xuuggana; pooqiya bolla Ba7aale eeqas ixaane cuyisishenne hara xoossatas ushsha yarsho gussishe tana hanqethida asay de7iya keethatika xuugetana. <verse eid="JER 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />“Isra7eeleynne Yihudi banta na7atethafe doomidi, ta sinthan iitabaape attishin, lo77oba, oothibookona; enti banta kushen oothida oosuwan tana hanqethidosona. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />Ha katamay keexetida wodepe hachi gakanaw, ha katamaa asay tana daro hanqethida gisho ha katamaa ta sinthafe dhaysana. <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />Isra7eeleynne Yihudi, enta kawotinne halaqati, enta kahinetine nabeti oothida iita ooso ubban tana yiloyidosona. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Enti banta som7uwa gidonashin, banta zokuwa taw zaaridosona. Ta enta zaara zaarada tamaarsinka, enti si7ibookona woyko seera ekibookona. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" />Enti ixetida banta eeqata ta sunthay xeegetida keethan essidi tunisidosona. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" />Enti banta adde naytanne macca nayta Moloka eeqas yarshanaw Hinooma Zangaaran Ba7aale eeqas yarsho dhoqa bessata giigisidosona. Enti hessa oothana mela ta kiittabike; Yihuda asay nagara oothana mela hessa enti oothana gada ta naagabike” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />“Neeni, ‘Ha katamay olan, koshaninne boshan Babiloone kawa kushen aadhidi imetana’ yaagida ha katamaaba Goday Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees. <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />Ta suulliya hanquwaninne gita sheniyan enta laallida biitta ubbaafe shiishada ha bessaa zaara ehada, enti sarotethan daana mela oothana. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Enti ta ase gidana; ta enta Xoosse gidana. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Enti taw merinaw yayyana mela, ta entaw issi wozananne issi oge immana; hessi entawunne entafe guye enta naytas lo77o gidana. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Taani entara merinaw caaqana; he caaquwan ta entaw lo77oba ooso aggike. Enti tana aggidi guye simmonna mela enti taw yayyana mela oothana. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Ta entaw lo77oba ootheysi tana ufaysees; ta kumetha wozanapenne ta kumetha shempuwafe tuma ha biittan enta tokana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />“Ta ha asaa bolla iita bosha ubbaa ehidaysada ta entaw immana gida lo77oba ubbaa immana. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Hinte, ‘Ha biittay asaynne mehey bayna baysa biitta gidana; I Babiloonetas imetis’ yaagida biittan asay zaaridi gade shammana. <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Ta enta zaarada ehiya gisho, asay gade shammana; marka sinthan zal7iya hanota qoncisiya pirima paramidi, maatame wothana. Haysi ubbay Biniyaame biittan, Yerusalaame yuushuwan de7iya heeratan, Yihuda katamatan, derey dariya katamatan, gadha katamataninne Negebe mela biittan de7iya katamata ubban hanana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s1">Simo Ufaysa Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Ermiyaasi buroo naageysata dabaaban qashetidi de7ishin, Godaa qaalay zaaridi iyako yis. <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />Sa7aa medhida Goday, giigisidi iya bessan wothida Goday, iya sunthay Godaa geeteteysi haysada yaagees: <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />“Tana xeega; ta new koyana; ne eronna gitabaanne wolqaamaba ta new qoncisana.” <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, Babiloone olaa, biitta doorethaanne, di7etetha teqana mela dirsa gimbiya minthanaw laallida ha katama keethatabaanne Yihuda kawota gadhotaba haysada yaagees. <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />Enta iitatetha gaason, ta ha katamaa bollafe ta som7uwa denthida gisho, hintera oletanaw taani ta hanquwan shocana asaa ahan ha bessan kunthanaw Babilooneti gelana.<verse eid="JER 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />Gidoshin, “ta ha katamaanne iyan de7iya asaa zaarada pathana; enta payyatetha zaarana; saronne wopa duussu entaw immana. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Taani Yihuda asaanne Isra7eele asaa di7ope zaarana; enti kase de7idaysada oothada enta gimbana. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Enti tana oothida nagara ubbaafe ta enta geeshshana; enti naaquwanne enta makalla ubbaa atto gaana. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Yerusalaame katamay taw ufaysi, bonchonne galata sa7an de7iya kawotethata ubbaa sinthan ehana. Taani Yerusalaame asaas oothiya lo77obaanne katamaas ehiya duretethaanne sarotethaa si7idi, kawotethati ubbay yashshan kokorana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />“Hinte, ‘Asinne mehey bayna baysa’ gida ha bessan, asinne mehey bayna Yihuda katamataninne Yerusalaame ogetan ufaysinne ililsa girsi si7etana. <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" />Yethinne Yaagano girsi, ufaysa girsi, hessadaka, xoossa keethi galata yarsho ehidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">“I keeha gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">iya maarotethay merinaasa gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa galatite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">yaagidi yexishe xoossa keethi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">galata yarsho ekidi yaa asaa girsay si7etana.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Taan enta di7ope zaarana; enti kase de7idaysada oothada wothana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />“Ha asaynne mehey bayna baysa biittaninne iyan de7iya katamatan henthanchoti banta dorsa wudiya heemmiya gadey daana. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />Gezze katamatan, gadha katamatan, Negebe mela biittan de7iya katamatan, Biniyaame biittan, Yerusalaame yuushuwan de7iya bessataninne Yihuda katamatan henthanchoti banta dorsata zaaridi taybana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />“Taani Isra7eele asaasinne Yihuda asaas gelida qaala poliya wodey yaana. <verse eid="JER 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />He wode taani Dawita kochaafe issi xillo Aaca denthana; I suure pirda pirdana; xillo oothana. <verse eid="JER 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />He wode Yihuda asay attana; Yerusalaame asay wopu gidi de7ana. Ha katamay, ‘Goday nu Xillotethaa’ geetetidi xeegetana. <verse eid="JER 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />Dawita kochaafe Isra7eele araatan uttiya asi dhayenna. <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" />Hessadaka, xuussa yarsho, katha yarshonne hara yarsho yarshanaw Leewe kochaafe kahine gidiya asi merinaw ta sinthafe dhayenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />“Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />Gallasasinne qammas ta wothida wogaa menthidi, gallasinne qammi banta wodiyan simeretonna mela oothidi ta caaquwa laammanaw hinte danda7iko, <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />iya kochaafe araatan uttiya asi dhayonnaada, ta aylliya Dawitara caaqida caaquwa laammana; taw oothiya, Leewe koche gidida kahinetara caaqida caaquwa laammana. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Taani ta aylliya Dawita kochaanne ta sinthan oothiya Leewe kocha taybanaw danda7etonna salo xoolintotadanne makanaw danda7etonna abba shafiyada darsana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Godaa qaalay qassika Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Ha asay, ‘Goday ba doorida nam7u kawotethata, Isra7eelenne Yihuda aggaagis’ yaagidi odeteysa ne akeekabikii? Enti ta asaa kadhidi, bana danda7ida kawotethi gidokona gidi qopoosona. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Taani gallasaranne qammara caaqida caaquwanne salonne sa7a higgiya minthaboonnaba gidiko, <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />Yayqooba zerethaanne ta aylliya Dawita kochaa aggaagana. Iya naytape Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Yayqooba kochata bolla kawothanaw Dawita kochaa doorike. Taani ta asaa maarana; enta shaluwa zaarana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s1">Sedeqiyaasas Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori, iya olanchoti ubbaynne I haariya kawotethatan de7iya asa ubbay, Yerusalaamenne Yerusalaame yuushuwan de7iya katamata ubbaa oliya wode, ha qaalay Godaape Ermiyaasako yis: <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" />Goday Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagis; “Bada Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasako haysada yaaga: ‘Taani ha katamaa Babiloone kawa kushen aathada immana; I katamaa taman xuuggana. <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Neeni iya kushepe kessa ekaka; neeni oyketana; iyaw aadhada imetana. Neeni ne ayfen Babiloone kawa be7ana; ika neera odetana. Neeni Babiloone biitta baana’ yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />“Gidoshin, Yihuda kawaw Sedeqiyaasa, Goday giyaba si7a. Neeni olan hayqaka. <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />Ne saro hayqana. Neepe kase de7ida kawota bonchuwas, ne mayzatas ixaane cuyisidaysada, asay ne bonchuwas ixaane cuyisana. Woo! nu kawaw, yaagidi new yeekana. Taani Goday haysa odayis” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Hessafe guye, nabey Ermiyaasi ha tinbitiya Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasas Yerusalaamen odis. <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />He wode Babiloone olanchoti Yerusalaame katamaanne Yihudan attida Laakisonne Azeeqa katamata olidosona. Yihudan attida gimbetida katamati enta xalaala.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aylletethafe La77a Kessi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Kawoy Sedeqiyaasi aylleta la77a kessiya awaajuwa awaajanaw Yerusalaamen de7iya asa ubbaara caaqidaape guye, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis: <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />He awaajoy, issi issi Ibraawe asi addenne macca aylle aylletethafe la77a kesso. Oonika Ayhude asi gidida ba ishaa aylle oothofo. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Hessa gisho, asaynne halaqati ubbay caaqida caaquwan banta addenne macca aylleta aylletethafe la77a kessanawunne zaaridi aylletethan haaronna agganaw giigidi enta aylletethafe la77a kessidosona. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Shin enti banta qofaa laammidi, aylletethafe la77a kessida banta addenne macca aylleta zaaridi haaridosona.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Hessafe guye, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako yaagis. <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: “Taani hinte mayzata Gibxefe, aylletetha biittafe kessida wode entara haysada yaagada caaqas. <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" />He caaquwa maaran, ‘Ibraawe aylley de7iya ase ubbay, aylleta usupun laythi oosisidi, laapuntha laythan aylletethafe kessidi yeddite’ yaagada kiittas. Shin hinte mayzati ta odiyaba si7onna ixidosona; taw kiitetibookona. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Hinteka mata wodepe kase hinte nagaraape simmidi, aylleta la77a kessanaw awaajideta; ta sinthan suureba oothideta. Qassi hessa oothanaw ta sinthan, ta sunthay xeegetiya ta keethan caaqideta. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Shin hinte, hinte qofaa laammidi, ta sunthaa tunisideta. Enti koyida bessaa baana mela la77a kessida addenne macca aylleta zaaridi haarideta.”<verse eid="JER 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />Hessa gisho, Goday, “Hinte taw kiitetonna ixidi, hinte ishaa woyko hinte shooruwa aylletethafe la77a kessiya awaajuwa awaajibeketa. Hinte bolla oli, boshinne koshi keyana mela ta awaajayis. Ta hintena sa7a bolla de7iya kawotethatas dagama oothana. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18" />Ta caaquwa menthida asaa, ta sinthan caaquwa naagonna ixida asaa, shukidi, nam7u bessan shaakidi, iya giddora aadhida maraa mela ta enta oothana. <verse eid="JER 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19" />He asay Yihuda halaqata, Yerusalaame halaqata, biitta ayseysata, kahinetanne nam7u bessan shaakida maraa ashuwa giddora aadhida asa ubbaa. <verse eid="JER 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />Ta enta, enta morketa kusheninne enta wodhanaw koyiya asa kushen aathada immana; enta ahay salo kafotasinne sa7a do7atas kathi gidana.<verse eid="JER 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />“Taani Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasanne iya halaqata, enta morketa kushen, enta wodhanaw koyeyisata kusheninne hintena oleysa aggida Babiloone olanchota kushen aathada immana. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />Taani Babiloone olanchota kiittin; enti ha katama simmana. Enti ha katamaa olana, di7ananne taman xuuggana. Yihudan de7iya katamata asi doonna baysa bessi oothana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s1">Rakaaba Yarata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />Iyosyaasa na7aa Yihuda kawa Iyo7aqeema laythan, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“Rakaaba yara gidida asaako bada, entara odetada, Xoossa keetha kifiletape issuwa giddo gelsada woyne ushsha entaw imma” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Taani bada, Kabasa na7aa na7aa, Ermiyaasa na7aa Ya7izaana, iya ishatanne iya adde nayta ubbaa, Rakaaba yaraa ubbaa ekada, <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />xoossa keethi ehas. Enta, Yigidaala na7aa, Xoossa asi gidida Hanaana nayta kifile gelsas. He kifiley, pengiya naagiya Saluma na7aa Ma7iseya kifiliyape bolla baggara, halaqata kifiliya matan de7ees. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Hessafe guye, taani Rakaaba yarata sinthan woyne ushshay kumida xuggatanne xuu7ata wothada, “Woyne ushsha uyite” yaagas.<verse eid="JER 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Shin enti zaaridi, “Nu woyne ushshu uyoko; nu mayzay Rakaaba na7ay Yoonadaabi nuuko, ‘Hintenne hinte nayti woyne ushshu merinaw uyopite. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />Keethe keexofite; goshshe goyopite; woyne tokofite. Dunkaane giddon de7ite; hinte adussa laythi ha biittan daana’ yaagis. <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Nu mayzay Rakaaba na7ay Yoonadaabi nuna kiitida ubbaa kiitetida. Nuuni woyko nu macheti woyko nu adde nayti woyko nu macca nayti nu de7o laytha ubban woyne ushshu uyibooko. <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />Duussa keethi keexibooko; woyne gade woyko goshshi nuus baawa. <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />Nu dunkaanen de7ida; nu mayzay Yoonadaabi kiitida ubbaa kiitetida. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Shin Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori nu biitta bolla dendida wode, ‘Babiloonenne Soore olanchotape attanaw, Yerusalaame boos’ yaagida. Ha77i nu Yerusalaamen de7ey hessasa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Hessafe guye, Goday Ermiyaasako yaagis. <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees. “Yihuda asaakonne Yerusalaame asaako bada haysada yaaga; ‘Ta qaala naaganaw haysafe tamaareketi.’ <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />Rakaaba na7ay Yoonadaabi ba adde nayta woyne ushshu uyonnaada kiittida kiitaa naagidosona. Enti banta mayza kiitaa naagidi hachi gakanaw woyne ushshu uyokona. Taani hintew ubba wode odayis; shin hinte tana si7ibeeketa. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Taani zaarada zaarada nabeta, ta aylleta hinteko yeddas; enti, ‘Hinte ubbay hinte iita ogiyape simmite; hinte oosuwa loythite; hara xoossata goyinnofite; entaw oothopite. He wode, ta hintewunne hinte mayzatas immida biittan hinte daana’ yaagidosona. Shin hinte tana si7anaw hinte haythaa taako zaaribeeketa. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Rakaaba na7aa Yoonadaabe kochati enta mayzay enta kiitida kiita oothidosona; shin ha asay taw kiitetibeenna yaaga” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />“Hessa gisho, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees. ‘Si7ite, ta Yihuda asaa bollanne Yerusalaamen de7eyisata bolla ehana gida iitabaa ehana. Ta entaw odin, si7onna ixidosona; ta enta xeegin koyonna ixidosona’ ” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Hessafe guye, Ermiyaasi Rakaaba yaratako, “Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay hintena haysada yaagees: ‘Hinte, hinte mayza Yoonadaabas kiitetida gisho, iya wogaa kaallida gishonne I kiitida ubbaa oothida gisho, <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />Rakaaba na7ay Yoonadaabi, taw oothiya adde asi awudeka dhayenna’ ” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s1">Iyo7aqeemi Xaatha Maxaafa Xuuggis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />Iyosyaasa na7ay Yihuda kawoy Iyo7aqeemi kawotida oyddantho laythan, Goday Ermiyaasako haysada yaagis: <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Issi xaatha maxaafaa ekada, Iyosyaasa wode taani new odo doomida koyro gallasape doomada, hachi gakanaw Isra7eele bolla, Yihuda bollanne hara kawotethata bolla taani odida qaala ubbaa xaafa. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Ta Yihuda asaa bolla ehana gada halchida bosha ubbaa si7idi, ooni eri, enti banta iita oosuwape simmana; ta enta naaquwanne enta nagaraa atto gaana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Hessa gisho, Ermiyaasi Neera na7aa Baaroka xeegidi, Goday iyaw odidaba ubbaa Baarokas odin, I xaatha maxaafan xaafis. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Hessafe guye, Ermiyaasi Baarokako, “Taani qasho keethan de7iya gisho, xoossa keethi gelanaw danda7ike. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Hessa gisho, ne xooma gallas xoossa keethi bada, ta odin, ne xaatha maxaafan xaafida Godaa qaala entaw nabbaba; banta katamatape yida Yihuda asa ubbaas nabbaba. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Ha asaa bolla Goday awaajida hanqoy gita gidiya gisho, ooni eri, enti banta iita oosuwape simmidi, Godaa woossana” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Neera na7ay Baaroki nabey Ermiyaasi kiittidaysada xoossa keethan Godaa qaala ubbaa nabbabis.<verse eid="JER 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />Iyosyaasa na7ay Yihuda kawoy Iyo7aqeemi kawotida ichashantho laythan, uddufuntho ageenan, Yerusalaamen de7iya asaasinne Yihuda katamatape yida asa ubbay Godaa sinthan xoomana mela awaajidosona. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Baaroki Xoossa keethan, qommo bagga dabaaban, Ooratha Penge geetetiya bessan, xaafiya Safaana na7aa, Gamaara kifiliyan eqidi, Ermiyaasa qaalay xaafetida xaatha maxaafa asa ubbaas nabbabis.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Safaana na7aa na7ay, Gamaara na7ay Mikayi maxaafape Godaa qaala Baaroki nabbabishin si7ida wode, <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />kawo gadhon xaafey uttiya kifiliya bis. I biya wode, xaafey Elishami, Shamaya na7ay Dali, Akboora na7ay Elnaatani, Safaana na7ay Gamaara, Hananiya na7ay Xidiqenne hara halaqati yan uttidosona. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Baaroki asas maxaafape nabbabishin si7ida qaala ubbaa Mikayi entako odis. <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />Halaqati Naatana na7aa Yihuda Baarokako kiittidi, “Asaas neeni nabbabida maxaafaa ekada haa ya” yaagidosona. (Naatani Salama na7a; Salami Kuusa na7a.) Baaroki maxaafaa ekidi, entako yis. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Entika iya, “Ane uttada, nuus maxaafaa nabbaba” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Yaagin Baaroki maxaafaa nabbabis. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />I nabbabida qaala ubbaa si7idi yayyidosona, issoy issuwa xeellidi, Baaroka, “Ha qaala ubbaa nuuni kawas odanaw koshshees” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Qassika zaaridi, “Neeni ha qaala ubbaa waatada xaafidaako nuus oda. Haysa new Ermiyaasi odin xaafadii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Baaroki, “Ee, ha qaala ubbaa Ermiyaasi ba doonape taw odis; taani qalamen ha xaatha maxaafan xaafas” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Enti Baaroka, “Neeninne Ermiyaasi bidi qosetite; hinte de7iya bessaa oonika eropo” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Halaqati maxaafa xaafiya Elishama kifilen wothidaape guye, kawoy de7iya dabaaba bidi, hanidaba ubbaa kawas odidosona. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />He maxaafaa ehana mela, kawoy Yihuda kiittis; xaatha maxaafaa Elishama kifilepe ehidi, kawasinne iya yuushuwan eqida halaqatas nabbabis. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Uddufuntho ageenan sa7i balgo gidiya gisho, kawoy balguwa aathiya keethan uttis. He wode kawa sinthan de7iya coociyan Tami eexees. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Yihudi heedzu woyko oyddu bessata nabbabidaape guye, kawoy he bessata xaatha maxaafape mashshan qanxi qanxidi, taman yeggis; hessada oothidi, maxaafa kumethi xuuggis. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Ha qaala si7idi kawoynne iyara oothiya moorinnati ubbay ayinne babibookona; woyko kayotidi, banta ma7uwa peedhibokonna. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Hari attoshin Elnaatani, Dalaynne Gamaari kawoy he maxaafaa xuuggonna mela woossinka, enta woosa si7onna ixis. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Kawa na7a Yirahima7eela, Aziri7eela na7aa Sarayanne Abdi7eela na7aa Selema, xaafiya Baarokanne nabiya Ermiyaasa oykana mela kawoy kiittis. Shin Goday enta qottis.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi zaaridi Xaafida Xaatha Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Ermiyaasi odin, Baaroki xaafida maxaafaa kawoy xuuggidi simmin, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagishe yis: <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />“Hara xaatha maxaafaa ekada, Yihuda kawoy Iyo7aqeemi xuuggida xaatha maxaafan de7iya qaala ubbaa zaarada xaafa. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Qassi Yihuda kawa Iyo7aqeema haysada yaaga: Goday haysada yaagees; Neeni, ‘Babiloone kawoy yidi, ha biitta dhaysana; qassi yan de7iya asaanne mehiya wursana’ gada ayis xaafadii?” yaagada maxaafaa xuuggadasa.<verse eid="JER 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />“Hessa gisho, Goday Yihuda kawa Iyo7aqeema haysada yaagees: Dawita araatan uttiya kochay new kumthi deenna. Ne ahay coo holetidi, gallasi awa suulos, qamma meegon shocetana. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Hinte nagaraa gisho nena, ne kochaanne neera oothiya moorinnata ubbaa seerana. Enti taani odidaba si7onna ixida gisho, ta gida iitaba ubbay hinte bolla, Yihudaninne Yerusalaamen de7iya asa ubba bolla ehana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Hessafe guye, Ermiyaasi hara xaatha maxaafaa ekidi, Neera na7aa xaafiya Baarokas immis. Baaroki Yihuda kawoy Iyo7aqeemi taman xuuggida xaatha maxaafaa qaala ubbaa Ermiyaasi iyaw doonan odin xaafis. Qassi Ermiyaasi hessa daaniya hara qaalaka gujin, ubbaka Baaroki xaafis.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi Qasho Keethan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori Iyo7aqeema na7aa Ikoniyaana bessan Iyosyaasa na7aa Sedeqiyaasa Yihuda biittan kawothis. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Sedeqiyaasi, iyara oothiya halaqatinne biittan de7iya asa ubbay, Goday nabiya Ermiyaasa baggara odida qaalas kiitetibookonna. <verse eid="JER 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Shin kawoy Sedeqiyaasi Selema na7aa Yokaalanne Ma7iseya na7aa kahiniya Sofoniyaasa, “Hayyana, nu gisho Godaa nu Xoossaa woossa” yaagidi Ermiyaasako kiittis.<verse eid="JER 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />He wode Ermiyaasi qasho keethi geliboonna gisho, asaa giddon simeretees. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Gibxe kawa olanchoti, Gibxefe keydaysa Yerusalaame teqida Babiloone olanchoti si7ida wode Yerusalaame yeddidi keyidosona.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Hessafe guye, Godaa qaalay nabiya Ermiyaasako yis. <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“Goday Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: tana oychana mela hintena taako kiitida Yihuda kawas haysada yaagite; ‘Hintena maaddanaw yida Gibxe kawa olanchoti banta biitta simmidi baana. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />Qassi Babiloone olanchoti simmidi yaana; ha katamaa olidi oykana; taman iya xuuggana’ yaagite.<verse eid="JER 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />“Babiloone olanchoti simmidi yuussay attonna gisho ‘Babiloone olanchoti yookona’ gidi hintena hintew cimmofite. <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Hinte Babiloone olanchota kumethi xooniyakoka, madunxidi, dunkaanen zin7idaysati dendidi, ha katamaa taman xuuggana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Gibxe kawa olanchoti matida gisho, Babiloone olanchoti Yerusalaame aggidi banta de7iya bessaa guye simmidosona. <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />He wode Ermiyaasi ba gisho biitta ekanaw Biniyaame biitta baanaw Yerusalaamepe dendis. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Gidoshin, I bidi, Biniyaame Penge gakiya wode pengiya naageysatape issoy, Hananiya na7ay, Saleema na7a Yeera, “Ne nuna kaddada Babiloone baasa gidikii?” yaagidi oykis.<verse eid="JER 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Ermiyaasi zaaridi, “Ne geysa mela ta Babiloone biya asi gidike” yaagis. Shin Yeerey I geysa si7onna ixidi Ermiyaasa oykidi halaqatako efis. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Halaqati daro hanqetidi, Ermiyaasa wadhi, enti qasho keethi oothida, xaafiya Yoonataana keethan iya qachidosona. <verse eid="JER 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Ermiyaasi yan biitta garsan de7iya kifiliyan daro wode gam7is.<verse eid="JER 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Hessafe guye, kawoy Sedeqiyaasi ase kiittidi, Ermiyaasa ba kawo gadho xeegisidi, dumma qosan iya, “Goday new odidabay de7ii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Ermiyaasi zaaridi, “Ee de7ees; neeni Babiloone kawa kushen aadhada imetana” yaagis <verse eid="JER 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Qassika Ermiyaasi kawa Sedeqiyaasa haysada yaagidi oychis: “Tana hinte qasho keethan yegganaw ta ne bolla, new oothiya halaqata bolla woyko ha asaa bolla ay bala oothadina? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />Yaatin, ‘Babiloone kawoy yidi hintenanne hinte biitta olenna’ yaagidi new tinbite odida ne nabeti ha77i awun de7oona? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Ta godaw, kawaw, si7a; ta oychiya issiba ne polana mela nena woossayis. Ta he bessan hayqonna mela iya keethay qasho keethi gidida xaafiya Yoonataana soo tana guye zaaropa” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Kawoy Sedeqiyaasi naageysata dabaaban Ermiyaasa daana mela kiittis. Yan I de7ishin katamape daabboy dhayana gakanaw gallas gallas issi issi daabbo uukiya bessaafe ehidi iyaw immoosona. Hessa gisho, Ermiyaasa kawa zaban gam7is.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi Haatha Ollan Yegetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Mataana na7ay Safaaxi, Phaskora na7ay Godoliya, Selema na7ay Yokaalinne Malkaya na7ay Phaskori Ermiyaasi asa ubbaas odida qaala si7idosona. <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />Ermiyaasi, “Ha kataman attiya oonika olan, koshaninne boshan hayqana. Shin Babiloonetas ba kushe immiya oonika hayqenna; attana; de7on daana. <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />Yerusalaame katamay Babiloone kawa olanchota kushen aadhidi imetana; entika iya polo di77ana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Hessafe guye, halaqati kawako bidi, “Ha addey hayqanaw koshshees; haysa mela oda odidi, ha kataman de7iya olanchotinne asa ubbay shuggana mela oothis. I ase qohiyaba amotteesipe attishin, saroba amottenna” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Kawoy Sedeqiyaasi zaaridi, “Hinte iya bolla oothana gidaba ta hintena digganaw danda7ike” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Enti Ermiyaasa kawo gadho dabaaban de7iya, kawa na7aa Malkaya haatha ollan, wodoron duge yeggidosona. He wode he ollan silimope attishin, haathi baawa; Ermiyaasi he silimuwa giddo gelis.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Shin Tophe ase gidida, kawo morinay, Abemeleke geetetiya addey Ermiyaasi ollan yegetidaysa si7is. He wode kawoy Biniyaame Penge pirda oyden uttis. <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Ebed-Meleki kawako bidi, haysada yaagis; <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“Ta godaw kawaw, ha asati gita iitabaa oothidosona; enti nabiya Ermiyaasa haatha ollan yeggidosona. Qassi kataman qumi bayna gisho I yan koshan hayqana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Kawoy zaaridi, Tophe addey Ebed-Melekako, “Hastamu asi neera eka bada, Ermiyaasi hayqonna de7ishin haatha ollafe kessite” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Ebed-Meleki ase ekidi, bidi kawo gadhon shalo minjiya keethaafe garsa baggara de7iya kifiliya gelidi, gal7a ma7onne curqa ekis. He curqa wodoruwa xeeran qachidi, Ermiyaasas duge olla giddo yeddis. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Tophe addey Ebed-Meleki Ermiyaasa xeegidi, “Ha curqa ma7uwa wodoruwape garsara ne shophiyan wotha” yaagis. Ermiyaasi I gidaysada oothis. <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />Enti wodoruwara goochidi, Ermiyaasa ollaafe kessidi, naageysata keethi gelsidi gordidosona.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sedeqiyaasi Ermiyaasa Zaaridi Oychis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Hessafe guye, kawoy Sedeqiyaasi Ermiyaasa kiittidi ehisidi, xoossa keethi geliya heedzantho pengiya matan, “Ta nena issiba oychana; ne taape qosopa” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Ermiyaasi zaaridi, “Ta odiko, ne tana wodhikii? Ta zorin ne si7aka” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Kawoy Sedeqiyaasi, “De7o Xoossay eriya mela, ta nena wodhike; nena wodhanaw koyeysatas aathada immike” yaagidi qosan Ermiyaasas caaqis.<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Ermiyaasi zaaridi, “Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: ‘Babiloone kawa halaqatas ne kushe immiko, ne paxa attana; ha katamay taman xuugetenna; nenne ne keetha asay de7on daana. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Shin ne entaw kushe immonna ixiko, ha katamay Babiloonetas aadhidi imetana; enti iya xuuggana; ne entafe kessa ekaka’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Kawoy Sedeqiyaasi, “Ta yayyey ha biitta kaddidi, Babiloone bida Ayhudetasa. Babilooneti tana enta kushen aathidi immin, Ayhudeti tana kaa7ana” yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="JER 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Ermiyaasi, “Aykoy baawa! Enti nena entaw aathidi immokona. Ta odiya Godaa qaalas hayyana kiiteta. Hessi new lo77o gidana; ne paxa attana. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Shin ne kushe immonna ixiko, Goday tana bessida qoncethi de7ees. <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />Hessika, Yihuda kawo gadhon attida maccasati ubbay di7etidi, Babiloone halaqatako baana. Enti neeko, ‘Ne mata laggeti nena balethidosona; enti nena xoonidosona. Shin ha77i ne tohoy silimo giddo gelin, he laggeti nena yeggidi bidosona’ yaagana. <verse eid="JER 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />Ne machetinne ne nayti ubbay Babiloone di7etidi baana. Ne enta kushepe kessa ekaka. Babiloone kawoy nena oykana. Ha katamay taman xuugetana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Sedeqiyaasi zaaridi, “Haysa ne taw odidaysa asas odonna ixiko ne hayqaka. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Halaqati ta neera odetidaysa si7idi, ‘Neera kawara ay odetidaako nuus oda. Ne nuus qottonna ixiko, nu nena wodhoko’ yaagidi oychana. <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />Neeni, ‘Ta yan hayqonna mela tana zaarada qasho keethi gidida Yoonataana soo yeddonna mela kawa woossas’ ” gada zara yaaga.<verse eid="JER 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Hessafe guye, halaqati ubbay Ermiyaasako yidi, he oysha oychidosona. Kawoy iya kiittidaysada entaw odis; Ermiyaasara kawara haasayishin si7ida asi bayna gisho enti si77i gidoosona. <verse eid="JER 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" />Yerusalaamey oyketana wodey gakanaw, Ermiyaasi naageysata dabaaban gordetidi gam7is.<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Kundethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:1-12">2 Kawo 25:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:4-16">Ermi 52:4-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />Sedeqiyaasi Yihudan kawotida uddufuntho laythan, tammantha ageenan, Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoorinne iya olanchoti ubbay yidi, Yerusalaame teqidosona. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Sedeqiyaasi kawotida tammanne issintho laythan, oyddantho ageenan, uddufuntho gallasan Babiloone olanchoti katama gimbiya menthidosona. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />He wode Babiloone kawa halaqati, Ergaal-Sarasira, Samgaar-Nabo, Sarsakimanne Ergaal-Sarasira geeteteysati hara daro halaqatara issife yidi Giddo Penge geetetiya bessan uttidosona.<verse eid="JER 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Yihuda kawoy Sedeqiyaasinne iya olanchoti ubbay Babiloone olanchota be7ida wode baqatidosona. Qamma katamaape keyidi, kawa atakilte bessaa efiya ogiyara, nam7u dirsa gimbeta issife gathiya pengiyara keyidi Yordaanose Zangaarako simmidi bidosona. <verse eid="JER 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Gidoshin, Babiloone olanchoti enta yedethidi, Iyaarko demba gathishe, Sedeqiyaasa oykidosona. Hamaata biittan, Irbila kataman de7iya kawa Nabukadanaxoorako efidosona. Kawoy Nabukadanaxoori yan Sedeqiyaasa bolla pirdis. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Babiloone kawoy, Sedeqiyaasa ade nayta iya sinthan, Irbila kataman wodhis; qassi Yihuda halaqata ubbaa wodhis. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Sedeqiyaasa ayfeta wooci kessidi, iya Babiloone biitta efanaw santhalaatan qachis.<verse eid="JER 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Babiloone olanchoti kawo gadhonne asay de7iya keetha ubbaa taman xuuggidosona; Yerusalaame gimbiyaka laallidosona. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani kataman attida asaanne kaddidi iyako yida asa ubbaa di77idi Babiloone biitta efis. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani aykoka bayna guutha manqota Yihudan aggidi, entaw woyne gadenne goshsha gade immis.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi Biletis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Nabukadanaxoori, kawa naageysata halaqaa Nabuzardaana haysada yaagidi kiittis: <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Bada Ermiyaasa koya demmada, iyaw koshshiyaba ubbaa ootha; iya bolla hara iitabaa aykoka oothofa” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Hessa gisho, Nabuzardaani, Nabushazbaana, Ergaal-Sarasiranne Babiloone kawa halaqata ubbaa kiittidi, <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" />Ermiyaasa qashetidi de7iya, naageysata dabaabape kessidosona. Ba soo efidi wothana mela Safaana na7aa, Akqaama na7aa Godoliyas hadara immidosona. Hessa gaason, Ermiyaasi ba biitta asaara issife de7is.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Ermiyaasi naageysata dabaaban qashetidi de7ishin, Godaa qaalay iyako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />“Bada, Tophe addiya Ebemelekako haysada yaaga: ‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees: hizape guye ta odidaysada ha katamaa bolla lo77oba gidonashin, dhayo ehana. Hessi ubbay haniya wode ne ha kataman uttada, ne ayfen be7ana. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Gidoshin, he gallas ta nena ashshana; ne yayiya, ne morketa kushen aathada immike. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Ta nena polo ashshana; ne olan hayqaka; ne tanan ammanetida gisho, hayqope attana’ ” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi La77atethan De7is</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani Ermiyaasa Raman birshidi simmin, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako yis. Nabuzardaani Yerusalaamepenne Yihudape di77idi, Babiloone efanaw qachida asaa giddon Ermiyaasi santhalaatan qashetidi de7ees.<verse eid="JER 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Kawa naageysata halaqay Ermiyaasa dumma kessidi, haysada yaagis: “Goday ne Xoossay, dhayo ha biitta bolla ehanaysa odis. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />I ehana gidaysada ha77i oothis; Godaa bolla hinte nagara oothida gishonne iyaw kiitetonna ixida gisho haysi ubbay hanis. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Heko, ha77i ta ne kushen de7iya santhalaata birshada nena yeddas. Taara Babiloone baana giiko yedha; ta new koshshiyaba ubbaa kunthana. Babiloone baanaw koyonna ixiko attanaw danda7aasa. Biitta ubbay ne sinthan de7ees; nena lo77ida bessi awuka ba” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Ermiyaasi iya matape boonna de7ishin, Nabuzardaani gujidi yaagis; “Safaana na7aa, Akqaama na7aa Godoliyako ba. Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori iya Yihuda katamata haariya asi oothidi shuumis. Hessa gisho, iyara issife yan asaara de7a; woyko nena lo77ida bessi awuka ba” yaagis. Kawa naageysata halaqay iyaw shinqenne hara imota immidi yeddis. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />Ermiyaasi Mixiphan de7iya Akqaama na7aa Godoliyako bis. I yan attida asaara issife de7is.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godoliya Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:22-24">2 Kawo 25:22-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />Yihuda toora moconatapene olanchotape guuthati Babiloone kawas kushe immibookona. Enti Babiloone kawoy, Akqaama na7a Godoliya biitta haareysa oothidi shuumidaysanne Babiloone di7etidi boonna Yihudan attida manqotas halaqa oothidaysa si7idosona. <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />Naatana na7ay Isma7eeli, Qareya nayti Yohaaninne Yoonataani, Tanhumeta na7ay Sarayi, Naxoofa addiya Yoofa naytinne Ma7ika addiya na7ay Yazaani banta olanchota ubbaara Godoliyako Mixipha yidosona. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Safaana na7ay, Akqaama na7ay Godoliya entaw haysada yaagidi caaqis: “Babiloonetas kushe immanaw yayyofite; he biittan de7ite. Babiloone kawas haaretite; ubbabay hintew inje gidana. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />Ta Mixiphan uttada, Babiloone biittafe hintera gahetanaw yaa ubbaara hinte doona gidada odetana. Shin hinte de7iya bessan woyne, shamaho zaytenne hara katha ayfe ubbaa shiishidi dagayite” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Moo7aben, Amoonen, Edoomeninne hara biittatan de7iya Ayhude ubbay Babiloone kawoy, guutha Yihuda asati Yihudan attana mela oothidaysanne Safaana na7a Akqaama na7a Godoliya enta bolla shuumidaysa si7idosona. <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />Enti laaletidi de7iya banta biittafe Yihuda simmidi, Godoliya de7iya bessaa Mixipha yidosona. Yan enti daro woynenne hara katha ayfe shiishidi dagaayidosona.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Hessafe guye, Qaraya na7ay Yohaaninne kushe immiboona toora moconati ubbay Godoliyako Mixipha yidi, <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />“Amoone kawoy Ba7alisi nena wodhana mela Naatana na7aa Isma7eela yeddidaysa eray?” yaagidosona. Shin Akqaama na7ay Godoliya enti odaa ammanonna ixis.<verse eid="JER 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Qaraya na7ay Yohaani Mixiphan de7iya Godoliyako yidi, “Oonika eronna de7ishin bada, Nataniyaa na7aa Isma7eela ta wodhana. I nena wodhiko, ne matan shiiqida Ayhude ubbay laaletana; qassi Yihudan attida asa ubbay wurana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Shin Akqaama na7ay Godoliya zaaridi, “Isma7eelaba ne odiya ubbay wordo gidiya gisho hessa melaba oothofa” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />Laapuntha ageenan kawo koche gididi, kawa moorinnatape issoy, Elsama na7ay, Naatana na7ay Isma7eeli tammu asaara issife Akqaama na7aa Godoliyara gahetanaw Mixipha bis. Ubbay uttidi kathi mishin, <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" />Naatana na7ay Isma7eelinne iyara de7iya tammu asati banta mashshaa mashshaa kessidi, Babiloone kawoy Yihuda bolla shuumida Akqaama na7aa Godoliya wodhidosona. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Isma7eeli qassi Mixiphan Godoliyara de7iya Ayhudetanne Babiloone olanchota ubbaa wodhis.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Godoliya hayqida wontetha gallas, oonika iya hayquwa eronna de7ishin, <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" />Seekemape, Seelopenne Samaarepe hospun tammu asati azzanidi, banta buuchaa meedidi, banta ma7uwa daakidi, banta som7uwa gaarishe yidosona. Enti Xoossa keethaas immiya kathinne ixaane ehidosona. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Isma7eeli yeekishe Mixiphafe keyidi, entara gahetanaw bis. Enta gahetida wode, “Akqaama na7aa Godoliyako haa yidi iya be7ite” yaagis. <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Enti katamaa gelida wode Isma7eelinne iyara de7iya asati enta wodhidi haatha ollan yeggidosona.<verse eid="JER 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Shin he hospun tammu asatape tammati Isma7eela haysada yaagidi woossidosona: “Nuna wodhopa! Nu goshshan nu qosida daro gistey, bangi, shamaho zayteynne eessi de7ees” yaagidosona. I enta wodhonna yeddi aggis. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Isma7eeli asaa wodhidi yeggida ollay, Isra7eele olanaw Ba7oosi yida wode kawoy Asi bookisida gita gimbetida haatha olla. Nataniyaa na7ay Isma7eeli he ollaa ahan kunthis. <verse eid="JER 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Isma7eeli kawa macca naytanne Mixiphan attida asa ubbaa di77is. Hessati kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani Akqaama na7aa Godoliya aawatetha garsan Mixiphan wothidaysata. I enta di77idi, baara ekidi, Amoone biitta baanaw dendis.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Qaraya na7ay Yohaaninne iyara de7iya toora moconati Isma7eeli oothida iitaba ubbaa si7idosona. <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />Banta asaa ekidi, iyara oletanaw bidosona; Isma7eela Gaba7oonan de7iya gita eele haatha matan oykidosona. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Isma7eeli di77idi efiya asa ubbay Qaraya na7aa Yohaanananne iyara de7iya toora moconata be7ida wode daro ufaytidosona. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />He di7etidaysati ubbay guye simmidi, Qaraya na7aa Yohaananan gahetidosona. <verse eid="JER 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Shin Isma7eelinne hara hospun asati Yohaananape kessi ekidi, Amoone biitta baqatidosona.<verse eid="JER 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Isma7eeli Akqaama na7aa Godoliya wodhidi, Mixiphafe di77idi ehida olanchoti, maccasati, naytinne shuufati ubbay Qaraya na7aa Yohaanaranne hara toora moconatara dendidi bidosona. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" />Enti yaape dendidi, Gibxe baanaw, Beeteleme matan de7iya Gerot-Kamahama geetetiya bessan shempidosona. <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />Enti Gibxe biday Babiloone kawoy shuumida Akqaama na7aa Godoliya Isma7eeli wodhida gisho, Babiloonetas yayyidi, Babiloonepe baqatidi, Gibxe baanaw dendidosona.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />Tora moconati ubbay, Qaraya na7ay Yohaani, Hoshaya na7ay azariyaas asa ubbay, guuthafe gita gakanaw, <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" />nabiya Ermiyaasako yidi, “Nu nena oychiyaba nuus ootharki. Attida nu gisho Godaa ne Xoossaa woossarki. Nu kase daro; shin ha77i ne be7eysada guutha asa xalaali attida. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />Nu biya ogiyanne nu oothanaba I nuna bessaana mela Godaa ne Xoossaa nu gisho woossa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Nabey Ermiyaasi zaaridi, “Lo77o; hinte oyshaada, Godaa hinte Xoossaa ta woossana; hintefe aykoka qosonna I odiyaba ubbaa hintew odana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Enti zaaridi, Ermiyaasako, “Goday ne Xoossay ne baggara nuna kiittiyaba ubbaa nu polonna ixiko, Goday ba huuphen nu bolla tumanne ammanetida marka gido. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Nu dosiyaba gidin, ixiyaba gidin, nu nena iyako kiittiya Goday, nu Xoossay kiittiyaba nu oothana. Nu iyaw kiitetiko, nuus ubbabay inje gidana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Tammu gallasape guye, Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako yis. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Qaraya na7aa Yohaana, iyara de7iya toora moconatanne asa ubbaa, guuthafe gita gakanaw xeegidi, <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Hinte woosa ta iyako shiishana mela hinte tana kiitida Goday Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees. <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />“ ‘Ta kase hinte bolla ehida iitabay tana azzanthida gisho, hinte ha biittan uttiko, ta hintena keexanape attishin, laallike; tokanape attishin, shoddike. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Hinte ha77i yayiya Babiloone kawas aykoka yayyofite. Hintena iya kushepe ashshanaw ta hintera de7iya gisho yayyofite. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Ta hintew qadhetana; yaatada I hintew qadhetidi, hintena hinte biitta zaarana mela oothana’ yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />“Gidoshin, hinte Godaas, hinte Xoossaas kiitetonna ixidi, ha biittan uttoko giiko, <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />qassi hinte, ‘Ola worenne olas punniya moyze si7onnanne koshi bayna Gibxe bidi, yan daana’ giiko, <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />hinteno, Yihudan attida asaw, Goday giyaba si7ite. Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees: ‘Hinte Gibxe bidi, yan daanaw qofa qachiko, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />hinte yayyida olay Gibxen hintena oykana; hinte hirgida koshay hintena kaallidi baana; hinte yan Gibxen hayqana. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Gibxe bidi daanaw qofa qachida asa ubbay olan woyko koshan woyko boshan hayqana. Ta enta bolla ehiya iitaape issoyka kessi ekenna woyko attenna’ yaagees.<verse eid="JER 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, ‘Yerusalaamen de7eyisata bolla ta hanqoynne ta yiloy gukidaysada, hinte Gibxe geliya wode hinte bolla ta hanqoy hessada gukana. Hinte dagamas, cashshas, baadethasinne miicha attana; ha bessaa zaaridi be7eketa’ yaagees.<verse eid="JER 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />“Yihudan attidaysato, Goday hinteko, ‘Gibxe boopite!’ yaagis. Ta hachi hinteko, ‘Naagetite’ geysa si7ite. <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />Hinte taako, ‘Nu gisho Godaa nu Xoossaa woossa; I new odiyaba ubbaa nuus oda; nu oothana’ yaagidi, tana Godaako, hinte Xoossaako, kiittideta; hessan gita bala balideta. <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Ta I gidaba ubbaa hachi hintew odas. Shin Goday hinte Xoossay ta baggara hintew kiitida qaalas kiitetonna ixideta. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Hiza, haysa si7ite; hinte bidi daanaw koyiya biittan hinte olan, koshaninne boshan hayqidi wurana” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="s1">Ermiyaasi Gibxe Bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />Goday enta Xoossay kiitida qaala ubbaa Ermiyaasi entaw odidi wursidaape guye, <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />Hoshaya na7ay Azaariyasi, Qaraya na7ay Yohaaninne otorancho asa ubbay Ermiyaasako, “Ne wordo odaasa! Goday nu Xoossay nu Gibxe bidi uttonna mela digganaw nena nuuko kiittibeenna. <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Shin Babiloone asay nuna wodhanaada woyko di77idi banta biitta efanaada ne nuna enta kushen aathada immana mela nena nu bolla denthiday Neera na7aa Baaroka” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Qaraya na7ay Yohaani, toora moconati ubbaynne asa ubbay Yihuda biittan daana mela Goday enta kiitida kiitta polonna ixidosona. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />Qaraya na7ay Yohaaninne toora moconati ubbay banta laaletida kawotethata ubbaafe Yihudan daanaw simmida Yihuda asa bantara ekidi Gibxe bidosona. <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />Kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani Safaana na7aa, Akqaama na7aa Godoliyara daana mela ashshida addeta, maccasa, naytanne kawa macca nayta ubbaa efidosona. Qassi nabiya Ermiyaasanne Neera na7aa Baaroka efidosona. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Enti Godaa kiitaa ixidi, Gibxe biitta gelidi, Xafinaasa katamaa gakanaw bidosona.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Xafinaasan Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Gita shuchata ekada, Yihuda asay be7ishin, Xafinaasan de7iya Gibxe kawa gadho geliya bessan sintha baggara de7iya baasuwan mooga. <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Entako, ‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees; ta kiittada, ta aylliya Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoora ehisana. Ha moogetida shuchata bolla iya kawotethaa araata wothana. I ba kawotetha dunkaaniya iya bolla essana. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />I yidi Gibxe biitta olana. Hayqos besseysati hayqana; di7etanaw besseysati di7etana; mashshan hayqanaw besseysati mashshan hayqana. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />Gibxen de7iya eeqa xoossata keethaa tama oythana; eeqata xuuggana woyko di77ana. Henthanchoy ba itiya ma7eysada, Gibxe biitta ma7ana. Yaatidi, yaape saro baana. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />I, Gibxe biittan Heliyoota kataman de7iya hawultiya mentherethana; Gibxe xoossata keethaa taman xuuggana’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s1">Eeqa Goyinnoy Kaalethida Meto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Gibxen Migdoola, Xafinaasa, Mempisanne Phatiroosa biittan de7iya Ayhudetas Godaa qaalay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, Yerusalaame bollanne Yihuda katamaa ubbaa bolla ta ehida dhayo ubbaa hinte, hinte ayfen be7ideta. Enti hachi gakanaw laaletidi attidosona; oonika yan deenna. <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />Hessi haniday, enti iita ooso oothidi, tana hanqethida gishosa. Enti woyko hinte woyko hinte mayzati eronna hara xoossatas ixaane cuyisidi entaw goyinnidosona. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />‘Ta ixiya haysa mela iitabaa oothopite’ yaagidi odana mela zaara zaara ta aylleta, nabeta kiittas. <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Gidoshin, enti si7onna woyko akeekona ixidosona. Hara xoossatas ixaane cuyisiya iita oosuwa aggonna ixidosona. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Hessa gaason ta suulliya hanqoynne yiloy Yihuda katamata bollanne Yerusalaame ogetan eexis. Enti hachi hinte be7eysada laaletidosona; baysa gididosona.<verse eid="JER 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />“Ha77ika Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay, Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees; hinte kochay attonna mela, maccasa, addeta, naytanne yooga nayta Yihuda biittafe dhaysanaada iitabaa hinte, hinte bolla ayis oothetii? <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Hinte daanaw yida Gibxe biittan hara xoossatas ixaane cuyisidi tana ayis hanqethetii? Sa7an de7iya kawotethata ubbaa giddon baadethasinne bores attidi, hintena dhaysanaw ayis koyeetii? <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Kase hinte aawati, Yihuda kawotinne enta macheti, hintenne hinte macheti Yihuda katamataninne Yerusalaame ogetan oothida iita ubbaa dogidetiyee? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Hinte hachi gakanaw hintenatethaa kawushibeketa; tana bonchibeeketa. Ta hintewunne hinte mayzatas immida higgiyanne woga kaallibeketa.<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />“Hessa gisho, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees; ta hintena, Yihuda zertheta ubbaa dhaysanaw qofa qachas. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Yihudan attida asaa giddofe, Gibxe bidi, yan daanaw qofa qachidaysata ta dhaysana. Enti ubbay Gibxen wurana; olaninne koshan hayqana. Gitape guuthu gakanaw de7iya ubbay olaninne koshan dhayana. Enti dagamas, cashshas, baadethasinne miichas attana. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Ta Yerusalaame, olan, koshaninne boshan seeridaysada Gibxe biittan de7eyisata seerana. <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />Attida Yihuda asaape Gibxe bidi de7eysati Gibxeta kushiyape polo kessi ekokona. Enti simmidi daana gidi amotiya Yihuda biitta ay asika simmenna. Guutha asape attishin, oonika simmidi yeenna” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Enta macheti hara xoossatas ixaane cuyisethi eriya addey ubbay, yan de7iya maccasa ubbaynne gita maabara gididi, Gibxeninne Phatiroosan de7iya asa ubbay Ermiyaasako haysada yaagidosona. <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />“Neeni Godaa sunthan nuus odiyaba ubbaa nu si7oko. <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Nu oothana gidi qopidaba ubbaa oothana. Nuuni, nu mayzati, nu kawotinne nu halaqati Yihuda katamataninne Yerusalaame ogetan kase oothidaysada Salo Kawiw geetetiyaris nu xoossees ixaane cuyisana; ushsha yarshuwa iw gussana. Nu kase hessa oothiya wode, nuus daro kathi de7ees; he wode nuus sa7i keeha; nuna aybika metibeenna. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Shin Salo Kawees ixaane cuyiseysanne ushsha yarsho gusseysa aggidaape guye, nuus ubbabay pacis; nu olaninne koshan wurida” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Maccasati gujidi, “Nu Salo Kawees malan uythu uukiya wode, ixaane cuyisiya wodenne ushsha yarsho iw gussiya wode nu azinati eronna de7ishin, nu oothidabay aybika baawa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Haysada yaagidi zaarida asa ubbaas, maccasasinne addetas, Ermiyaasi haysada yaagis; <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“Hintenne hinte mayzati, hinte kawotinne hinte halaqati, biittan de7iya asa ubbay, Yihuda katamataninne Yerusalaame ogetan ixaane cuyisidaysa Goday erenna woyko dogis gidi qopeetii? <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Hinte oothiya iitanne shaatiya oosuwa Goday si77i gaanaw danda7iboona gisho, hinte biitta hachi hinte be7eysada laaletida, baysanne baadetida biitta oothis. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Ha dhayo ubbay hintena gakiday, hinte hara xoossatas ixaane cuyisida gishosa, Godaa bolla nagara oothida gishosa, Godaa qaala si7onna ixida gishosanne iya higgiya, iya wogaanne awaajuwas kiitetonna ixida gishosa” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Hessafe guye, Ermiyaasi asa ubbaasinne maccasas haysada yaagis; “Hinteno, Yihudape yidi, Gibxe biittan de7iya asaw, Goday giyaba si7ite. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, haysada yaagees; hintenne hinte macheti, ‘Nuuni Salo Kawees ixaane cuyisana; ushsha yarshuwa iw gussana’ gidi caaqida caaquwa polidi, ooson bessideta. Hiza, guye goopite; hinte caaquwa polite.<verse eid="JER 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />“Gidoshin, hinteno, Gibxe biittan de7iya Yihuda asaw, Goday giyaba si7ite! Goday haysada yaagees; ‘Hizape guye Gibxe biittan de7iya Yihuda asaape issoyka ta sunthan, “Ubbaa Haariya Goday ero” ’ gidi caaqonna mela ta gita sunthan caaqas. <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Ta enta bolla lo77oba gidonashin, iitabaa ehanaw minnayis. Gibxen de7iya Yihuda asay wurana gakanaw olaninne koshan hayqana. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Olape attida guutha asati Gibxefe Yihuda simmana. He wode Gibxen de7iya Yihuda asay, ta qaalapenne enta qaalape awusi tumeeko erana. <verse eid="JER 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />Ta hintena ha bessan seeriya wode, ‘Ta hinte bolla iitabaa ehana’ gidaysi tuma gideysas ta hintew malaata immana. <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" />Ta Yihuda kawa Sedeqiyaasa iyaw morke gididi, iya wodhanaw koyiya Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxooras aathada immidaysada Gibxe kawa Hofira iya wodhanaw koyiya iya morketas aathada immana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s1">Baarokas Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />Iyosyaasa na7ay Iyo7aqeemi Yihudan kawotida oyddantho laythan, Neera na7ay Baaroki ha qaalata Ermiyaasi odin, si7idi, maxaafan xaafis. He wode Ermiyaasi iyaw odida qaalay haysa: <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />“Baaroka, Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay neeko haysada yaagees: <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />Neeni, ‘Goday ta sakuwa bolla azzano gujida gisho tanooshsho! Taani un7an daaburada shempo dhayas’ ” yaagadasa.<verse eid="JER 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />Baaroka, Goday neeko haysada yaagees: “Ta keexidaysa ta laallana; ta tokidaysa ta shoddana. Ta haysa biitta ubban oothana. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Yaatin, ne new gitaba koyayee? Hessa koyopa. Asa ubbaa bolla ta dhayo ehana. Shin ne bida bessa ubban ta ne shempuwa ashshana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxes Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />Kawotethatabaa Goday Ermiyaasas odida qaalay haysa. <verse eid="JER 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />Iyo7aasa na7ay Iyo7aqeemi Yihudan kawotida oyddantho laythan, Efraxiisa shaafa matan, Karkamisha geetetiya bessan, Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori xoonida Gibxe kawa Nako olanchotabaa Goday haysada yaagees.<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />Hinte tooranne gondalle giigisite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:3">olas keyite.<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Hinte parata bixaalidi toggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">hinte huuphiyan birata barneexa wothite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Hinte bessaa bessaa oykite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">hinte toora leefite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">hinte ola ma7uwa ma7ite.<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />“Shin haysi ta be7ey aybee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">enti yayyidi guye simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Wolqaamati xoonetidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">guye xeellonna baqatidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">Enta yuusho ubban dagami de7ees”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 46:5">yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />Eesoteysi kessi ekenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">minoyka attanaw danda7enna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Pudeha baggan Efraxiisa shaafa matan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">ubbay dhubetidi kundidosona.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />Haysi Nayle shaafa kixada dendey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:7">di7o haathada goggey oonee?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Gibxey Nayle shaafada dendees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">di7o haathada gupees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Gibxey, “Taani kixada, biittan eellana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">katamatanne iyan de7iya asa ubbaa dhaysana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Parato, gupidi keyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">para gaareto woxite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Gondalle oykida Tophenne Puuxa asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">dongen dukiya Luuda asaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">mino olanchoto, dendidi oletite.<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />He gallasay Godaa Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa gallas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">Goday ba morketa bolla halo keyiya gallas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Iya mashshay kallana gakanaw enta maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">alana gakanaw enta suuthaa uyana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">pudeha baggan Efraxiisa shaafa matan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">enta yarsho oothidi ekana.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />Geela7ee, Gibxe macca naatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">Galada biitta bada tiyetiya dhale eha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Gidoshin, ne coo dhale darsaasape attishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">new paxoy baawa.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Kawotethati ne yeella si7idosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">ne yeehoy biitta ubbaa kumana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Ne olanchoti issoy issuwan dhubetidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">ubbay issife kundidosona.<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori Gibxe olanaw yaanaysa, Goday nabiya Ermiyaasas odida qaalay haysa:<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />Haysa Gibxen oda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">Migdoolan, Mempisaninne Xafinaasan awaaja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">Hinte bessan bessan eqite; giigetite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">hinte yuushuwan de7iya ubbaa mashshi maana.<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Hinte mino olanchoti ayis kundidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:15">Goday enta sugida gisho gidennee?<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Olanchoti dhubetidi kundidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">issoy issuwa, “Dendidi yedhite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">morke mashshafe attanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">nu asaako, nu biitta simmoos” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />Enti yan Gibxe kawako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">“Ba qaada go7etonna coo wursiya odancho” gidi sunthana.<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa” geetetiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">kawoy haysada yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">“Taani, ta shempuwan caaqayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">dereta giddon Taabore Derey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">abba matan de7iya Qarmeloosa Derey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">aduqeysada aduqiya morkey hinte bolla yaana.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Hinteno, Gibxen de7eysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">di7etidi baanaw giigite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">Mempisa katamay laaletidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">oonika de7onna mela biitta gidana.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />Gibxey lo77o ussa mela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">shin pudeha bagga biittafe yaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">boxiyan iya saxetana.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Miishey cigetin oothiya olanchoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">modhida wofaano mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Enta dhayo gallasay matida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">enti seeretiya wodey gakida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">enti issife guye simmidi baqatidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">enti banta bessan eqibookona.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Morkey wolqan sugidi yaa wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">Gibxe asay baqatiya shooshada kolxana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">Morketi mithi qanxiya asada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">kalta ekidi iya bolla yaana.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Asay sixida wora qeexidi dhayseysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">Gibxe asaa qanxidi wursana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Morketa tayboy boolepe daro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">enta taybanaw danda7etenna.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Gibxe macca na7iya kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:24">pudeha bagga asaas aadhada imetana.”<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees. “Taani Tebisa xoossa Amoone, kawa paarona, Gibxe biittanne Gibxe xoossata, Gibxe kawotanne kawa paarona bolla zempiya ubbaa seerana. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Enta shempuwa koyiya Babiloone kawa Nabukadanaxoora kusheninne iya olanchota kushen aathada immana. Hessafe guye, Gibxe biittay kaseysada asi de7iya biitta gidana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />“Ta aylliyaw, Yayqooba yayyofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">Isra7eele, dagammofa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Nena haaho bessafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">ne kochay di7etidi bida biittafe ashshana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Yayqoobi simmidi, saron wopu gidi daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">enta yashisiyabay deenna.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Ta aylliyaw, Yayqooba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">ta neera de7iya gisho, yayyofa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Ta nena laallida kawotethata ubbaa dhaysana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">shin nena dhaysike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Ta nena xillo pirdan seerana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">shin seeri bayna nena coo aggike” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s1">Filisxeemes Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />Gibxe kawoy Gaaza olidi oykanaape kase, Filisxeemeba Godaape nabiya Ermiyaasako yida qaalay haysa: <verse eid="JER 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />Goday haysada yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Heko, pudeha baggafe haathi dhuuqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">di7oy gelida kixa haathada goggana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Biittanne biittan de7iyaba ubbaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">katamatanne enta giddon de7iya asa ubbaa muukana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Asay waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">biittan de7iya ubbay yeekana.<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />Parata girsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">para gaareta kooshincha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">gaareta gondorsa girsaa si7ana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Aawata kushey argaacida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">banta nayta maaddanaw guye simmokona.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Filisxeeme asa dhaysanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">Xiroosanne Sidoona maaddanaw attiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">asaa dhaysanaw wodey gakis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">Goday Filisxeemepe attidaysata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">Haathan teqetida de7iya Kaftoorape yida kochata dhaysana.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Gaazi kayotada ba huuphiya meedasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">Asqalooni ba kushiya doonna bolla wothasu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Hinteno, abba gaxan attidaysato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">awude gakanaw hinte asatethaa gaaretii?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />Hinte, ‘Godaa mashshaw, neeni si77i goonna ixey awudesee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">Ne bessaa simmada gela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">si77i gada utta’ yaageeta.<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Shin Goday iya kiittin, I waanidi si77i gaanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">Asqaloonanne abba gaxan de7iya biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">olana mela kiittas” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s1">Moo7abes Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />Moo7abe Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“I dhayana gisho, Nabo katamaa ayye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">Qiratayma katamay yeellatananne; oyketana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">enta miixay kawuyana; meqeretana.<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />Hizape Moo7abe ceeqoy dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">Haseboona katamaa asay Moo7abe bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">‘Haayite, ha biitta dhaysana’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 48:2">yaagidi iitabaa maqetis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Neno, Madmaana katame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">mashshi nena yedethana gisho si77i ga.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Horonayma asay, ‘Dhayoynne kundethi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:3">gakis’ gidi waassiya waasuwa si7ite!<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />Moo7abey meqeretana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:4">iya nayti yeekiya yeehuwa si7ite!<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Enti yeekishe, Luhita pude keyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">Horonaymape duge wodhishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">dhayo waasuwa si7ana.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Issoy issoy, ‘Baqatite; hinte shempiw ashshite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">mela biittan de7iya Aro7eerada dummatite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">hinte shempuwa ashshite’ yaagana.<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />Neeni ne wolqaaninne ne duretethan ceeqetida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">neka di7etana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">Kamooshika ba kahinetaranne halaqatara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">di7etidi baana.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Goday odidaysada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">katama ubbaa dhayseysi yaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Issi katamika attenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">zangaaraynne demba ubbay dhayana.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Moo7abey paallidi attana mela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">qefe immite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">I katamay dhayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">laattiya asika demmenna.<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />Godaa oosuwa qeli gidi oothiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:10">uray baadetidaysa gido.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:10">Suuthu gussonna mela ba mashsha teqiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:10">uray baadetidaysa gido!<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />“Moo7abey yalagatethafe doomidi, injen de7ida asa mela; I hara biitta di7etibeenna. Moo7abey otope oton tigetonanne qaaxonna, mal7oy laametonnanne sawoy aggonna, uttidi de7ida woyne ushsha mela. <verse eid="JER 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />Taani otuwa gupanthesata kiittiya wodey yaana. Enti iya gussana; otuwape xiizo dhaysana; otuwa mentherethana. <verse eid="JER 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Isra7eele asay ba ammanetida, Beetelen de7iya eeqan kawuyidaysada Moo7abey ba xoossaa Kamooshan kawuyana.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />“Hinte, ‘Nu wolqaama asinne mino olancho’ gidi ayis ceeqetetii? <verse eid="JER 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />Heko, Moo7abeynne yan de7iya katamati dhayidosona. Iya yalaga adde nayti shukettanaw duge bidosona” yaagees, kawoy, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday. <verse eid="JER 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />Moo7abe dhayoy matatis; iya laaletetha wodey ellesidi gakis.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />Iya yuushuwan de7iya asay, iya gitatetha eriya ubbay, “Mino gidida kawotethaa xam7ay waanidi meqidee?” Bonchetida xam7ay waanidi tinchetidee? yaagidi zeleelite.<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />“Hinteno, Diboona kataman de7eysato, hinte boncho bessafe wodhidi, mela biittan uttite. Moo7abe dhayseysi hinte bolla yaana; hinte miixa ubbaa laallana. <verse eid="JER 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Aro7eera kataman de7eysato, oge doonan eqidi xeellite; kessi ekidi baqatiya addetanne maccasa, ‘Aybe keyday?’ yaagidi oychite. <verse eid="JER 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Enti, ‘Moo7abey kundida gisho kawuyis; iyaw yeekitenne zeleelite. Moo7abe dhaydaysa gisho Arnoona shaafa matan awaajite’ ” yaagidi zaarana.<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />“Gezzen de7iya Holona, Yaasa, Mefaata, <verse eid="JER 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />Diboona, Nabo, Beet-Dibilatayma, <verse eid="JER 48:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />Qiratayma, Beet-Gamula, Beet-Ma7oona, <verse eid="JER 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />Qiriyootanne, Baasora katamata bollanne mataninne haahon de7iya Moo7abe katamata bolla pirdi yis. <verse eid="JER 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />Moo7abe kacey qanxetis; iya qesey meqis.”<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />Godaa bolla otortida gisho, Moo7abe ushshidi mathoyite. Ba cooshshaa bolla gondoreto; asa ubbay iya bolla qelqiso. <verse eid="JER 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />Kase ne Isra7eele bolla qelqisabikii? Iyabaa haasaya wode kadhada huuphe qaathiday Isra7eeley kaysotara oyketida gishoyee? <verse eid="JER 48:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />Hinteno, Moo7aben de7eysato, katamape keydi, shucha hom7on de7ite. Aafo doonan baw keethe keexiya holle mela gidite. <verse eid="JER 48:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />Moo7abey daro otortis; Moo7abey ay mela ba ganna gabbisidaako, ceeqetiyako, otortiyako, ay mela bana dhoqu oothiyako, ta si7as. <verse eid="JER 48:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />Ta enta ceequwa erayis; shin aykoka maaddenna; enta otoroy aykoka oothenna. <verse eid="JER 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Hessa gisho, ta Moo7abes waassas; Qir-Hereesa asaas kayotada yeekayis.<verse eid="JER 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Hinteno, Sebama asaw, Ya7izeera asaas yeekeysafe aathada hintew yeekayis. Hinte tashey daayidi, Maxine Abbaa pinnidi, Ya7izeera gakida woyne mela; shin hinte woyne ayfiyanne wurcuwa bonqeysati yidi dhaysidosona. <verse eid="JER 48:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Ufaysinne Lo77obay ayfiya Moo7abe biittafe eketis. Woyne gum7iya bessaafe woyney goggonnaada teqas. Oonika ililishe woyne gum7enna. Si7etiya girsi de7ikoka ufaysa girsi gidenna.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />Enti Haseboonaninne Eliyaalan waassiya waasoy Yahaaxa gakanaw si7etees. Zo7aarape bidi Horonaymanne Eglaat-Shalisha gakanaw si7etees. Hari attoshin, Nimirima haathay melis.<verse eid="JER 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Taani Moo7abepe dhoqa bessatan goyinnesatanne banta xoossatas ixaane cuyiseyisata dhaysana.<verse eid="JER 48:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />“Enti kase demmida duretethay ha77i dhayida gisho, ta wozanay Moo7abesinne Qir-Hereesa asaas susul7eda yeekas. <verse eid="JER 48:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Enti banta huuphiyanne banta buuchaa meedidosona; banta kushiya qanxidi madunxisidosona; banta xeessan kayo ma7o dancidosona. <verse eid="JER 48:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Taani Moo7abe oonika koyonna otoda menthida gisho, Moo7abeta keethaa bollaninne dabaaban yeehope attishin, harabay baawa” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 48:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />Moo7abey aybi meqo meqide! Iya asay aybi waaso waassi! Moo7abe waani yeellatidi, ba zokuwa zaaridee? Hessa gisho, Moo7abey ba yuushuwan de7iya ubbaas miichasinne dagamas attis.<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />Arganthi ba qefiya miccidi yeysada morkey Moo7abe bolla yaana. <verse eid="JER 48:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Iya katamati oyketana; iya miixati eketana. He gallas Moo7abe mino olanchota wozanay iqethi oykida maccasa wozana mela un7etana. <verse eid="JER 48:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Moo7abe ta bolla makallida gisho dhayana; hizape guye kawotethi gididi deenna. <verse eid="JER 48:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Moo7abe asaw, yashshi, olinne xihey hintena naagees. <verse eid="JER 48:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />Daganthiyabaape baqatiya oonika ollan kundana; ollafe keyiya oonika xihen oyketana. Taani Moo7abe seeriya wode hessa oothana.<verse eid="JER 48:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />“Baqatidi bidaysati wolqa dhayidi, Haseboona katama kuyan eqidosona. Haseboona katamaape Tami, kawoy Sihooney de7ida keethaafe lacoy keyidi, Moo7abe biittanne yan de7iya makallancho asaa mis. <verse eid="JER 48:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Moo7abe asaw, hintena ayye! Kamoosha geetetiya eeqa xoossaa goyinneysati dhayidosona; enta adde naytinne macca nayti di7etidi bidosona. <verse eid="JER 48:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />Gidoshin, wursethan taani Moo7abe zaarada oorathana” yaagees Goday.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:47">Moo7abe bolla odetida pirday haysan wuris.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s1">Amoones Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />Amoonebaa Goday haysada yaagees; “Isra7eeles adde na7i baawee? Iya laattey baawee? Yaatin, Moloka geetetiya eeqa xoossaa goyinniya asati Gaade biitta ayis oykidona? Enta kataman ayis uttidona? <verse eid="JER 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Amoone biittan Raaba katamaa bolla ola waasoy si7etana mela ta oothana wodey yaana. He katamay laaletidi baysa gidana. Iya yuushuwan de7iya gutati taman xuugetana. Isra7eeley bana ba biittafe gooddidaysata gooddana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />“Haseboona asaw, Gaye katamay laaletida gisho zeleelite. Raaba asaw, yeekite; kayo ma7o ma7idi kayotite; katamaa gimbiya giddon woxeretite. Hinte xoossay Moloki ba kahinetaranne ba halaqatara di7etis. <verse eid="JER 49:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Ammanoy bayna asaw, ‘Nuna olanay oonee?’ yaagidi hinte duretethaaninne hinte aradda zangaaratan ayis ceeqetetii? <verse eid="JER 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Ta ne yuushuwan de7eysati nena daganthana mela oothana” yaagees Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossay. Hinte ubbay keyidi baqatana gisho baqatidi bidaysata shiishiya asi dhayana.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />“Gidoshin, wursethan ta Amoone asaa zaarada oorathana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoomes Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />Edoomeba Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees; “Temaana asaas de7iya cincatethay aw bidee? Zoreysatape zorey dhayidee? Enta cincatethay entafe eketidee? <verse eid="JER 49:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Taani Eesawe kochaa seeriya wode iya bolla dhayo ehana gisho, Dadaanen de7eysato, baqatidi aafon qosetite. <verse eid="JER 49:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Woyne maxeysati poshile ashshokona? Kaysoti qamma geliko, bantaw koyaba xalaala ekokona? <verse eid="JER 49:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Shin ta Eesawa kochaa qaarada kallo ashshana; enti qosetanaw danda7onna mela, enti qosetiya bessa qaarada qonce bessi oothana. Eesawe sheeshay, iya dabbotinne iya shooroti ubbay dhayana; entafe issoyka attenna. <verse eid="JER 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />Hinte giddon de7iya yi7o nayta aggaagite; enta ta dichana. Hinte am7etika tanan ammaneto” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />Goday haysada yaagees; “Hiza seera ekanaw bessonna asas seeretethi attonnaba gidiko, hinte waanidi seerettonna attanee? Tuma hinteka seera xuu7ape uyeetape attishin, coo atteketa. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />Baasora katamay baysa gididi attana; iya be7ida asa ubbaas dagamas, qelqisethasinne baadethas attana. Iya yuushuwan de7iya guta ubbay merinaw laaletidi attana. Haysa taani ta sunthan caaqayis” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Taani Godaape yida issi kiita si7as. Kawotethata giddo kiitetidaysi, “Edoome teqanaw shiiqite; iyara oletanaw dendite” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />“Hiza, ta nena kawotethata giddon guuthana; asaa giddon kadhetida asi oothana. <verse eid="JER 49:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Shucha qophoninne dere bolla de7eyso, ne daganthoynne ne otoroy nena cimmis. Ne keethaa arganthada dhoqan keexikoka, ta nena yaape duge wodhisana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />“Edoomey ase daganthiya biitta gidana. Yaara aadhiya asa ubbay iya dhayuwa be7idi, dagammana; malaaletana. <verse eid="JER 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" />Soodomeynne Gamoori banta yuushuwan de7iya katamatara dhayiya wode hanidaysada oonika yan deenna; asi yan uttenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />“Yordaanose shaafa lanqen de7iya woraape dorsati heemetiya lo77o qooroy de7iya bessaa, qoponna keyiya gaammoda, ta Edoome asata qoponna enta biittafe yedethana. Ta doorida asi iya bolla shuumana. Ta meli oonee? Ta oothana gidaba teqanaw danda7ey oonee? Taara eqetanaw danda7iya henthanchoy oonee?<verse eid="JER 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />“Ta Edoome bollanne Temaana katamaa bolla oothanaw halchidabanne qopidaba si7ite. Enta nayta wolqan goochidi efana; hessa gaason enta soo asay dagammana. <verse eid="JER 49:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Edoome kundethaa girsay biitta qaathana; Edoometa waasoy Zo7o Abbaa gakanaw si7etana. <verse eid="JER 49:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Arganthi ba qefiya miccidi duge paallidi yeysada, morkey Baasora bolla yaana. He wode Edoome olanchoti iqethi oykida maccasada hirgana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Damasqos Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />Damasqoba Goday haysada yaagees; “Iita oda si7ida gisho, Hamaatanne Arfada katamatan de7iya asay yeellatis; yayyis. Zuley shocida abbada enta wozanay shempo demmanaw danda7ibeenna. <verse eid="JER 49:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Damasqoy daaburis; enti dagaman kokoridi baqatidosona; maccas iqethi oykeysada metoynne un7i enta oykis. <verse eid="JER 49:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Ufaysi kumida eretida katamay waanidi baysa gididee? <verse eid="JER 49:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />He wode he kataman de7iya yalaga addeti katamaa giddo ogetan hayqana; olanchoti ubbay wurana. <verse eid="JER 49:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />Taani Damasqo katama dirsa gimbiyan tama yeddana; he tamay Wolde-Adara miixa maana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qedaaresinne Haxooras Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori olidi xoonida Qedaarenne Haxoora kawotethatabaa Goday haysada yaagees; “Dendidi, Qedaare asaa olite; doloha baggara de7iya asaa wursite. <verse eid="JER 49:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Enta dunkaanetanne enta wudeta ekite. Enta gesheta, enta shaluwanne enta gimaleta ekite. Yaatidi entaw, ‘Hinte yuushuwan dagami de7ees’ yaagidi odite. <verse eid="JER 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />Haxooran de7eysato, Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori hinte bolla iitabaa oothanaw maqetidi uttida gisho, baqatite; aafon qosetite” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />“Dendada; hirgi bayna saro de7iya kawotethata ola. Enta katama gimbiyas ibithi woyko kobey baawa; enti bantarka de7oosona.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />“Enta gimaleti bonqetana; enta wudey di7etana. Banta huuphiya gaxaa meedeyisata carkon laallana; ta ubba bessara enta bolla dhayo ehana. <verse eid="JER 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />Haxoori merinaw workanati de7iya mela biitta gidana. Oonika yan deenna; asi yan uttenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elaamas Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Yihuda kawoy Sedeqiyaasi koyro kawotida wode, Elaamaba Godaape Ermiyaasako yida qaalay haysa; <verse eid="JER 49:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees; “Elaamas wolqa gidida donge dukiya asata ta wodhana. <verse eid="JER 49:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Ubba bessara ta Elama bolla carko ehana; enta he carkuwan laallana. Hessa gisho, Elama asay laaletidi gakonna biitti deenna. <verse eid="JER 49:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Enta morketa sinthaninne enta wodhanaw koyeyisata sinthan ta Elama daganthana. Ta gita hanquwan enta bolla dhayo ehana. Ta enta dhaysana gakanaw mashshan yedethana. <verse eid="JER 49:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Taani Elama kawanne enta halaqata dhaysada ta araata yan wothana. <verse eid="JER 49:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />Gidoshin, wursetha wode taani Elama zaarada oorathana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s1">Babiloones Odetida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />Babiloonenne Babiloone asaaba nabiya Ermiyaasa baggara Goday odida qaalay haysa: <verse eid="JER 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Kawotethata giddon oditenne awaajite. Bandira dhoqu oothi oykidi, aykoka qosonna, haysada yaagidi odite. ‘Babilooney kundis! Beella geetetiya eeqay yeellatis; Marduka geetetiya eeqay kawuyis. Iya misileti yeellatidosona; iya eeqati kawuyidosona. <verse eid="JER 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />Pudeha baggafe issi kawotethi yidi, Babiloone biitta dhaysana. Asaynne mehey baqatana; oonika yan deenna’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />“He wodenne he gallas Isra7eeleynne Yihudi issife yeekishe yidi Godaa banta Xoossaa koyana. <verse eid="JER 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Enti Xiyoone efiya ogiya oychana; banta som7uwa yaa zaarana. Enti, polo dogetonna merina caaquwan Godaara” oyketana.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />“Ta asay dhayida dorsa mela; enta henthanchoti enta balethidi, zuma bolla guye yeddidosona. Issi zumaape hara zumaa bolla toylatidi banta girbiya dogidosona. <verse eid="JER 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Demmida ubbay enta shankatis. Enta morketi, ‘Nu aykoka balibooko; ha metoy enta gakiday, enti Godaa, banta shempo bessaa, banta mayzata ufaysa bolla nagara oothida gishosa.’<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />“Isra7eele asaw, Babiloonepe baqatite; Babiloone biittafe keyite; wude kaalethiya kole deesha mela gidite. <verse eid="JER 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Taani pudeha baggafe gita kawotethata cugaa denthada, Babiloone bolla ehana hanayis. Enti iya olidi oykana; enta dongey dukidi, balonna olancho mela. <verse eid="JER 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Babilooney bonqetana; iya bonqiya ubbay kallana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />Babiloone asaw, ta asaa bonqeysato, hinte ufaytidi hashshu gideta. Qooron kallida ussada peenuqideta; korma parada caagideta. <verse eid="JER 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />Shin ha77i hinte gita katamay yeellatananne kawuyana. Kawotethata giddon Babilooney ubbaafe laafa gidana; haathi bayna mela biitta gidana. <verse eid="JER 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />Godaa hanquwa gaason, Babilooney dhayana; laaletana. Iya matara aadhiya ubbay iya bolla gakida bosha be7idi, dagammananne malaaletana.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />“Donge dukeysato, Babiloone olanaw iya yuushuwan salpite; I Godaa bolla nagara oothida gisho hinte dongiyan iya dukite. <verse eid="JER 50:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Ubba baggara Babiloone bolla ola waaso waassite; Babilooney kushe immis; iya gimbeti kundidosona; iya gimbe dirsay laaletis. Goday iya bolla halo keyishe de7iya gisho, hinte iya bolla halo keyite. I harata bolla oothidaba hinteka iya bolla oothite. <verse eid="JER 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Zerethi zereysanne caka wode baacara keyeysa Babiloonepe dhaysite. Dhayseysata mashshaa yayyida gisho, he biittan de7iya asa ubbay ba yaraako yaraako simmidi ba biitta biitta baqatana.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />“Isra7eeley gaammoy yedethidi laallida dorsaa mela. Koyro Asoore kawoy iya ashuwa mis; wursethan Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori iya meqethaa dhoggis.”<verse eid="JER 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Hessa gisho, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay, “Asoore kawa ta seeridaysada Babiloone kawanne iya biitta seerana. <verse eid="JER 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Shin Isra7eele, iya hentha bessaa zaarana; Qarmeloosanne Baasane Deretan I heemetana. I Efreemanne Galada gezze biittan kallidi maana. <verse eid="JER 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />He wode, hayqope ta ashshida Isra7eele asaa nagaraa ta atto gana gisho, asay Isra7eelen nagara koyana, shin demmokona. Yihudan nagara koyana, shin bentenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />“Miraatayma biittaninne Piqodan de7iya asaa bolla dendidi enta olite; wodhite; enta polo dhaysite. Ta hintena kiittiya ubbaa oothite” yaagees Goday. <verse eid="JER 50:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Biitta bolla ola waasoy si7etees; gita dhayoy gakis. <verse eid="JER 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Biitta ubbaa liiqisiya naariqay waanidi meqide! Waanidi liiqide! Kawotethata ubbaa giddon Babilooney waanidi daganthiyaba gidide! <verse eid="JER 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Neno, Babiloone, ta nena oykanaw xihe wothas; neeni eronnashin gelada oyketadasa. Neeni Godaara eqetida gisho oyketadasa. <verse eid="JER 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />Taani ta ola miishiya wothiya keethaa dooyada, ta yiluwan ola miishiya yaape kessas. Hessa oothiday, Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Babiloone biittan oothiya oosoy de7iya gishosa. <verse eid="JER 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Yaara haara iya bolla dendite; kathay de7iya iya shaaliya dooyite; di7uwa kathada doorite; Aybibaaka ashshona wursidi dhaysite. <verse eid="JER 50:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Booru shukeysada enta olanchota wodhite. Babiloone asay seeretiya wodey gakida gisho enta ayye!<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />“Di7etida asay Babiloonepe kessi ekidi, Yerusalaame baqatana. Babiloone asay Xoossa keethaa bolla oothidabaas Goday, enta Xoossay halo keyanaysa enti Xiyoonen odana. <verse eid="JER 50:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />Babiloone olanaw donge dukiya ubbaa xeegite; issoyka kessi ekonnaada iya yuushuwa teqo. Godaa bolla, Isra7eele Geeshsha bolla, I otortida gisho, iya oosuwada iyaw zaarite. I harata bolla oothidaysada iya bolla oothite. <verse eid="JER 50:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Hessa gisho, iya yalaga addeti katamaa giddo ogiyan hayqana; he gallas iya olanchoti ubbay dhayana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />Goday, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, “Neeni seeretiya wodey gakida gisho, neno, otoranchuwaw, ta ne bolla dendas. <verse eid="JER 50:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Otoranchoy dhubetidi kundana; iya denthiya asi deenna. Ta iya katamata taman oythana; he tamay yuushuwan de7iya ubba dhaysana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “Isra7eele asaynne Yihuda asay un7etidosona. Enta di77idi efidaysati enta minthidi oykidosona; enta yeddenaw koybookona. <verse eid="JER 50:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Shin enta Wozeysi mino; iya sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa. I, enta biittas shempo immanaw enta gisho mootetees. Shin Babiloone biittan de7eyisata bolla dagama yeddana. <verse eid="JER 50:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />Babilooney, Babiloonen de7eysati, iya halaqatinne iya cincati mashshan hayqana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />“Iya eeya wordo nabeti mashshan hayqonna. Dagammiya iya wolqaama olanchoti mashshan hayqana. <verse eid="JER 50:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Iya parata bolla, iya para gaareta bollanne maccasa mela gidida iya allaga olanchota bolla mashshi yo. Iya shaluwa minjiya keethaa bolla mashshi yo; iya buqura ubbay bonqetana. <verse eid="JER 50:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Babiloonen eeqi kumida gishonne dagamman kokoriya eeqati de7iya gisho; iya haathay melo; iya bolla koshi yo.<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />“Hessa gisho, Babilooney bazzo do7atinne workanati de7iya bessi gidana; qassi yanchoti yan daana. Yan merinaw asi deenna; yeletaape yeleta gakanaw asi de7iya bessi gidenna. <verse eid="JER 50:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" />Xoossay beni Soodomenne Gamoora enta yuushuwan de7iya katamatara dhaysidaysada Babiloonen oonika deenna; asi yan uttenna” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />“Heko, asay pudeha baggafe yaana; mino kawotethatinne daro kawoti sa7aa gaxape yaanaw dendidosona. <verse eid="JER 50:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Enti banta dongiyanne toora oykidosona; enti wozana minonne yeddi maaronna asi. Enti banta para toggidi biya wode, beetay shociya abba guunthada hanees. Neno, Babiloone, enti ubbay olas giigida asi gididi ne bolla salpidosona.<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />“Babiloone kawoy hessa si7iya wode iya kushey daaburidi silis; iqethi oykida maccasada un7etis.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />“Yordaanose shaafa lanqen de7iya woraape, lo77o qooroy de7iya bessafe qoponna keyiya gaammoda, ta yada, Babiloone asaa enta biittafe yedethana. Hessafe guye, ta doorida asi iya bolla shuumana; yaatin ta meli oonee? Ta oothana gidaba teqanay oonee? Ay henthanchoy taara eqetanaw danda7ii? <verse eid="JER 50:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Hessa gisho, Goday Babiloone bollanne Babiloone biitta bolla halchidabanne qopidaba si7ite. Enta nayta wolqan goochidi efana; hessa gaason enta soo asa ubbay dagammana. <verse eid="JER 50:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Babiloone kundethaa girsay biitta qaathana; Babiloone waasoy kawotethata ubban si7etana” yaagees.<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />Babiloone asaanne Babiloone biitta dhaysiya carko kiittana. <verse eid="JER 51:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Taani Babiloone bolla carkoda punniya allagata kiittana. Iya dhayuwa gallas enti ubba bessara iya un7ethana. <verse eid="JER 51:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Iya olanchoti dongiya dukana gakanaw woyko banta ola miishiya dancana gakanaw naagopite. Iya yalaga addetas mishetopite; iya olanchota polo dhaysite. <verse eid="JER 51:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Enti Babiloone biittan shuketana; I dabaaban cadetidi kundana. <verse eid="JER 51:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />Enti biitta nagaran kunthikoka, Xoossay, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Geeshshay, Isra7eelenne Yihuda am7ida yeggidi aggibeenna. <verse eid="JER 51:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />Babiloonepe baqatite; issoy issoy ba shempuwa ashsho. I oothida nagaraa gaason hinte wuropite. Ha wodey taani Goday halo keyiya wode. <verse eid="JER 51:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />Babilooney sa7an de7iya asa ubbay uyidi mathotiya, woyne ushshi tigetiya, ta kushen de7iya worqa wanca mela. Kawotethati ubbay he woyne ushsha uyidi gooyidosona. <verse eid="JER 51:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babilooney qoponna kundidi meqis. Hessa gisho, iyaw yeekite; I paxaneko ooni eri iya madunthaas dhale immite. <verse eid="JER 51:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />Babiloonen de7iya allaga asay, “Nu Babiloone pathanaw koyida; shin paxanaw danda7ibeenna. Iya pirday haakidi salo gakida gishonne shaara gakanaw dhoqu gida gisho iya aggidi nu biitta simmoos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />Isra7eele asay, “Goday nuus pirdida gisho, Xiyoone bidi, Goday nu Xoossay oothidaba odana” yaagana.<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />“Goday Babiloone dhaysanaw qofa qachida gisho, Meedona kawota denthis. I ba keethaa gisho halo keyanaw qopis. Meedona halaqati, ‘Donge toora leefite; gondalle oykite. <verse eid="JER 51:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Babiloone bolla ola bandira denthite; minthidi naagite. Wocheyisata enta bessan bessan wothite; zugidi caddiya olanchota giigisite’ ” yaagidosona. Goday Babiloone asa bolla qopidabaanne ba gida ba oothana.<verse eid="JER 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />Babiloone, neeni daro shaafatinne duretethi kumida biitta, shin ne wursethay gakis; neeni bessonna ogen shiishiya go77ay attis. <verse eid="JER 51:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, “Booley biitta kumeysada taani asaa ne biittan kunthana; enti nena xoonida ufaysan banta qaala dhoqu oothidi ne bolla gayrana” yaagidi ba sunthan caaqis.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />Goday ba wolqan sa7aa medhis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">ba cincatethan biitta baasis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">salota ba akeekan miccis.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />I kiittiya wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">salon de7iya haathati guummoosona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Shaarata sa7aa gaxape ehees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">iri bukiya wode wol7anthi wol7amees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">ba minja bessaafe carkuwa kessees.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />Asi ubbay eeyanne akeeki baynaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">enta misileti wordonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">shempoy baynayisata gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">worqaa sheeshidi eeqa medheysati yeellatidosona.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />He misileti pathonaysatanne kedhetidaysata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:18">enta bolla Xoossay pirdiya wode enti dhayana.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Shin Yayqooba Xoossay enta mela gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">ubbaba medhiday iya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">I baw doorida kochay Isra7eele asaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">iya sunthay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Naariqa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />“Babiloone, ne ta naariqanne ta ola miishe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">Nena go7etada taani biittata mentherethas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">kawotethata dhaysas.<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />Nena go7etada paratanne para toggeyisata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:21">para gaaretanne enta laaggeyisata mentherethas.<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />Nena go7etada maccanne adde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">cimanne nayta panthinne geela7o mentherethas.<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />Henthanchuwanne iya wudiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">goyeysanne iya waatha boorata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">deriya haareysatanne halaqata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">nena go7etada mentherethas” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />“Babilooneynne Babiloone asay Xiyoone bolla oothida iita oosuwa gisho hinte xeellishin ta halo keyana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 51:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />“Neno, Babiloone, ne biitta dhaysiya zuma mela; shin ta Goday nena ixas. Taani ta kushiya yeddada, nena zumaa bollafe duge gondorsana; neeni xuugetida zuma gidada attana. <verse eid="JER 51:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />Neepe baason yeggiya woyko gimbees eketiya shuchi deenna; ne merinaw baysa gidana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />“Babiloone bolla ola bandira denthite; asa giddon moyze punnite. Iya olanaw asaa ubbaa giigisite; Araraate, Minanne Askanaaza kawotethata xeegite. Ola halaqata shuumite; boole mela daro parata ehite. <verse eid="JER 51:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Babiloone olanaw kawotethata ubbaa giigisite; Meedona kawota, enta halaqata, deriya haareysatanne enti haariya biitta asa ubbaa denthite.<verse eid="JER 51:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />“Babilooney oonika doonna baysa oothanaw Goday halchida halchuwa poliya gisho, biitta ubbay kokoresinne porqatees. <verse eid="JER 51:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Babiloone olanchoti ola aggidi, banta miixan uttidosona. Enta wolqay laafin, maccasa mela gididosona. Enta keethati xuugetidosona; katama pengiya kobe mithati meqidosona. <verse eid="JER 51:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Ha gaxape hini gaxa gakanaw, katamay morken oyketidaysa Babiloone kawas odanaw, woxeysi woxeysa kaallidi, kiitetidaysi kiitetidaysa kaallidi boosona. <verse eid="JER 51:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />Shaafara pinniya bessati oyketidaysa, haatha gaxan de7iya woray xuugetidaysanne olanchoti dagammidaysa enti kawas odanaw woxoosona” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 51:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />“Babiloone biittay kathi bukiya wudumma gidana; guutha wodepe guye I caketiya wodey yaana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay.<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday Isra7eele Maaddana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori nuna wursidi mis; nu katamaa kaysa oto kessis. Dawey mitteysada iya mittis; mal7oba midi kuntheysada I nu shaluwan ba ganjiya kunthis; attidaysa mucidi cuttis. <verse eid="JER 51:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Xiyooney, “Babilooney nu bolla oothida iitaba ubbay iya bolla simmo” yaagosona. Yerusalaamey, “Nu suuthaa acoy Babiloone asa oyko” yaagosona.<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Hessa gisho, Goday Yerusalaame asaa haysada yaagees: “Ta ne gisho mootetana; ne haluwa ta keyana. Taani Babiloone haathaanne pultota melisana. <verse eid="JER 51:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Babilooney laaletha doorenne workanati gupiya bessi gidana. Iya be7iya ubbay dagammananne qelqisana; yan issi asika deenna. <verse eid="JER 51:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />Babiloone asa ubbay gaammoda gudoosona; gaammo marada daarosona. <verse eid="JER 51:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Enta asatethay ho77iya wode, ta entaw ushsha gibira giigisana. Enti mathotana gakanaw ta enta ushshana; enti zaaridi dendonna mela merinaw dhiskana” yaagees Goday. <verse eid="JER 51:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />Shukanaw efiya urgeda, marazedanne koleda taani enta shuka bessi efana.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />“Asa ubbay sabbiya Babilooney waanidi oyketide! Babilooney kawotethata giddon waanidi daganthiyaba gidide! <verse eid="JER 51:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Babiloone morketi abba beetay dendeysada dendidi kataman eellidosona. <verse eid="JER 51:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Iya katamati laaletidi, daganthiyaba gididosona; haathi bayna mela biitta daanidosona; asi doonna bessinne oonika kanthidi aadhona bessi gididosona. <verse eid="JER 51:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Beella geetetiya Babiloone eeqa ta seerana; I mittidaba iya uluwape kessana. Hizape guye, kawotethati iyako goggeysa aggana; Babiloone gimbey kundana.<verse eid="JER 51:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />“Ta asaw, iya giddofe keyite! Hinte, Godaa hanqo suuluwape hintena ashshite! <verse eid="JER 51:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Biittan odetiya odaa si7iya wode ufaysi qanxofitenne yayyofite. Laythan laythan odi kaallidi kaallidi yaana. He wode kawoy kawa bolla dendiya makalla odi biittan si7etana.”<verse eid="JER 51:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />“Hessa gisho, taani Babiloone eeqa misileta seeriya gallasi yaana. Biitta ubbay yeellatana; hayqidaysati ubbay katamaa giddon kundana. <verse eid="JER 51:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />Pudeha baggafe yaana dhayseysata kushen Babilooney geliya wode saloninne sa7an de7iya ubbabay ililana. <verse eid="JER 51:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />Babilooney, Isra7eele asaanne sa7an de7iya asa ubbaa wodhidaysada Babiloone asay hayqanaw koshshees. <verse eid="JER 51:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Ta asaw, olape kessi ekidaysato, biite; haysan eqofite. Hinte de7iya haaho biittan tana Godaa hassayite; Yerusalaame qopite.”<verse eid="JER 51:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />Hinte, “Nuuni cayetida gisho kawuyida; allagati Xoossa keethan de7iya geeshsha bessata gelida gisho, nu yeella ma7ida” yaagideta.<verse eid="JER 51:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />Shin “Taani Goday Babiloone eeqata seeriya wodey yaana. Madunxidaysati biitta ubban oolana. <verse eid="JER 51:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Babilooney salo pude keyidi, yan miixa medhanaw danda7iyakoka, yaa gakanaw keyidi, iya yan dhaysiya asi taani kiittana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />“Babiloonen waasoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">Babiloone biittan gita dhayo girsi si7etana.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />Goday Babiloone dhaysana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">iya wolqaama girsa si77i oothana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Abba beetada guummiya morketi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">olishe ceeqetana.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Dhayseysati Babiloone bolla yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">iya olanchoti oyketana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">enta dongey meqana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Taani Goday halo keyiya Xoosse gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">enta oosuwada entaw zaarana.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Iya halaqata, iya cinca asata, iya deriya haareyisata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">iya toora moconatanne iya olanchota mathoyana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">Enti zaaridi dendonna mela merinaw dhiskana”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">Taani kawoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa geeteteysi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">haysa odayis.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />“Gita Babiloone gimbey kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">iya adussa pengeti taman xuugetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Asay oothidaba ubbay hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">kawotethati daaburiyabay tamasa” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Maseya na7aa, Neera na7ay Sarayi kawa Sedeqiyaasa shuuma. Sedeqiyaasi Yihudan kawotida oyddantho laythan, Sarayi iyara Babiloone biya wode Ermiyaasi Saraya bolla kiita yeddis. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Babiloone bolla gakanaw de7iya iitaba ubbaanne Babiloone xeelliya haraba ubbaa Ermiyaasi maxaafan xaafis. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Sarayako, “Neeni Babiloone gakida wode ne qaala dhoqu oothada asaas ha maxaafa nabbaba. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Qassi haysada yaagada woossa: ‘Abeeti Godaw, neeni ha bessaa dhaysana; ha bessan shempora de7iya medhetethi, asinne mehey deenna; ha bessay merinaw mela biitta gidana’ yaaga. <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" />Ha maxaafa nabbaba wursidaape guye, maxaafa shuchara gatha qachada, Efraxiisa shaafan hola. <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />Taani Goday iya bolla ehiya dhayuwa gaason, Babilooney zaaridi dendonna mela haysada muuketana” yaaga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Ermiyaasi odida qaalay haysan wuris.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Kundethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:18-25:7">2 Kawo 24:18—25:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:1-10">Ermi 39:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Sedeqiyaasi kawotiya wode, iyaw laythi laatamanne issino; I Yerusalaamen tammanne issi laythi kawotis. Iya aaye sunthay Amxaalo; iya Libina kataman de7iya Ermiyaasa na7a. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />Iyo7aqeemi oothidaysada Sedeqiyaasi Godaa sinthan iitabaa oothis. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Goday Yerusalaame bollanne Yihuda bolla hanqetida gisho enta ba sinthafe diggis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Sedeqiyaasi Babiloone kawa bolla makallis. <verse eid="JER 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" />Sedeqiyaasi kawotida uddufuntho laythan, tammantho ageenan, tammantho gallasan Babiloone kawoy Nabukadanaxoori ba olanchota ubbaa ekidi, Yerusalaame teqis. Enti iya yuushuwan biitta dooridosona. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Sedeqiyaasi kawotida tammanne issintho laythi gakanaw, Yerusalaamey teqetidi gam7is.<verse eid="JER 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />He laythi oyddantho ageenan, uddufuntho gallasan, koshi suullin, asay miyaba dhayis. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Katama gimbey issi baggara meqis. Babiloone asay katamaa yuushuwa naagikoka, Yihuda kawa olanchoti ubbay qamma kawo atakilte bessaa efiya ogiya oykidi, nam7u dirsaa gimbeta issife gathiya pengiyara keyidi baqatidosona. Enti Yordaanose zangaarako simmidi bidosona. <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Shin Babiloone olanchoti kawa Sedeqiyaasa yedethidi, Iyaarko demba gathishe oykidosona. Iya olanchoti ubbay iya kaddidi laaletidosona. <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />Hessafe guye, iya Hamaata biittan, Irbila kataman de7iya Babiloone kawako efidosona. Yan Nabukadanaxoori Sedeqiyaasa bolla pirdis. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Sedeqiyaasa adde nayta Sedeqiyaasi xeellishin, Babiloone kawoy wodhis. Yihuda halaqata ubbaa yan Irbila kataman wodhidosona. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" />Sedeqiyaasa ayfeta woocidi, santhalaatan qachidi, Babiloone efidosona. I hayqana gakanaw, yan qasho keethan iya wothidosona.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />Nabukadanaxoori Babiloonen kawotida tammanne uddufuntho laythan, ichashantho ageenan, tammantho gallasan, kawa moorinnay, kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani Yerusalaame gelis. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />Xoossa keethaa, kawo gadhonne Yerusalaamen de7iya keethata ubbaa taman xuuggis; qassi gita keethata ubbaa xuuggis. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Babiloone olanchoti ubbay kawa naageysata halaqaa kiitan, Yerusalaame katamaa yuushuwan de7iya dirsa gimbiya ubbaa laallidosona. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Nabuzardaani guutha manqota, kataman attida asata, kaddidi Babiloone olanchotan gelida asatanne kushe hiillanchota di77idi Babiloone efis. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Shin Nabuzardaani manqotape guutha asaa woyne tokanaadanne gade goyanaada Yihudan aggis.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />Babilooneti Xoossa keetha karen eqida naase birata tuuqeta, caana gaaretanne gita kereta mentherethidi, naase birata ubbaa Babiloone efidosona. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Kereta, akaafata, xompe shaluwa xeera pittiyabata, xaarota, ixaane saanetanne yarsho wode go7etiya naase birata miisheta ubbaa efidosona. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani worqafenne birape oosetida disteta, tama ekiya miisheta, xaarota, laafa kereta, xompe wothiya kocata, ixaane saanetanne ushsha yarshos go7etiya otota efis. <verse eid="JER 52:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Kawoy Solomoney Xoossa keethan oosetiyabas medhida nam7u tuussati, gita kereta, tammanne nam7u kormata misiletinne caana gaareti medhetida naase biratati mizaanen likanaw danda7etenna. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Nam7u tuussati issi mela gididi, issoy issoy tammanne hospun wadha adusse. Enta ubbay tammanne nam7u wadha. Entaw giddoy kaysi gididi, biratay oyddu biradhe keena orde. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Nam7u tuussata huuphiyan naasepe oosetida gumboti de7oosona. Issi gumbuwa geesay ichashu wadha gididi, yuushoy gite misileninne oromaane misilen alleeqetidi uttis. Nam7antho gumboyka iya mela. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Gumbotas miyen miyen de7iya oromaaneta misileti uddufun tammanne usupuna; yuushuwan de7iya gite misiletape bolla baggara de7iya oromaane misileti issi xeeta.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Asay Babiloone Di7etis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:18-21">2 Kawo 25:18-21</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:27-30">27-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani kahine halaqaa Saraya, iya kaalliya kahiniya Sofoniyaasanne penge naagiya heedzu asata oykis. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Kataman de7iya asaape toora mocona, kawa zoreysatape laapun asata efis. Toora mocona, xaafiya, asaa olanchota dooriya halaqanne hara usupun tammu asata efis. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Nabuzardaani enta ubbaa ekidi, Babiloone kawako, Irbila katamaa efis. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Hamaata biittan, Irbila kataman, Babiloone kawoy enta ubbaa wodhisis. Hessada hanidi, Yihuda asay banta biittafe di7etidi bidosona.<verse eid="JER 52:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" />Nabukadanaxoori kawotida laapuntho laythan, heedzu mukulunne laatamanne heedzu asay Yihudape di7etis. <verse eid="JER 52:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />Tammanne hospuntho laythan hospun xeetanne hastamanne nam7u asay Yerusalaamepe di7etis. <verse eid="JER 52:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />Nabukadanaxoori kawotida laatamanne heedzantho laythan kawa naageysata halaqay Nabuzardaani laapun xeetanne oytamanne ichashu asaa di77is. Di7etida asa tayboy oyddu mukulunne usupun xeeta.<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yo7akina Biletetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Yo7akini di7etida hastamanne laapuntha laythan, tammanne nam7antho ageenan, laatamanne ichashantho gallasan, Yoor-Marodaaki kawotida laythi Yihuda kawa Yo7akina bonchidi, qashope birshis. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Yoor-Marodaaki Yo7akinara mal7o qaala odetidi, Babiloonen di7on de7iya hara kawota ubbaafe aathidi iya bonchis. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Hessa gisho, Yo7akini qasho keethan ma7iya ma7uwa laammidi, ba de7o laytha ubban kawo gaytape mishe de7is. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Yo7akini hayqana gakanaw, gallas gallas iyaw koshshiyaba ubbaa Babiloone kawoy immis.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>